    },
    {
        "review": "You can feel safe knowing the remaining battery power in numbers.The case is equipped with an LED digital display, so you can see at a glance how much battery life you have left. Being able to prevent the situation where you want to use the battery but it doesn't charge is a huge benefit in everyday use. Long playback time of 50 hours The stamina of up to 50 hours including the main unit and the case is excellent. If you use it for daily commuting to work, school, or the gym, you can use it with plenty of time even if you charge it once a week. Stable connection and clear calls Since it uses Bluetooth 5.3, the sound is stable with little skipping even in crowded places such as station platforms. In addition, ENC (Environmental Noise Cancelling) suppresses surrounding noise, making it easier for the other party to hear you when talking outdoors. Perfect fit for sports Designed for use during exercise, with a high degree of fixation on the ears. It won't slip off even during intense movements, so you can concentrate on running or working out."
    },
