        "review": "I needed a good pair of earphones for when I go running. I have the ones you just stick in your ear for the gym but needed something a little more secure for running and these are IT! They charge pretty quickly but the battery life is amazing. They fit very well and are comfortable and secure. The sound quality is chef kiss. I really like that you can charge them in the case as well !"
