    },
    {
        "review": "So ya, not really a big earbuds person but I had to get some wireless earbuds for work.  Went with these earbuds for a couple of reasons:  1.) I can use only one earbud if necessary and I can still access all the necessary functions with only one earbud.  Some brands that I bought require you to use both earbuds (i.e. left earbud allows you to answer calls and right earbud allows you to hang up calls) which I wasn't a fan of.  2.) the loop that goes around the ear is really sturdy.  At first it looked a bit bulky but its really snuck if I jump or walk or run.  Overall, you can't beat them for the price and the charge on the earbuds last really long.  Overall, if you're looking for a cheap pair of earbuds that does the job, these are the ones!"
