    {
        "review": "The Bluetooth 5.4 connection is fast and stable, they paired with my phone in a matter of seconds and I have had no problems disconnecting.The sound quality surprised me, especially the bass, which is deep without optaning the voices. I also liked that the calls are heard clearly thanks to the noise-canceling microphone.The LED screen of the case is very useful because it allows you to easily see the battery level. In addition, the headphones are comfortable and I can use them for several hours without discomfort. The waterproof design also gives me peace of mind to use them when I exercise or walk under a drizzle.In general, I think they offer excellent value for money. I would recommend them to anyone looking for wireless headphones with good sound, good battery life and reliable operation."
