        "review": "I'm very satisfied. They connect quickly via Bluetooth, have a clear sound and good volume. They are comfortable, light and the battery lasts a long time. In addition, the case is practical and easy to carry. For the price, they have excellent quality. I totally recommend them! ❤️"
