    {
        "review": "Title: Good sound and convenient charging caseI’ve been using these wireless earbuds and overall I’m happy with them. They are lightweight and comfortable to wear, and the charging case is compact and easy to carry around.The Bluetooth connection is simple to set up, and the sound quality is good for everyday use. I also like the digital display on the case because it makes it easy to see the remaining battery level.For the price, I think these earbuds are a good option for listening to music, watching videos, or making calls."
    },
    {
        "review": "I’m really happy with these earbuds. They’re easy to connect, comfortable to wear, and the sound quality is better than I expected for the price. I also really like the charging case with the battery display because it makes it easy to know how much charge is left. Great value for the money and I would definitely recommend them!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I really liked these headphones. The Bluetooth 5.4 connection is fast and stable, and the sound is heard quite clear, with good bass. The microphone works well for calls and the LED screen is very practical to know the battery status. They are also comfortable to use for a long time and their IP7 water resistance gives peace of mind for daily activities. In general, they have very good quality for the price and I recommend them."
    },
    {
        "review": "Absolutely fantastic wireless earbuds worth every penny!Smooth Bluetooth 5.4 connection, powerful deep bass stereo and crisp call performance thanks to noise-reducing mic. 50H long battery + practical LED power indicator, stylish carbon black design, perfect for phone & laptop daily use!"
    },
    {
        "review": "They are exactly as described and as you would expect.  The buds last forever and the case charges them multiple times.  The numbers mentioned, 8hrs for the buds and 50hrs total (with the case charging them over and over) seem accurate.  The sound quality is great, a lot better than I was expecting, clear, with bass, as it should.  They paired very easily with my 8yr old phone and my computer.  I highly recommend them.  You can't beat the price.  I can't believe people would pay 10 times the price for the same thing just to have the brand name.  Make sure you discharge everything completely down to zero and back to a 100% a few times, conditioning the battery.  I bought a second pair for my wife too."
    },
    {
        "review": "I bought these as a lighter, more comfortable alternative to my over-ear headphones for video meetings. I didn't want to use my AirPods Pro on my work computer -- switching them back and forth is a nuisance -- so I wanted a dedicated pair just for work. These perfectly fit the bill. Meeting audio is crisp, and my coworkers say I sound clear on calls.In terms of comfort, they rival my AirPods Pro, which is fantastic. The only quirk is that they sit in the charging case facing outward, meaning you have to rotate them before putting them in your ears, but that’s a minor adjustment. On the plus side, they connect instantly the moment you open the case, so they're ready to use by the time you put them in. I just wish there was a brief startup chime to confirm the connection.  Tap controls work as indicated in the instruction manual (so you'll want to make sure you don't lose it!), but you have to wear/use both earbuds for some functions like increasing or decreasing volume (tapping left decreases, tapping right increases).  But being able to gently tap the earbud to play/pause/answer works, once you learn the tap pattern.While the sound quality isn't quite as rich or full-fidelity as AirPods for music, it is perfectly fine for voice calls. If premium, wide-range audio is your top priority, these might disappoint, but they excel for human speech/calls.When paired with my iPhone, there is noticeable sub-second latency with these, so they're terrible when watching videos (audio is out of sync with the video) or playing games, but that's just a warning for buyers if that's something important for you; it's fine for calls/meetings.Charging via USB-C is quick and simple. My favourite feature is the digital battery indicator on the case. It's incredibly handy because you can see exactly how much further you have to go for a full charge. It also takes the guesswork out of knowing when the case's internal battery is running low, so you're never caught off guard by a dead battery. And they last a long time on a charge -- I tested over 5-6 hours listening to podcasts without needing to recharge.  Highly recommended for a remote or office setup!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I love using them, they are quite small but big enough to avoid losing them easily like another kind that I had already purchased off Amazon.  Very good choice of sound quality also for the very affordable price."
    },
    {
        "review": "Positives: The comfort of its Earbuds is good. You could wear it for a few hours before your ears hurt. The functions that you have by clicking on the bar are practical when you don't want to take out your phone to change music or answer the phone. The sound quality is ok, but hearing the bass is inaudible, leaves a little to be desired. Negative: Putting the Earbuds in is particularly clumsy. Just tried to put it in the ears, you easily hook the bar to cause unwanted actions (like clumsily turning the sound up to maximum, which then farts in your ears when you are not paying attention. 😡). Sometimes they fit poorly in the ears, forcing you to have to push them further into the ear to avoid dropping them. It is very easy to lose your Earbuds when you have to carry something at head level (very frustrating when it falls in places where you will have difficulty recovering.) Conclusion: In itself, it is not bad. If you are looking for good quality Earbuds, this is still a good choice. It is practical, the functions are easy to understand and quite comfortable. However, it has many flaws which remain annoying, but which do not prevent you from being able to enjoy the product to the fullest. Rating: 7/10"
    }
]

