    },
    {
        "review": "Ok.ok.ok"
    },
    {
        "review": "I've been using the TOZO T10s for a while now and I have to say they really surprised me. They offer excellent overall quality, are comfortable and full of features that are usually only found in more expensive models.PROPowerful and customizable sound: thanks to the adjustable EQ and ORIGX 2.0 technology, you can get deep bass and excellent performance on every musical genre.Excellent autonomy: with the case you can easily get several dozen hours of use. Perfect for those who use them all day. Stable Bluetooth 5.3: pairing is quick and the connection remains solid even when moving around the house. Intuitive touch controls: they respond well and allow you to manage music and calls without difficulty. Wireless charging + USB-C: convenient to be able to choose how to charge them. IPX8 certification: they resist sweat and water very well, excellent for sports. Comfortable fit: light, they fit well in the ear and remain stable even during movement. CONSThe case it is a little bulky compared to others in the same range. The touch controls are quite sensitive: it takes a little getting used to at the beginning. Conclusion The TOZO T10 are reliable, comfortable headphones with excellent quality sound. They offer advanced features that are hard to find at this price. Perfect for both daily use and for training or working on the move. Highly recommended."
