        "review": "HAOYUYANSports Bluetooth HeadphonesI bought these headphones thinking. They were really high quality because the original price was $249. With a discount of 90% off. Bought them for about $23.It's false advertising, so minus 1 star. If you look now, there are still these Chinese brand claiming they are high-quality headphones for $249, but you get 90% off. For $20, they are reasonably priced. Even $40 without the false advertising is an okay price for these, but the lying I can't stand.So, with  that out of the way. My review on this item. The HAOYUYANSports Bluetooth Headphones: If you bought them around $22, they are not bad for the price. The main reason I bought these was to loop around my ear that helps it from not fall off. My son had the big bulky earmuffs that plug into his phone. My wife had a good pair of Samsung buds that kept popping out of her ears. So I bought 3 of these Haoyuyan sport headphones same brand, style, and on the same web page, and scrolled through their different colors. The sound on my wife's Samsung earbuds has good sound quality. The sound quality on these, the best description I can give is sticking a long funnel in your ear and playing your music in the other end. Slightly muffled. Besides that, the sound quality for $22 are a good deal. Other good points are it stays on your ear and comfortable compared to earmuffs and earbuds popping out. It has wireless charging and if the case is charged it will recharge the earphones a couple of times if the case holds the charge. I bought 3 same brands and each holds charge differently.A negative is the top to the case is not spring loaded. Once you finally get the top opened, Gravity wants to close it right away. Another star was taken because it was an annoyance.Besides this 90% Amazon scam on earphones. Not bad for the price of $19-$40. If you paid $249, get a refund and get a name brand if you have that kind of money."
