    {
        "review": "They are good!!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Sound so nice. Very comfortable to wear. Using after Pixel buds A series and these are so nice. Sony as a brand is pioneers in music/sounds so no question on that. Very good noise isolation. They fit rally well. It got paired easily with the pixel and the sony app I downloaded instantly. Battery percentage is shows after the widget installation. it offered the software update right away after connecting with the phone. Mics are good even during the call. The pressing Buttons are a bit not preferable as thy create additional pressure on the ear drum. For this price range, I think touch controls would be a lot to ask. I got it during sale for as low as 2500 inr. Thank you Amazon for such a wonderful deal. I recommend this if available from 2500 to 3500."
