[
    {
        "review": "When I first received these earbuds, they didn’t appear to be anything special, just another cheap earbud that I will send to the Philippines. I always open the box to check for function and that the battery is charged.  I put them into my ears and they paired immediately, which was impressive, and then the music hit me.  Wow!  The sound is amazingly well balanced with all the bass I could take, and studio clear quality.  I just reordered a replacement set to send to the Philippines, as I am keeping these for me. These are probably the best sounding earbuds I have heard, regardless of the low price point. I am 85 years old and heave been an audiophile since I was 40 years old.  Prior to that I was an Infantryman. I highly recommend these earbuds who wants high quality sound on a budget. Better buy two (2) as these will sell out fast. Have fun!"
