[
    {
        "review": "I really like these earbuds. They’re comfortable to wear, connect easily via Bluetooth, and the battery lasts a long time. I especially like the charging case with the screen that shows the battery percentageit’s very convenient. They also have a nice design and fit well in my ears. For the price, I think they’re a great purchase."
