    },
    {
        "review": "Okay, this mouse is insanely good for the price, the quality rivals even expensive mice, and the click is satisfying; however, I do have to mention one thing, though, using it without any wireless connection, I thought it would function like a regular mouse when plugged in using the USB cable, but, it's charging only. Therefore, there is no wired mode available for those who wants low latency, it's either 2.4GHz or Bluetooth mode only. But is it worth it? Oh yes, it is.Pros:- Quality unmatched for the price point.- Quiet and satisfying clicks- Very unique-looking mouse overall- Comfortable to useCons:- No wired mode, wireless onlyEdit: 3 stars, connection issues with 2.4GHz mode, as it randomly stops responding or jitters on screen, which costs my gaming sessions. An updated version of this mouse is definitely needed for better responsiveness and a wired connection mode."
