    {
        "review": "I've been using the mouse on both my laptop and tablet for a few days now and overall it makes a really good impression. What I immediately liked is the transparent design - it looks a little different than the usual standard mice and looks pretty modern on the desk. In everyday life, the quiet operation was particularly pleasant for me. The clicks are significantly dampened, so you can still work in the evening without the constant clicking being annoying. I find this really pleasant, especially when working from home. It is also practical that you can quickly switch between Bluetooth and the USB dongle. I use it on the PC during the day and occasionally on the tablet. Switching is easy and the connection has been stable so far. I also find the battery level indicator helpful. This way you can see in good time when it needs to be loaded instead of suddenly sitting there without a mouse. It charges via USB-C, which should be standard for me by now. The shape fits comfortably in my medium-sized hands. It's not too heavy and glides smoothly over the mouse pad. This works well for me for longer work sessions. Overall, a modern and everyday mouse with quiet buttons and practical functions. Of course, a few personal preferences always come into play, but so far I'm satisfied."
