        "review": "5.0 out of 5 stars – Excellent Budget Gaming Mouse! I’ve been using the BENGOO Gaming Mouse for a few weeks now and I’m genuinely impressed. For the price, this thing punches way above its weight.What I love:Ergonomic Design: It fits perfectly in my hand (I have medium-large hands). The shape feels natural for both palm and claw grip, and the textured side grips keep it from slipping even during intense gaming sessions.RGB Lighting: The lighting looks really clean and vibrant. There are several modes (breathing, rainbow, solid colors, etc.) and it adds a nice pop to my setup without being over-the-top flashy.Performance: The optical sensor is responsive and accurate. I’ve had zero issues with tracking in fast-paced FPS games. The clicks are satisfying and crisp, and the scroll wheel feels premium.Wired Convenience: No battery anxiety, no lag, and the cable is long enough and flexible. The braided cable also seems durable.Extra Buttons: The two side buttons are well-placed and programmable, which is great for quick weapon switches or macros.This mouse is perfect for both gaming and everyday use. I’ve been using it for work too and it’s comfortable for long hours. It honestly feels like a much more expensive mouse.If you’re looking for a solid, stylish, and comfortable gaming mouse without spending $50–$80, this is a fantastic choice. Highly recommended! Would buy again."
