        "review": "I recently picked up the Anker USB-C Hub (5-in-1, 4K HDMI + 90W Power Delivery), and it’s quickly become one of the most used accessories in my gear setup. The build is solid—aluminum shell, clean finish, and it matches my laptop’s aesthetic nicely. Plugged it in and it immediately recognized every device: external monitor, USB-A hard drive, flash drive, mouse, and power all at once. No compatibility headaches, which is already a huge win.The performance has been great. The 4K HDMI output works flawlessly with my external monitor, offering crisp picture quality and no weird dropouts or lag. The 90 W Power Delivery means my laptop charges even when I’m using it hard (video editing + screen output + USB devices), which used to be a pain when using lesser hubs that throttle the charging or heat up quickly. The USB-A ports feel robust and haven't failed or lagged with connected accessories, and the entire hub remains cool under load.What really seals the five-star rating for me is the combination of reliability, design, and simplicity. There’s no dongle nonsense, no weird firmware updates needed, just solid performance. It hides neatly behind the laptop and stays connected without getting pulled out accidentally. If you work with laptops, external screens, and multiple devices—and want something streamlined that won’t get in the way—this Anker hub is absolutely worth it."
