        "review": "I use my Mac Mini M1 (which only has 2 usb ports) mainly for music. I have 7 keyboards and/or MIDI controllers that now, thanks to this 10-port hub, I can connect them all simultaneously and I still have plenty of ports for other USB devices, such as flash drives, hard drives, my iPad, etc. Additionally, each port has an on/off switch that works in two ways: if the Mac is off, it supplies power to the device, making stand-alone devices work. If the Mac is on, in addition to supplying power, it mounts the device to the Mac. This completely saves me from connecting and disconnecting USB cables. I recommend it 100%."
