        "review": "I worked on an iPad Pro 12.9 2022 M2. It is very excellent and works efficiently. So far, I have tried running hard drives, SD cards, and micro SD cards, and charging the iPhone through it. It is a nice size and comes with a bag on its size. I am trying it out and will come back with an evaluation 20 days from now, after the Hajj and pilgrimage season. I will know whether it deserves the evaluation for it or not, after the extensive experience in transferring data using the iPad, MacBook, and various devices. Frankly speaking, I will return with an evaluation. It is worth every riyal and my work"
