        "review": "This is one of the best keyboards I’ve bought on Amazon. It has a great build layout, the keys feel comfortable and responsive, and typing on it is smooth, quiet, and creamy. It was easy to set up and works perfectly right out of the box. It comes with a charger that is  the new charger of many devices including Apple, = very compatible.  The design is sleek and modern, and it offers excellent value for the price. I highly recommend this keyboard to anyone looking for a reliable, quality option."
