        "review": "The Bluetooth connection works properly to receive and make calls, and the battery lasts several days with normal use. The heart rate monitor and activity tracker are useful to keep track of daily exercise. In addition, the more than 130 sports modes offer many options for different activities. It is easy to set up, comfortable to use and has an excellent value for money. I recommend it for those looking for a functional smartwatch without spending too much."
