    {
        "review": "Arrived in a flat white but elegant box/box. Inside is the watch, the charging cable and a short description - completely sufficient. Unpacked and marveled at first. The housing is made of metal and looks absolutely elegant in the rose gold color. The bracelet made of soft, velvety plastic really flatters the wrist. Install, activate the permissions and hey presto, the watch has already connected to the smartphone. The telephone function works great and with a crystal-clear connection to the person you are talking to. In my opinion, the selection of free backgrounds/watch displays is completely sufficient and the paid displays are not expensive if you absolutely need something else. For sports and other activities, the manufacturer has packed pretty much all of the “usual” sports into the software. After many disappointing experiences with this type of watch, they are cheaper Price segment, I'm absolutely thrilled this time. It actually doesn't have to be an expensive product like a \"bitten apple\" to have a lot of fun with a smartwatch. Fun that also has a great price. Both thumbs 👍👍..."
