        "review": "This iPhone case fits perfectly and feels sturdy without adding too much bulk. The buttons are responsive, the cutouts line up well, and the case provides good protection around the edges and corners. It has a clean look and is comfortable to hold. Overall, it’s a solid case for everyday use and a great value for the price."
