    {
        "review": "There are a zillion cheap phone cases. This is one of them, but it's surprisingly good. Tight fit, buttons work well, and most importantly the magnet ring is shockingly strong, so if you're looking for a firm mount with a magnet-compatible device, this is a great choice.It's got some subtle design elements, like raised & rounded edges, that improve the grip as well as offer a little extra bumper if you drop it.The included glass screen protector applied easily and works well."
