    },
    {
        "review": "Can’t beat this case for the price.  I think this is the third Supfine case I’ve purchased and each one has been great, no issues with case quality.  They are thin, so not much bulk added to the phone, with good texture that is enough to hold in one hand.  Easy to install/remove and magsafe works great through them all as well.  I believe this is the frost on that came with a screen protector, which is an added bonus."
