        "review": "I’ve been really happy with this case. I wanted something that would protect my phone without adding a lot of bulk, and this has been a great balance.The buttons are still easy to press, the cutouts line up well, and the MagSafe connection has been strong with my charger and accessories. I also like that the back is semi transparent because it lets the phone color show through while still protecting it.I’ve dropped my phone a couple of times already with this case on, and it’s held up well so far. It still looks nice, and I haven’t noticed any yellowing.I’d definitely recommend it if you’re looking for a simple, clean looking MagSafe case."
