[
    {
        "review": "I’m very impressed with this magnetic case for my iPhone Pro Max. It has a sleek design, feels durable, and provides excellent protection without adding too much bulk to the phone.The magnetic connection works perfectly with compatible chargers and accessories, making it very convenient for everyday use. The case fits the phone precisely, all buttons are easy to press, and the raised edges give extra protection for the screen and camera.I love the combination of style, comfort, and protection. It looks premium and gives me confidence that my phone is protected from scratches and everyday drops. Definitely a great case for anyone looking for quality and functionality."
    },
    {
        "review": "The FNTCASE for iPhone 17 Pro Max Case is a great option for anyone who wants reliable phone protection while still showing off the original design of their device. The clear transparent back keeps the sleek look of the iPhone visible while adding a protective layer against everyday drops, scratches, and impacts.I like that this case includes MagSafe compatibility, making it convenient to use with magnetic chargers and accessories without needing to remove the case. The slim magnetic design helps maintain a comfortable feel in your hand while still offering added protection with a shockproof bumper.The included screen protector is a helpful bonus, providing extra defense for one of the most vulnerable parts of your phone. The military-grade drop protection design makes this case a practical choice for people with active lifestyles, busy workdays, or anyone who wants extra peace of mind.Overall, the FNTCASE Clear MagSafe Case is a great balance of protection and style. It offers a sleek appearance, useful magnetic compatibility, and everyday durability, making it a solid choice for iPhone 17 Pro Max users who want protection without a bulky feel. 📱✨"
    },
    {
        "review": "I purchased the B-A Purple (D-Purple) color variant for my iPhone 14 Pro, and it fits like a glove. The clear body with the lilac/purple MagSafe ring looks absolutely stunning against the Space Gray finish — it's elegant without being flashy, perfectly complementing the steel body aesthetic.What I love:• The clear edges and body stay true to the phone's original beauty• The lilac MagSafe ring adds a gorgeous subtle pop of color• Slim and lightweight — you barely notice it's on• Includes a 9H tempered glass screen protector — great bonus at this price• MagSafe works perfectly — snaps on chargers and accessories with confidenceOn yellowing issue: Every clear case yellows eventually — I've paid premium prices for Speck and Incase clear cases that promise no yellowing, and they all yellow at the edges too. At ~$6, this case offers the same real-world performance at a fraction of the price.FYI for iPhone 15 Pro users: Size-wise it fits the my iPhone 15 Pro, but it covers the camera control button, which is why I got it exclusively for my iPhone 14 pro ....... so keep that in mind.Bottom line: For the price, this is exceptional. Don't overthink it. It is easy to install, gives great protection and feels durable and tactile!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I really like this case. It fits my iPhone 15 Plus perfectly, feels sturdy without being too bulky, and the clear design lets the color of the phone show through. The magnetic connection is strong and works well with MagSafe accessories. The buttons are easy to press and the raised edges give extra protection around the screen and camera. Great everyday case for the price."
    },
    {
        "review": "Magnets are strong, case looks sleek, and great value. I bought another case from another reputable brand and it was bulky, ugly, and clear. The grips are smooth enough to feel good to the touch and yet still gives good grip so you wont drop your phone. not too flashy and looks great. Highly recommend"
