        "review": "This otter box case is exactly what i was looking for. It is my iPhone 13 perfectly, feels comfortable to hold, and provides excellent protection without being too bulky. The buttons are easy to press, and the grip helps prevent accidental drops. The qualify is outstanding, and i highly recommend it to anyone looking for a durable and reliable phone case."
    },
    {
        "review": "Awesome and protective case! It fits so well on the phone. I like how there are two pieces, a rubber shell and outer plastic shell. It is easy to hold especially with the rubber grips on the side. I have had no issues with the buttons. Its a thicker case but it still fits well in my pockets, especially jeans pockets."
