[
    {
        "review": "I’m very happy with the ESR iPhone 14 Pro Case. It has a clean design, feels durable, and provides good protection while keeping the phone slim. I like that it supports MagSafe, making it easy to use with my MagSafe accessories and chargers.The clear black design also looks great because it lets the original iPhone design show while still adding protection. The case feels sturdy without adding too much bulk.Pros:Slim and lightweight designGood protection for everyday useMagSafe compatibility works wellClear design looks greatDurable build qualityComfortable gripCons:No major issues so farOverall, this is a great iPhone case for anyone looking for a balance between protection and a slim design. It feels high quality, works well with MagSafe accessories, and keeps my phone protected without making it bulky."
    },
    {
        "review": "If you’re tired of cases that claim to be \"tough\" but feel like cheap plastic, or \"rugged\" cases that make your phone too big to fit in a pocket, the ESR Military-Grade Shockproof Case is the upgrade you’ve been looking for. I’ve tested a lot of MagSafe cases, and this one feels like it was engineered, not just manufactured.Protection That Isn’t Just MarketingThe first thing you notice is the Air-Guard corners. They aren’t just decorative; they create a visible cushion that actually absorbs impact. I’ve already had one \"heart-stop\" moment where my phone slid off a high counter onto a tile floor, and it literally bounced. Not a scratch on the phone or the case. The \"Military-Grade\" label actually feels earned here.The MagSafe Connection (HaloLock)ESR’s magnets (they call it HaloLock) are notoriously strong—often stronger than the official Apple cases.• The \"Snap\": When you bring it near a charger or car mount, it grabs hold with a very secure click.• Reliability: I use a heavy MagSafe power bank and a wallet attachment; neither budge even when I’m walking or the car hits a bump. It’s rated for 1,500g of holding force, and you can definitely feel that extra \"tug.\"Design & UtilityDepending on the model you get, many of these come with the Stash Stand around the camera. This is a game-changer:• It protects the lenses when closed.• It’s made of a high-quality zinc alloy that doesn't feel flimsy.• It works in both portrait (for scrolling/FaceTime) and landscape (for videos) without blocking the MagSafe ring.The Build QualityThe back is a hard, scratch-resistant polycarbonate that stays clear much longer than cheap TPU. The sides have a nice matte grip that prevents that \"slippery soap\" feeling. It adds just enough \"heft\" to make the phone feel protected without doubling its thickness.Pros:• Superior Magnets: Best-in-class MagSafe strength.• Corner Protection: Air-Guard tech is legit for drop safety.• Tactile Buttons: They remain clicky and responsive, not mushy.• Raised Edges: Significant lip around the screen and camera for \"table-top\" protection.Cons:• Tight Fit: It’s a very snug fit, so it takes a little effort to get the phone out if you swap cases often (but that’s also why it’s so protective!).Final Verdict: This is the \"Goldilocks\" of cases—it’s tougher than a standard clear case but way sleeker than a traditional bulky rugged case. If you value your phone's trade-in value and use MagSafe accessories daily, this is an absolute no-brainer. 5/5 Stars."
    },
    {
        "review": "Nice, well made, better than original provided by Apple when phone purchased.Quick delivery. easy to install, fits great, great buttons"
    },
    {
        "review": "I’m a happy camper when it comes to this case.I had my old one for two years before the plastic started to fall apart.Initially, I got a different case for five dollars that even came with a screen protector and I thought to myself this is such a great deal, when I tried it the magnetic component of the case failed miserably so I returned it and got this case again for about $13 which is the same price I paid for this case two years ago.You get what you pay for. This is a great case that served me for two years and the magnetic component of it is very strong.In the pictures you can see the two years old case next to the brand new one."
    },
    {
        "review": "Firstly, I love the feel of this case, it's honestly a case I continue to buy and buy again. Since it perfectly fits my iPhone 15 plus, the installation is easy. This particular model doesn't have a kickstand, but I'm okay with that since I have a MagSafe pop socket. Did I mention MagSafe? I LOVE MagSafe compatible phone cases, it makes accessories easier to use, especially since I don't have to take the case off and on again. My phones fallen a multitude of times, and hasn't had any damage to the body of the phone. In terms of overall protection, screen protection is sound, especially from someone like me who doesn't use a phone screen! My only flaw with this however, is that the case does yellow, as I've mentioned this is the case I continue to \"buy and buy\" over again and again..."
    },
    {
        "review": "Amazing quality case at a great price! Super easy to install, and it helps protect the screen and body of the phone very well. Sleek design and it’s been dropped numerous times and always saved the phone! The clear plastic does eventually turn yellow, but that’s only because I rarely clean it/use it all the time, and even then, it takes a long time to show wear. Happy with quality and material!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Product as described on site. Fits perfectly 13 pro max . I like the smooth feel and that I don’t have to remove it when charging on the charger. I wish that it had a cover but I still like this case."
    },
    {
        "review": "I got the clear/purple case over a year ago and it still looks great. It hasn’t discolored at all. Barely any scratches. Seems nice and durable while still being low profile and pretty. The magnet on the back is extremely strong. I highly recommend this case!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Thank you for your quick response. I love how simple it is. However, I am worried about the packaging."
    },
    {
        "review": "Absolutely love this case, it is sturdy, excellent quality, just perfect.The ESR brand is also excellent - I have made an account, registered my case, even though bought on Amazon and not direct - and now have points enough for 10 dollars off my next case and I have a 2 year warranty.What is not to love!!HIGHLY RECOMMENDED 5*****"
    },
    {
        "review": "Item arrived on time and was exactly as decribed. Excellent product!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Best phone case I've had so far 🙏"
    },
    {
        "review": "Perfect for my smartphone."
    }
]

