[
    {
        "review": "Don't normally write these, but felt obligated. So I've had my S21 Plus for while now, since 2021. Bought it straight up, didnt want the added monthly payment. Been very good to me over the years. But this isn't a s21 plus review...I went up and visited my dad recently at the house I grew up in. He got a new mower. Damn near 6 ft. bed, mows his acre in about 20 minutes. Now, this is a far cry from the 2 hours+ I spent the majority of my childhood mowing. He was clearly stoked, and wanted me to try it on the backyard. Sure, why not. The mower felt like a damn fighter jet. Zero turn, controls were sensitive as all hell. I had my phone in my pocket. After getting used to the controls for a couple minutes, ended up mowing the entire backyard in less than 10. Insanity. Got off, grabbed my beer, and proceeded to go in and watch some baseball. About 15 minutes later, realized I didn't have my phone on me. Checked inside, maybe I left it on the counter somewhere. Checked out on the lawn, I didn't remember seeing it, but maybe it slipped out and I drove past it. No dice. Had the old man call it for me. Heard a BRRRR BRRRR coming from the mower. Christ. So I lift the seat up, and see my phone, and case, in the myriad of mechanisms not engine related. Pulled out the case, absolutely destroyed, and focused on my phone, currently face down on the bottom of the metal cage. I know it's not dead, as my bluetooth watch was vibrating when he called it. But I completely resigned to the fact that it was cracked to no end, given the condition of the case. Fished it out face down. Moment of truth, turned it around and the thing was completely fine. Old case was destroyed, but I have never ordered another so fast. Put it on today. AI check it, hopefully I don't sound like a GPT clone. True story, otterbox has earned my business indefinitely."
    },
    {
        "review": "Otter has from the very start earned there Good Reputation for Top Quality Phone Cases they may cost a little more than others but you definitely get what you Pay for Top Quality. Thank You for an Outstanding Product."
    },
