        "review": "Sturdy and an exact fit for my Galaxy phone."
    },
    {
        "review": "Overall I am happy with this case. I would have given it 5 stars if it was more slip resistant. Could definitely be improved by adding additional silicone rubber inserts, instead of just the two small strips on each side."
    },
