        "review": "Does in fact fit the S21+ as described. I love Otterbox and it's ability to save my phone from my clumsy self. I've only dropped my phone a few times (so far), but there no damage to the phone. It's not the prettiest case, if you are going for something like that, but the protection is what I need.Update 7/20/2024:I just had to purchase a new case since I dropped my phone enough that I actually broke the outer plastic shell, but my phone is fine! I did try a different brand before I repurchased because I wanted a fun color, but it didn't feel nearly as secure in my hard or safe. So, still with a standard blue case, but my phone has survived. Otterbox for the win!"
