    {
        "review": "I got this to plug into my VR headset which is the Oculus Quest 3 and it works perfectly with a right angle usb-c connector it provides enough power to keep the battery at the same level but it does not charge while playing. Pretty compact and not crazy heavy"
    },
    {
        "review": "Title says it all. Its a small 10k portable charger. Wont give you too many charges. But enough to get you from 20 or less percent to full and say half of another charge.It is slightly thicker than i imagined it’d be, but its not big at all. Basically a box of playing cards, but a bit taller.I personally like this charger because when the device its charging hits its limit (if you enable charge limits in battery settings) the portable charger stops sending power and turns off. This prevents overcharging and deterioration of the battery over time.The above situation isnt what most ppl look for, but for me its a suuuper important feature when using portables to know that i can plug in a device and not worry about it charging “forever” and harming my devices and to not wastefully drain the portable’s energy.Again, good charger, does what i look for in a charger. Highly affordable, no issues yet. Would buy again."
