    {
        "review": "Very thin, lightweight battery pack. It charges quickly and then recharges fast. It's nice to have a charger small and light enough to carry in your pocket. It's also good to see that the product details below accurately tell you the actual transferable battery capacity which is 3250mAh, it's also on the written on the box. You will always lose some battery when charging due to heat, so a good 5000mAh rated battery will give you around 3000mAh of actual battery charge. This one gives you over 3000mAh, it charges my phone, which has a healthy 5000mAh battery from 0% to over 70%. You really can't ask for much more from a battery this thin and light. Highly recommended for those who want a MagSafe charger as small as possible but will also give a solid charge. It might not charge your phone to 100% from zero but will charge to about 75%."
    },
