        "review": "Best trickle charger on tge market.Saved my S$$$piral AGM starter battery for one year on trickle.100% CCA still available for my rebuilt vehicle !!!Worth every č̣ent !!!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Definitely do not buy this product via Snowdrop EU. (the product itself is perfect to be clear) but the seller does not respond."
