        "review": "The Logitech C920x HD Pro Webcam is an excellent everyday webcam for work, school, and casual streaming. Its 1080p video is sharp, the autofocus is reliable, and the dual microphones do a good job of keeping your voice clear during calls. It’s easy to set up, works well with major video chat apps, and offers great value for the price. The only real drawback is that it lacks a privacy shutter, but overall it remains one of the most practical webcams in its class."
