[
    {
        "review": "​I am absolutely thrilled with this desk lamp! The wide, linear light design provides incredibly even and bright illumination across my entire desk, without any annoying glare or shadows. I love the clamp-on feature—it securely attaches to the edge of the table, saving so much valuable desktop space. The flexible neck allows me to adjust the angle perfectly for working or reading. It looks sleek, modern, and high-quality. If you need a reliable and space-saving light for your home office or study area, I highly recommend this one!"
    },
    {
        "review": "If you're looking for a small, versatile, and energy-efficient lamp, this will get the job done. With 3 light settings as well as a dimming option, the clamp secured everything to my desk without any issues. Furthermore, the wiring didn't interfere with my monitor, keyboard, and other accessories on my desk. Highly recommend as this only took a few minutes to set up."
    },
    {
        "review": "This lamp is so great! Different types of light you can choose from, varying brightness settings, and the pink color one I got is awesome! Matches with the pink theme I have going on with my desk. Easy to set up and arrived quickly. Very happy with my purchase!"
    },
    {
        "review": "What can i say other than I love the LED desk lamp and that it is dimmable, easy to adjust, and operate.It does not take up much space on the back of my desk and is easy to setup. You can plug it into a USB-A port or plug it into the USB-A block it comes with. We are considering buying another one for my son's desk.This attached easily to my stand up desk and allows me to work in the lighting that I enjoy."
    },
    {
        "review": "TL;DR: Recommended but could be improved.I'm using this lamp in my living room to illuminate a bluetooth keyboard in the evening.The gooseneck keeps the lamp where I put it and feels like it's well made and will last.The lamp has 3 color settings - white, amber and off-white(?). I'm not sure why they choose off-white rather than red, which is useful when you don't want to compromise your night vision any more than you have to.The lamp seems to be quite efficient; I've been running it on an old no-name (and over-rated IMHO) 30,000 mA USB power bank for about 12 hours, and I've got 87% of the battery left.It's wide enough to illuminate a full-size keyboard, but the LED strip is designed so it's easy to keep glare off the screen. I've got two power banks, neither of which start when the lamp is plugged in; you must push the button on the power bank to turn on the output. This is because the lamp (and other devices) don't draw enough current when the lamp is off for the power bank to notice it's connected! As a result, if I turn the lamp off (such that the lamp's blue standby light comes on) the power bank thinks nothing is connected and shuts down after a few seconds (and thus losing my dimmer adjustments).The lamp has a wide illumination range; it gets quite bright, and dims to a very low level, such that I can keep it on when I'm not using it and it isn't distracting. This is important because WHEN HE LAMP LOSES POWER IT FORGETS HOW MUCH I've DIMMED IT (for which I have deducted a star). To compensate for this, when I turn the light on for the evening I set the default (white) light to the level I need to view my keyboard; I set the other two colors to the lowest level. When I want to take a break and watch TV for a bit, I select the amber color and I can dim the light is enough that I don't notice it. Then when I want to type some more I switch to the white color and I'm in business.I have one other nit: The lamp's gooseneck threads onto the top of a stiff upright tube, which screws into the desk mount. This tube is long enough that I can barely position the lamp perfectly (due in part to my setup - others may not find it too long). This could be solved by shipping a 2nd tube about half the length of the current tube. This way I could use the short tube and it would give the gooseneck more 'reach'. Some may find it useful to use both tubes for added height."
    },
    {
        "review": "★★★★★I love my Airlonv LED desk lamp! It’s bright, easy to use, and has a sleek design that looks great on my desk. The adjustable lighting is perfect for working or studying, and it was definitely worth the purchase! I just purchased one more for my Husband."
    },
    {
        "review": "This is my third desk lamp purchase. At a certain point, I was really frustrated with paying $45+ on ones that would end up breaking or are just jankier than what they're presenting. So when I needed to get a third one, because my last one broke, I wanted to get something that made sense from a price standpoint, as well as, quality standpoint. And after receiving this, I've been really impressed with my purchase. It is so simple. It's sleek. I like that it has just three light options instead of my last one, which had six plus all these different dim settings (it was overwhelmingly too much). This light quality is fantastic. The material quality is much stronger than some of the more expensive ones I purchased from other brands. It was extremely simple to install and get set up. I recommend heavily. This has been a great product, especially coming from someone who's used the more expensive ones that you see on Amazon."
