[
    {
        "review": "Great desk lamp! The clamp is strong, it’s easy to adjust, and the flexible neck lets me put the light exactly where I need it. I love the different brightness levels and modes—it’s perfect for working at my desk without eye strain. The black metal design looks nice and feels sturdy. Great value for the price!"
