        "review": "I really like this product, so far probably in my top 5 Amazon purchases ever and I buy a lot so. The lighting really good, the colors are nice, I like that I can change its brightness which is has a pretty large range of. Worked to charge my stuff, and over all very reliable. 2 things they can improve on however, if the bottom just had a little more weight it would make it way more sturdy. Secondly, I wish the buttons had more texture to them as in if they had a bump so that I could feel them in the dark as I was using this lamp to help me wake up at very early hours of the morning. So instead of using my phone light to turn on the light, I could just use my hand to feel where the button to turn it on is. That also would really help those with disabilities. The last 2 reasons are the only reason why I gave it 4 stars."
