        "review": "It has a light, cheap feel but seems to function OK.The base could use some weight to it;When the lamp arm is tilted forward too much,the lamp falls over.All of the controls are flat, no texture, no bumps.It's difficult to find the on switch if it is dark;you would need a flashlight.I had to put some tape on the base so I can find the on switch in the dark.Having extra plugs and charger ports is convenient."
    },
    {
        "review": "I love this lamp. It is on my desk and it’s so easy to turn on. I love how you can change the angles and lighting shades. The plug-in cord is sturdy and very nice, not like thin plastic cords. The lamp doesn’t take up a lot of room."
