        "review": "This lamp has been a great addition to my desk setup. The double-head design gives much better coverage than a regular desk lamp, so my whole workspace is evenly lit without dark spots.I really like how many brightness and color options it has. It’s easy to switch between warm light for reading in the evening and a brighter white light when I’m working during the day. The light is soft on the eyes, even after sitting at my desk for a few hours.The adjustable height and flexible arms make it easy to position exactly where I need it, and it feels sturdy once it’s set up. The 45-minute timer is also a nice feature when I’m reading before bed and don’t want to remember to turn it off.Setup only took a few minutes, and it looks clean and modern on my desk. Overall, I’m really happy with it and would definately recommend it to anyone looking for a quality desk lamp."
