        "review": "I picked up this double head LED lamp to brighten my home desk and it quickly became my go to for late night craft sessions and detailed tasks like soldering and sketching. The two adjustable heads flood the work area from different angles so shadows are minimal and the five colour temps with ten brightness steps make it easy to find a comfortable setting for reading, painting or computer work. The touch controls are simple and the memory function means I get the same light each time I turn it on. The lamp stays cool and I had no flicker during long sessions, and the joints held position reliably. Two practical notes, the small pen holder is more decorative than useful and if you plan to run the USB port and the lamp at once use a good quality 5 volt 3 amp adapter to avoid flicker. Overall it met my expectations for flexible, eye friendly task lighting."
