        "review": "This is such a fun little lamp. The colors are bright, it looks great, and I really like having all the different preprogrammed lighting modes to choose from. It makes it easy to change the mood of the room without having to spend time adjusting everything manually.My favorite feature is definitely the music sync. It reacts to the music really well and makes the whole setup feel a lot more lively, especially if you have people over or just want some ambient lighting while listening to music.The app is easy enough to use, and there are plenty of options if you want to customize things beyond the presets. Overall, it looks good, works well, and is just a genuinely fun addition to the room."
