        "review": "Great basic desk lamp, I like the ability to adjust the intensity and tempreture. controls are easy to use.  positionig of lamp head gets the light where I need and then easy to reposition also. base is very stable, important with a busy desk. sleek style doens't take up much room.  I like that the controls are on the stalk, my othe lamp the controls are on the base and often get covered with paperwork."
