    {
        "review": "I’m extremely happy with this desk lamp. The 42-inch, 4-panel design provides a very wide lighting area, which easily covers my entire workspace without creating dark spots. The brightness is even and comfortable for long sessions.One of my favorite features is the clamp design. Since it doesn’t have a bulky base sitting on the desk, it saves a lot of valuable workspace and keeps everything looking clean and organized.I recently bought a height-adjustable desk for my Yamaha MODX8+ synthesizer, and this lamp has been the perfect addition. It clamps securely to the edge of the desk, doesn’t get in the way, and provides more than enough light whether I’m practicing, recording, or adjusting controls on the keyboard.Setup was quick, the lamp feels well-built, and the adjustable panels let me direct the light exactly where I need it. If you have a large desk, dual monitors, or even a music production setup like mine, I highly recommend this lamp. It has been one of the best upgrades to my workspace."
