        "review": "Great lamp, my husband is usually against spending money as \"we have lamps\" but I was always adjusting my task lamp for when i write notes doen (I'm still a little old school) and had another lanp on the left so I wouldn't be backlit on conference calls. I was worried about the height being high enough to clear my monitor and camera but still be effective. This is perfect, as you can see. My husband was impressed and has complimented it more than once, said it was a good idea. Im going to get another one for his desk. He argued, then agreed the lighting in his space is even WORSE than mine and I some times have to work at his desk if I need to be available on the first floor for quick things from the kids or to receive a package. I thought this was variable height/adjustable. Its not really. The top part is flexible/rubbery so its bendable but if you needed this lower I think it might get awkward. The dimming and color options are perfect its very bright at full strength. I also wanted better light for when I do my nails at home and this is exactly what i needed. Reduces shadows for sure. If I ever get back into knitting this would be good for that, too. I highly recommend this light, its a good deal too. I was shopping around for this for a bit. I also love that this is freestanding as most of the others like this need to be clamped on a desk. It's stable and doesn't wobble. Very happy with this purchase. Though just used it for a call and its making my camera focus in and out a bit"
    },
    {
        "review": "Excellent product!I can angle the light to bounce directly off the ceiling or the back wall, as well as use the direct light on the desk.The ability to change the light to four different color temperatures and easily adjustable brightness features for both the top and bottom lights is great!Best desk lamp I’ve ever owned!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love my Galnolt LED Desk Lamp!Not only does it provide excellent lighting for all of my projects and tasks at my desk, but it is also incredibly versatile. When I have friends over, I use the upper light to illuminate the walls, creating a warm and inviting ambiance without the harshness of a bright overhead light.What I appreciate most is its functionality. It serves as both a practical task lamp and a subtle mood light, making it useful in multiple settings throughout the day. Because of its versatility and thoughtful design, I find myself using it every single day.If you’re looking for a lamp that combines productivity, atmosphere, and style, I highly recommend this one."
