[
    {
        "review": "My old Led desk lamp died. begrudgingly I began researching for a yellow (natural) light replacement. I've stayed away from the weird blue light walmart el cheapos because I've thrown a couple of those in the trash just because of that color.  This lamp is the answer. It's so much nicer than my previous purchases. The light is soft and as bright as you want it. Dims down to night light level if so desired. The spectrum for eye care is spot on, perfectly natural. I'll never use the turn off timer but that usb c charging cord outlet will be used the rest of it's life on my coffee table. Love this new feature more than anything else. So Practical. Awesome lamp, sturdy. Way better than those usb powered lamps."
