    {
        "review": "Was looking for a foldable lamp, small enough to blend into the background, but powerful enough to give good lighting. This fits the bill perfectly for my needs. And at less than 30 bucks from a known brand, I couldn't be happier.I wasn't looking for a touch lamp, but the touch controls work as expected. Very responsive. Light dimming slider works better than expected.Folding joints seem strong. I'll try and update after a while, as the folding feature was the main reason I went with this light.The pictures don't do the actual lighting justice. It gets extremely bright. On any setting. Works well in full daylight.Only 3 big cons for me:First and foremost, the usb charging ports. They only support the 5W/2A. No fast charging, let alone the current super fast charging.For energy efficiency, this light isn't the best. Not the worst I've seen, but not great.It will get hot. The brighter and lighter the settings, the hotter it gets."
