        "review": "Fabulous light with multiple settings . I dont upset the hubby now when reading at night."
    },
    {
        "review": "fast shipping, Item as described, very happy with item"
    },
    {
        "review": "Very good lamp for reading. It has good battery life. So far I haven't needed to charge it. I really like that it has 3 modes and adjustable brightness.  It is light and flexible. It can be folded so that it takes up very little space in the bag. I love that it can stand on its own on a flat surface. It's great for when the power goes out."
    },
    {
        "review": "Awesome little light. Looks good, there are several lighting options from warm to cool, differing brightnesses and it's flexible and easy to use. It makes reading at night enjoyable. Highly recommended."
