[
    {
        "review": "It’s always fun to order from Amazon and get something that’s even better than you imagined. I was pleased from the moment I picked up the well constructed manufacture’s mailing box from my porch. Inside thick precisely cut foam covered the pieces of the lamp, and helped to ensure the lamp arriving in perfect condition. It was easy to put together and  literally took less than a minute. It is a great work surface lamp and all of the features mentioned on Amazon were easily assessable and enhance the purpose of the lamp. I liked the heaviness of the base, the adjustable arm, and the brightness options. Its modern design and clear cut features make it pleasant to look at, and it doesn’t take up too much space. It’s great for detail work, and you can tell the designers put careful thought into function and user satisfaction. I love it, it’s exactly what I needed, and is definitely worth the money!"
    },
    {
        "review": "First of all, I really appreciate a desk lamp that can simulate the warm glow of an incandescent lamp (this is 3k, not 2.7k which is close enough for me). The harsh white/blue colors of many LED lamps don't do it for me but if that is what you want, you can get that here too! In addition, I think it is nice to have a consistent light color throughout the entire house and the warm color is consistent with the rest of my home.I also really appreciate that I can turn it on/off and have it come back on at the LAST SETTINGS that I had previously!! I don't have to re-set my preference every time I turn on the lamp which is not uncommon (I have other lamps that I have to press the button 3-4+ times to get it to the intensity and/or color that I want every time I turn it on). Once you set your preference, it remembers it!It is somewhat of a minimalist design, just enough equipment to do what it needs to do. The black color matches the other things on my desktop. It does have quite a lot of brightness levels which I also appreciate.I find the height to be about right. If it is too tall, it can get in the way, and if it is too short, it may not be flexible enough for enough circumstances. I have my lamp behind the computer monitor, but then position the light over and towards the desktop in front of my screen. I can then reach underneath or around the monitor quite easily to turn the light on/off.Overall good value and nice, thoughtful, functionality."
    },
    {
        "review": "Excellent lighting and adjustability! This is exactly what I needed for my hobby space.⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️Pros:- Adjustable brightness and color temperature make it easy to get the perfect light wether it's bright out or not. I do use a floor lamp as my main light source, and then this on my desk to focus on what I'm working on.- Great for detailed work like paint-by-numbers and helps with reducing eye strain from an overhead light.- Does not heat up, even after hours of use.- Sleek, modern design looks great on my desk.Cons:- Only wish the base had a built-in phone charging port and that would make it perfect to the point where I would buy this for everyone who has a home office.- Adjusting the angle of the rods does make it tilt just a tad. It should've been sturdier for the price."
    },
    {
        "review": "This lamp is perfect for my office space and has many great features such as the tap function to turn on and the ability to dim and adjust it as needed. I initially had issues getting it to turn on in the morning so I reached out to customer service. Not only were they very responsive, but they were kind and very helpful. I was able to resolve the issue and everything works great!"
    },
    {
        "review": "easy to assemble, feels solid, varying color temperature and intensity makes this useful for a variety of functions. Most of the time it just lights my desk, but when I get on a video call, I can set the light to warm, rotate the light toward me, and see a professional-looking image. it’s nice and tall, and flexible, so I can reach everywhere I need to. I haven’t really used the timer feature, but I’m sure that’s cool for the people who need it. The base is nice and heavy, but very thin so it standstill and never seems ready to tip."
    },
    {
        "review": "Very good light, flexible and I really like the variable intensity and temperature. Great for arts & crafts and good for using  even during video calls. For the price,  highly recommend it.  Granted, I have had it for about a week and so far it is great but can't speak of its longevity. The only issue for me, so far is that the base is unstable as the top is heavier so when one extend or move the arm, it is important to press down on the base so that it does not flip over. The instability of the lamp only occurs when the arm is moved or pulled down otherwise it remains stable on the table. Purchasing the top screw version may be a good choice to avoid the lam from falling over. The lamp is very easy to assemble and is aesthetically pleasing."
    },
    {
        "review": "Bought this light almost two years ago.  Provided easy to use and versatile service, until the day I moved it.  Then it stopped working.  Couldn't get it to function at all.  Contacted support, who asked for a video demonstrating that I was using it correctly.  Took a quick video and sent it, and immediately Shirely arranged to have a new unit sent to me.  No additional cost.  I was pleasantly surprised when it arrived a few days later.  New unit works just like the original.  One of the best customer service experiences ever.About the light, its functionality is great.  Variable brightness, ability to change color frequency and easy of positioning all make this light damn good.My only comment for improvement would be the website.  If you register the light, the warranty is extended from two to three years.  Unfortunately, even after trying multiple ways, I was never able to complete the registration.  Hopefully I won't need any more support.Thanks LitONES!"
