        "review": "This replaced a normal living room lamp used for many tasks, from reading to cleaning to eating while watching television. The reason I like this lamp so much is its flexibility. 1) the light is adjustable for warmth, 2) the lamp leds are in 3 sections controlled by a touch, so the larger middle section of leds can be turned on or off just by reaching up and touching an area near them, 3) the main body post and arms have joints so you can move parts of the body around to shine each of the 3 led grouping wherever you want in different directions = ceiling mood light: check, bright work lights: check, mixture: check. The lamp is also sturdilly made and has a heavy base so it doesn't tip over as you move the arms and body post. This is marketed as an architects light, but I think it is the best household lamp I've ever had."
