        "review": "The lamp arrived today, securely packaged and in perfect condition. Assembly was quick and straightforward, and the build quality feels solid. It works exceptionally well with my setup: a 40-inch ultra-wide monitor with a camera mounted on top. Since a top-mounted light wasn’t an option, this desk stand lamp was ideal—it sits nicely beside the monitor’s large base.One tip: turning off the center light panel improves camera performance during video calls. Overall, I’m very satisfied with this lamp—it’s functional, well-designed, and solves a tricky lighting challenge."
