[
    {
        "review": "Impressive light.  It was super easy to mount.  Light is quite bright and the dimming option is very useful.  Nice that it has 5 (?) different color light selections.  Remembers the color and brightness when turned on/off.  Remote works well, even from quite a distance.  I love the adjustability and various positioning options.  The light diffusers work well to prevent hot spots.  Looks good too.  But will it last for years?  Time well tell...About the only thing I don't like is that when the light color is changed, it immediately goes to 100% brightness."
