    },
    {
        "review": "I bought this light for my computer desk in June of 2024. It still works like the first day of purchase!!I got on my Amazon app to search for a light for my sewing table not only for a brighter view of my work space but also for video recording. I was getting so frustrated with the reviews on the lights that I thought would be perfect for my space. I didn't want a light that would be in my way of recording or working. I also need one that wouldn't be too bright and definitely not a glare. After searching the site for several hours and reading tons of reviews I finally decided to search my order history to see exactly what lights I had already ordered for video recording.  This light came up and \"ding\", a light came on in my head. \"Why not get the desk light for the sewing table???\"I did place an order for another desk light since I am so pleased with my first one. Not only is the quality of the light amazing, so is the longevity.  It's been almost 2 years and I have not had one issue with my desk lamp. I'm sure I will be pleased with the new one. Not to mention that the seller is still on Amazon!!  Don't over think it, just get one. You won't be disappointed!"
    },
    {
        "review": "This is a great 24W for my office desk where I spend too much time at LOL. Having good bright and adjustable light and different temperature's is also great when your eyes get tired. When the LED dual head lights are extended, it measures 80cm/ 31.5 inches which covers most of mt (2) 27\" HP monitors. Having the dual LED head able to adjust is great for when I occasional light up the desk for when I take pictures.The top of the light has a sensitive touch buttons, it can easy to control color temperature and brightness individually. It has 5 dimming levels and adjustable 5 color temperatures modes (3,200 K-6,500 K). The LED light also has a memory function that remembers your last Settings when turned on and off. The whole light is supported by a heavy screw clamp that should accommodate most solid surface or desk.The shaft or arm of the light comes in 2 pieces, one solid aluminum and the other is a heavy flexible goose neck that can bend at different areas of the shaft to accommodate heights as much as 33\"/83.8cm. The dual headed LED light also comes with a  remote control that's nice but I personal don't use because if I'm at the desk working, it's easier to just turn the light off and on or do adjustments right in front of me.Once you clamp the light to the desk or table and assembled it, you need to remember to use the screws provided to tighten the arm to the clamp base and the two arms together or it will shake and wobble. I love this dual adjustable headed LED light and when you try to find and compare this light to the big box stores, this is a great value."
    },
    {
        "review": "I ordered this desk lamp off of Vine for my office because I needed one and was remodeling. I was using just a regular light that is on my ceiling and it was creating a glare on my Monitor that was hard on my eyes. This one is much better.It is adjustable. Bendable,  Dimmable and has eye saving features with different colors of light. A White neon type. A medium light and a Warm light that is very easy on the eyes.Setting it up was pretty easy. Clip it all together. put in a few screws. It even came with a mini screw driver. The light has a spot to hide the cord.. Along its side. It clips right in and hides . I thought this was a very nice feature. More should have it. You cannot even see the cord at all.The lamp comes with a remote for hands free operation. It also has 4 buttons on the top to control the brightness. Mode and a timer function. You can turn it off and on to from there.The neck is flexible and bendable so you can set this up in many different ways. The arms of the lamp both pivot 180 degrees. So you can keep it horizontal looking or pivot them to the front for when working on things. reading documents or need to see fine details. The clip was nice and sturdy on my desk. No bends or breaks. I hooked it on pretty tight to. Solid build quality all the way through.All in all I really like it. I think this lamp makes a great office light and can also be a very good workshop light. Or lab light. Or even just a reading lamp for your room. The retail price was more then fair and it just works. No complaints. I love it and can recommend it. Thanks a  ton."
    },
    {
        "review": "I got this for my work as well as my son who gets his homework/ drawings done as assigned in the Google Classroom.  When I am not working,  I tend to fix clothes - put on new buttons or iron as need be. Other table lamps or celling light fixtures even though bright still pale since they tend to light up the whole area/room , thus the brightness gets lost. Dim lighting can affect your eyes.  But with this goose neck lamp which can be adjusted to bring over the monitor adequate lighting is never an issue.  The lamp  beautifully lights up the area it is in. I have a UV Nail Lamp for curing gel polish which comes with a goose neck and I have been love ever since with this feature as it make the lamps quite flexible and adjustable, you can adjust the LED heads to suite to your preference. Via the button on the remote or the feature on the lamp you can adjust the brightness (+/-), colour and ON/ OFF mode. My son keeps on playing with the brightness too. Overall, I am quite impressed."
    },
    {
        "review": "This double-headed LED desk lamp with remote control is an ultra-bright 24 W lamp, ideal for the desk, workbench, drawing table or workshop. Its light is adjustable in intensity and temperature. The two sides of the lamp move and thus offer great versatility. The remote control is also a plus. I love the effect. It's super relaxing and practical for detailed work that requires lighting. Great addition to the office. On the other hand, we would have liked to have the choice of foot to install it: it must be screwed to the edge of the desk, which may not always be practical or ideal."
    },
    {
        "review": "This is a double-head LED lamp that is very bright and raised high on desk edge. The head lights are two LED panels that can rotate 90 degrees horizontal between front and side.It doesn’t have a lamp stand on desk. It has a desk edge mounting bracket that can be mount to a variety of thickness of desk. A fixed metal pole attached to the mounting bracket. Then a flexible goose neck attached to the metal pole which then hold the LED heads. The goose neck can be adjusted to any angle of your choice. Both the metal pole and the flexible goose neck bring the LED heads very high over desk that you can place monitors underneath the LED heads.Both LED panels can independently rotate at axis of the center of the LED heads. On top of the center of LED heads there are 4 touch buttons: power on/off, light color temperature, dim and brightness. These buttons are very sensitive and responsive.In addition to the control buttons on the LED heads, the desk lamp comes with tiny remote control for convenience. It has exactly the same 4 buttons as those on the LED heads.The desk lamp comes with a special power adapter which provides 24V/1A power for the lamp. The wire attached to the LED heads can be inserted into the slots of the goose neck and metal pole, so that it is not visible. A very detailed design. Excellent.The bottom screw plate of the mounting bracket is kind of small compare to the weight of the lamp that it needs to hold. Not sure if it will be strong enough and durable. So far so good.Very good desk lamp. Highly recommend."
    }
]

