        "review": "good size for small spaces, various types of light color and dimming option with a USBA charger -- sturdy and not likely to tip over with a small platform base that will allow for small items to rest on it as well.  It does have an auto dimming feature, but I found it to be annoying as the light will change brightness w/o notice several times per hour -- I guess depending upon the light from a window for instance.  In a stable environment, it might stay steady, but I find it better to just dim it myself when appropriate. easy to Assemble, uses a type C slot and plugs into the wall with its own cord and adapter.  Nice matte finish and stylish"
    },
