        "review": "finally rec'd this lamp after ordering twice due to typical issues with delivery!! It's got a good base (perfect for hardwood), solid construction, easy-peasy assembly, nice lighting with great options and the remote is magnetic and sticks to the lamp (lamp neck also has basic controls). One review complained about adjusting the height, that is done by adjusting the little silver knob on the neck, pay attention, it is intuitive. Worth the price, and I'm ordering another one. Lighting options suck in CA, but we have been stuck w/Newscum! 4 stars b/c I haven't had much of a chance to use the lamp and the base should be more stable for carpet, otherwise 5 stars!"
