        "review": "The light is very bright and covers a wide area, which makes it great for studying or reading. I also like that the light can be adjusted in different directions, so I can easily illuminate exactly where I need it. The adjustable height is convenient as well. Overall, it’s a practical and versatile floor lamp, and I’m very satisfied with it."
