        "review": "I admit; I ordered this partly because of the excellent price. But I'm a little surprised by how great this lamp is! It looks really nice with the chair in the corner of my room, and it was so easy to put together—I did it in about a minute. I also like the adjustment options, and I love all of the modes (reading, work, etc.) for lighting levels and color. It makes it very comfortable for me to sit and write at my computer. And the remote is a great help, so I don't have to reach behind me and turn it off. I don't usually write reviews (just stars), but I had to about this lamp!"
