[
    {
        "review": "I purchased this flexible led light because my old magnifying lamp finally failed on me. My old magnifying lamp lasted a good twenty years. This new led light is very bright, has multiple lights on it. It’s flexible for what I need. It’s mainly use for my repairs I do. The price was only $32! Really affordable! I have no complaints about it. I’ll definitely buy another one just to have a spare one."
    },
    {
        "review": "Nice light with four levels of brightness and four different degrees of color warmth. Daylight to warm yellow. I use at my desk for model building and like the fact that it reaches over and across my workspace which helps reduce shadows."
    },
    {
        "review": "I was delighted to find and order the AILBTON Bright LED Desk Lamp. It arrived very well packaged and appeared to have been very well designed and constructed. Having installed it about 10 days ago, and using it every day, it is perfect for my situation. I have it installed on the far left side of my desk, and have it extended fully so it lights my keyboard and monitor. Wonderful. It is free of flicker, and the black color fits to office very well. No assembly required.My one suggestion for the manufacturer is that the on button is difficult to find in a darkened office. I have placed a small sticker on the side to find the button easily now. Problem solved.  See photo."
    },
    {
        "review": "I purchased this LED desk lamp for my husband, and he really likes the adjustable swing arm design. The clamp holds securely to the desk, and the flexibility makes it easy to position the light exactly where it’s needed.The dimmable feature works as expected, and it provides decent lighting for everyday tasks. It’s not extremely bright, but it does the job for regular desk use.If you’re looking for a sleek, adjustable lamp with multiple brightness settings, this is a solid option. Just keep in mind it may not be as powerful as some larger task lights.Recommendation: Yes — good for general desk use, but not for those needing very intense lighting."
    },
    {
        "review": "I like the position, brightness, tone adjustments. I like that I can easily fold it away when it’s not in use."
    },
    {
        "review": "Not as expected.  While these work - they droop a lot.  Causing the first section (with the switches) to have to be nearly vertical to support the arms.  If you have at any type of angle beyond 30 degrees from vertical - the lamp parts start to slowly descend.I may or may not return these - If I can get someone to respond I may try to tighten them - since if they worked they would be ok, but my initial reaction is poor."
    },
    {
        "review": "When this lamp arrived, my first thought was that it looked like something borrowed from a dentist's office, an architect's desk, or possibly a low-budget science fiction movie.My wife immediately clamped it onto her pottery worktable and declared it perfect.As it turns out, she was right. The adjustable arms make it easy to position the light exactly where it's needed, and it does an excellent job of filling in the shadows on cloudy days or late afternoons when natural light isn't cooperating. The light is bright, even, and makes it easier to see texture, details, and surface work without constantly repositioning pieces.It's not the most conventional-looking lamp I've ever seen, but after watching it in use for a while, I stopped noticing how it looked and started appreciating how well it worked. In the pottery studio, that's about as high a compliment as a tool can get."
    },
    {
        "review": "I have searched for and bought so many different kinds of lights for my sewing machine station. None of them have been satisfactory until this light.  There are two important properties I need. Brightness and flexibility. First Brightness: I am 80 and need a lot of light where the needle is stitching. Yes there is a sewing machine light that turns on when the machine is running but even though it gets hot enough to burn skin, it is frustratingly  dim. This desk light has 4 color temperature settings from warm to cold controlled by one button and 4 brightness levels controlled by another button so 16 different choices in all. These are regulated by lightly touched buttons on the lowest arm and the highest brightness out shines any other light I have tried. AND there is no flicker like many LEDs. So many lights have claimed amazing brightness only to be completely useless. Flexibility: A sewing machine is a very challenging lighting problem since the needle (where the work is happening) is hidden under the mass of the machine. The  light has to be mounted on the right side of the machine so it doesn't block the movement of fabric. The right side of the machine is also solid and won't let any light pass through! Ideally it has to be located between the sewer and the machine so the sewer does not throw a shadow. This desk light offers EXTREME flexibility with 4 joints which all articulate in multiple ways but once the arms are set where I want the angles do not slip. The light might look very awkward in its placement on my table (and please excuse the mess!) but the outermost arm is throwing light exactly where I need it.  The fabric can easily move underneath it. The other two arms are lighting up the overall table nicely. It is very well made and the clamp keeps the light steady even with such a long reach.  I love this light."
    },
    {
        "review": "Really good for Miniature painting, this Light Bends and Folds in every position you need it, really bright, easy to use, great great quality. Highly recommend to any miniature enthusiast"
    },
    {
        "review": "This lamp was exactly what I was looking for in a gift for my husband.It not only looks good, it was simple to set up, easy to use / adjust and the variety of colourways lend themselves to many uses. As well as for general office work, the lamp can be used for crafting, remote calling and videos, which is what drew me to it in the first place.The lamp is so good, I may just buy one for myself ..."
    },
    {
        "review": "I bought this around a year and a half ago, and it's been great for my desk. I use it as lighting for zoom calls, detailed sculpting work and also as a bright enough light alternative to the ceiling lights. It's also long enough for my desk with multiple monitors.Generally moving the arms was good, and they would hold position really well- sadly though, it has recently broken at the base between the arm and the desk grip. The screw broke off and has damaged the inside of the arm and the base itself, making it nigh on impossible to repair despite multiple attempts. This makes sense because of the frequency of my moving the arm, but a bit more stability would've been great.Overall a good item, but I'd have loved more longevity."
    },
    {
        "review": "Fully adjustable lamp arm with three lights which have brightness controls.  Perfect for providing light in different directions by folding the extendable arm.  Perfect for intricate detail work."
    },
    {
        "review": "Very good flexibility and range of angles. Thought it would be good for crafting and painting minis but even on max light is not bright enough. Good build quality and length of cable for power."
    }
]

[
    {
        "review": "The EZIYIN Desk Lamp LED Bulb Included, Small Bedside Table Lamp Plug-in is one of those rare finds that proves you don’t need complicated features or a high price tag to get excellent quality and performance. From the moment I unboxed it, I was impressed by how thoughtfully designed and practical it is for everyday use.Beautiful, Timeless DesignThe first thing that stands out is its classic aesthetic. The wood-style base gives the lamp a warm, natural feel that instantly makes a room more inviting. Paired with the flaxen fabric shade, it creates a cozy, modern look that fits seamlessly into almost any décor style—whether that’s minimalist, farmhouse, contemporary, or traditional.Its compact size is another huge advantage. It fits perfectly on a small bedside table, narrow desk, dorm shelf, or entryway console without overwhelming the space. Despite its smaller footprint, it doesn’t feel cheap or flimsy. The construction feels sturdy and stable, giving it a reassuring sense of quality.Ready to Use Right Out of the BoxOne of the most convenient features is that it comes with an LED bulb included. This might seem like a small detail, but it makes a big difference. There’s no need to make an extra trip to the store or worry about finding the correct bulb type. Simply unpack it, screw in the included bulb, plug it in, and it’s ready to go.For anyone setting up a new bedroom, apartment, dorm room, or office space, this plug-and-play convenience is incredibly helpful.Warm and Comfortable LightingThe lighting performance is excellent for its intended purpose. The included LED bulb emits a warm, soft glow that’s easy on the eyes and perfect for winding down in the evening. The fabric shade diffuses the light beautifully, preventing harsh glare and creating a relaxing atmosphere.It’s ideal for:Bedside readingAmbient evening lightingCreating a cozy bedroom environmentSoft desk lighting for light tasksNursery or guest room lightingThe light feels calm and soothing rather than overly bright or clinical. It strikes a perfect balance between functional and atmospheric.Energy Efficient and PracticalBecause it uses an LED bulb, it’s energy efficient and long-lasting. That means lower energy consumption and less frequent bulb replacements over time. The inline on/off switch on the cord is simple and convenient, especially for bedside use where you don’t want to fumble behind furniture.Everything about this lamp feels designed for ease and everyday practicality.Incredible Value for the PriceConsidering the stylish design, included LED bulb, solid construction, and dependable lighting performance, the value is outstanding. It delivers exactly what most people want in a bedside or small desk lamp: reliability, warmth, simplicity, and affordability.There are no unnecessary bells and whistles—just clean design and dependable performance.Final VerdictThe EZIYIN Desk Lamp is an excellent choice for anyone looking for a small, stylish, and functional lighting!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I am very mixed about this product. The lamp is small, but in the right places it works great! It has a small footprint so it can go in many places. But with its size, it may not work in place of a lamp that is more of a statement piece.The design is aesthetically pleasing and the colors fits well with many color schemes in my home. I currently have two of them on the top of my wardrobe amongst some of my display items. The bulb that comes with the lamp is warm and nice to accent a room or area, but it really does not put out much light at all. If you are looking for a low light lamp like for on a nightstand, then this would be great. I changed out the bulbs and put in bulbs I already had and now they put out a good amount of light.The lamps were easy to set up and easy to use. The instructions that came with the lamp are very hard to read (not native English speakers) and mention a USB port and touch controls and a remote, which are not included or part of this product, and are also not mentioned on the product description on the Amazon page. The price was right, even though I got them at a great price because they were on sale, the regular price I think would still be reasonable.I love the product as is and it was as I was expecting, but I a a little concerned that maybe I was supposed to have more to this lamp. No matter, it is still a good deal."
