    {
        "review": "Finding a reliable desk light that balances a compact footprint with excellent brightness can completely transform your study or work routine. This LED Desk Lamp in Blue is an absolute standout, earning a perfect 5/5 rating for delivering exceptional utility, a great form factor, and eye-caring performance without any unnecessary fuss.Right out of the box, the vibrant blue finish adds a fun, modern pop of color that looks fantastic on a home office desk, bedside table, or a college dorm room setup. The physical design is highly practical; the flexible gooseneck allows you to smoothly adjust the angle to point the light exactly where you need it most. One of the best features is that the design is completely self-contained; it doesn't require you to purchase or install a separate lightbulb, making it ready to plug in and use immediately.Performance-wise, the 4.5W energy-saving LED provides the perfect amount of light. It is bright enough for focused reading, studying, or working late into the night, yet engineered to be soft and eye-caring so it won't cause eye strain or harsh glare. The lamp also features a generous 1.6-meter power cord, which gives you plenty of flexibility to comfortably reach distant wall outlets without needing an extension cord. If you are looking for a compact, energy-efficient, and stylish lighting solution that delivers perfect illumination and great reach, this lamp is highly recommended."
