    {
        "review": "The design, price, and effectiveness are perfect. This season too, I had a sudden outbreak and couldn't stop my runny nose and tears while I was sleeping, so I immediately bought this for my bedroom! I'm glad it was a time sale. It's very quiet. On the first day, it smelled like the inside of a new car, but on the second day it didn't bother me. I haven't had any symptoms since installing it."
