    {
        "review": "Great air filter.  It is small enough to tuck into an out of the way space and runs very quietly so it is not noticeable.  I like having the option to turn the display off so it keeps the bedroom dark.We noticed an improvement in the air quality the first night as it removed the pollen, which has been horrible this year.  My family and I sleep through the night without getting all congested,  I purchased two units so my son has one in his room as well.The aromatherapy option is wonderful as well so we can add a relaxing scent to let us drift off to sleep easily.It appears well built and changing the filters is very easy to accomplish.  I especially like the washable pre-filter as it collect teh pet hair on it and will make the Hepa filter last longer.  I am looking forward to many years of use out of this ."
