    },
    {
        "review": "I had been struggling with terrible allergies in my home, so I bought this air purifier on an impulse after reading reviews. I’m honestly so glad I did because the difference has been incredible. Setup was unbelievably easy. All I had to do was take it out of the box, remove the plastic wrapping from the filter, plug in the power cord, and turn it on. Within the first night, the air quality reading dropped from 159 to under 20, which really impressed me.The biggest thing I noticed was how much fresher and cleaner my home felt almost immediately. I could actually tell a difference in the air quality, especially when waking up in the morning. It’s also surprisingly quiet, even when running for long periods of time, so it doesn’t disturb sleep or everyday activities.Update after over a month of use: this has honestly been one of the best purchases I’ve made for my home. The improvement with my allergies was night and day. I used to constantly wake up congested and sneezing, and now my symptoms are so much more manageable. My house gets less dusty which makes less sweeping and dusting.  My favorite feature is the automatic mode. It adjusts the fan speed on its own depending on the air quality, which is so convenient. I especially notice it when we’re cooking dinner — the purifier automatically ramps up to a higher setting while the air quality changes, then lowers itself again once everything is back to normal.I also appreciate that it works so effectively without needing constant adjustments or attention from me. It has become one of those appliances I barely think about anymore because it just quietly does its job in the background. Looking back, I only wish I had purchased it sooner."
