        "review": "I bought one with a similar design a long time ago and I really liked it, I opted for this secondary one because it has the same thing except the Wi-Fi connection, which is not extremely necessary if you are often at home. The truth is that the power of the fan impressed me, because of how much air it can move. I have dogs and they bring a lot of dust and hair, it is fascinating how the automatic mode manages to turn on the fan at high power as soon as they enter and shake it off, the dirt it has is an accumulation of a month and a half, despite being somewhat covered it still manages to move and clean a lot of air. I just wish the cord was longer so I didn't have to use an extension cord or had something to hang on to it."
