        "review": "This air purifier has its pluses and minuses, I bought this because, I have a small bedroom that has poor ventilation and needed something to help with air quality in that room. On the plus side, it is quiet, you can minimize the light on it, and the filters are easy to find and replace. However, my main problem is all the little ventilation holes around the base are nearly impossible to clean. After my first attempt at the review the company has since reached out to me and offered some cleaning solutions. They said “ We recommend gently cleaning them with a soft, dry cloth. If needed, a slightly damp cloth can be used, but please ensure the unit is unplugged and completely dry before turning it back on.”the second minus is the filters can be pricey, however, they are slightly pricey for me. They are do run at a cheaper price than most others major companies out there. The company also reached out to me and offered me a couple of free filters to get me by so they really do care. It is not a horrible air purifier I just wish they would have designed the outside a bit differently. However, I do appreciate there a company that listens to their consumer ,and really wants to change things. It’s not that often that companies do that, so if you’re looking for an air purifier that works from a company who really does care this is the one for you."
