    {
        "review": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Actually Gets Rid of Smoke OdorI bought this because my boyfriend smokes THC, and somehow the smell was making its way out of our bedroom and into my son’s clothes. He’s young and goes to school, so having him show up smelling like smoke was obviously a HUGE problem.This air purifier has made a noticeable difference. My boyfriend smokes in our bedroom with the door closed and the window open, and we leave the purifier running all the time. As soon as he starts smoking, you can actually hear it kick into a higher gear like it knows it has work to do. 😂Most importantly, my son’s clothes no longer smell like smoke. That alone makes this worth it for me. We also have several dogs, and I’ve noticed the house just smells fresher overall.If you’re dealing with smoke, pets, or both, this thing WORKS. Very happy with it."
