        "review": "I am quite critical of the products, and there I have nothing to complain about. The airtok purifier keeps its promises. It is noisy at maximum speed, barely more efficient than at speed 2, the noise of which is minimal. You can't hear it at all in speed 1 and night mode, and yet it does its job. I was finally able to enjoy my living room and sleep without the smell of cannabis smoked by my neighbor (it's not CBD, no). There are construction sites near my home, the air is dusty and humid. In one hour of operation, this device managed to reduce the discomfort significantly. The timer works well, and is very practical. In operation, it cools the room, which suits me, but perhaps not for everyone (some models heat up). a little abused"
