        "review": "No dust after using. House gets dusty quick since setting up no noticeable dust for months so must be cleaning the air. Very quiet"
    },
    {
        "review": "I love this thing! Quiet. Easy to set up. App is simple and intuitive yet has lots of features."
    },
    {
        "review": "Great quality and fast to be delivered!"
    }
