        "review": "Very easy to set up, very quiet on sleep mode, cannot be heard at all. It is in a bedroom that spent hours on red on the air quality monitor but later changed to blue, had better sleep last night.The size is okay and design looks good.I just set it on auto as it has an ambient light sensor that automatically changes to sleep mode when it gets dark in the room.Odour removal is also perfect.It is worth all the money."
