        "review": "This is the second time I have purchased this purifier and that speaks volumes about how satisfied I am with it. I now have 2 and it has been an excellent investment to keep the air cleaner, especially in rooms where I spend many hours. It is easy to use, works quietly and you can notice the difference in the air quality. In addition, the filters are easy to replace and the equipment has proven to be reliable over time. It is also at a very good price when buying from others."
