    {
        "review": "I have had this pot for more than 1 year and I consider it to be the best purchase!!! The pot is made of steel so it does not scratch or come off as toxic entities, the cooking times are well established on each button. Hagi from steamed salads to roasted meats and beans!! Very good"
    }
