        "review": "This is my 2nd toothbrush ordered, the first one lasted about 2 years until it eventually stopped holding a charge. The second one has lasted only 9 months. When I first received it, I had to press the power button about 3 times to get it to turn on or off. The previous brush had this issue occasionally, so I thought nothing of it. Now I am having to press the button about 10 times before it will do anything, even with a full charge. While it is still under warranty, it requires sending it to Oral-B for review, leaving me without a toothbrush in the meantime. So unfortunately I bought another one. I otherwise like the toothbrush and it does what it needs to do for the price."
