        "review": "... this is an excellent toothbrush. I feel fortunate to buy it at this price ... Any doubts I might have had are completely resolved. This is not a scam. It comes with a charger. It is high tech compared to the round brush thing and most certainly the $150+ mess (my former electric toothbrushes).Multiple daily uses for two weeks. The battery alone is a buying point. My advice (for battery health) treat this wonderful gadget like a mini-smartphone:​The 20-80% Rule: Use the toothbrush! BUT only charge when you notice the motor slowing down slightly (usually around 10–20% battery remaining).​Unplug it once it reaches a full charge. Because your new brush has a long battery life, you'll likely only need to do this once every few weeks.*The price is amazing... maybe this is a wild test market !??I ordered another one today ... based SOLELY on how well it cleans my teeth."
