        "review": "My 10 year old daughter dreamed of having an electric toothbrush. Thanks to the Amazon Vine program, I was able to have him test this product for free. I have feedback after several weeks of use which is very positive. My daughter never had any problems brushing her teeth but having a small jaw she had difficulty accessing the back teeth. Thanks to this toothbrush, its ergonomic shape helps it scrub in all areas without forgetting a single one. In fact, the toothbrush vibrates when you need to change areas and turns off when brushing is finished. It reassures the child and brings him a certain satisfaction. The teeth are much whiter and healthier. The different cleaning modes allow you to adjust the brushing power on certain days if, for example, you forgot to brush your teeth or depending on what you eat, if you have something stuck in your teeth. It is powerful, effective and supplied with replacement brushes. Plus, the charge lasts really well for months, we love it! 🤩"
    },
    {
        "review": "I ordered this as dentist recommended I buy an electric toothbrush but I’ve never rated them, I saw this one good reviews and was very reasonably priced so I thought I’d give it a go. Wow! It has multiple settings for cleaning, polishing etc, it has 3 different intensities/speeds and the first vibration level is great never mind the third. My teeth have never felt so clean & looked so polished. Honestly I’ve bought the more expensive ones before and they just don’t do the job like this one. I’m ordering them for my partner and kids because I’m so amazed at how good it is. You also get 2 years warranty so be sure to register that because for £10 with 2 years warranty is quite frankly a bargain. It comes charged ready for use which is a bonus as I thought I was going to have to faff about charging but I got to use it right away. It even comes with 4 heads meaning I don’t have to fork out for new heads for a while. I’m so happy with it I’ll be telling all my friends and family to buy it. Don’t hesitate just get it genuinely you won’t regret it! Best thing I’ve bought in a long time. Thank you so much!"
    },
    {
        "review": "A quality toothbrush at a very competitive price to ensure that children brush their teeth better. The toothbrush vibrates every 30 seconds to change the brushing area in the mouth. It is designed for brushing in 4 zones (high front / high back / low front / low back). I just regret the charging socket which is not USB-C but a specific round socket which is much less common."
    },
    {
        "review": "Functional electric toothbrush with an excellent price/performance ratio. It has a body and weight in line with similar products on the market. It arrives with a package where in addition to the toothbrush there are two pairs of heads with replacement bristles, one soft, one harder and with a charging cable with USB end to be used with a smartphone-type charger not included. The color and materials are pleasant and appear to be of good quality. On the body there are two buttons, one to turn the toothbrush on, adjust the vibration intensity to three levels and turn it off, the other to choose between five modes of how the vibration alternates, including the continuous one that I am personally using. Overall I didn't find any shortcomings and it works well. it would have been perfect if it had the USB cable connection also on the body of the toothbrush and a support base even if it stands up without problems even without anything."
