        "review": "Not bad but not as good as Philips Sonicare.  Had a Sonicare diamond but it has died after years of use.  Read some good reviews of Oral-B but it's not as impressive as the reviews say.  Doesn't clean my teeth as well as Sonicare.UPDATE: I have changed my mind on this.  I actually think this is better than Sonicated.  I have changed the way I brush to suit this toothbrush and I have really ended up liking it.  Changing to a 5 star.  Would buy again."
