        "review": "Bought 2 of these, one for myself and my husband. Love them. Easy to use, my teeth feel cleaner and actually looked whiter and I haven't changed anything else except the toothbrush. I also got them to help protect our gums because I had some recession from brushing too hard. I was worried about mixing up whose toothbrush was whose, but each brush head has a different symbol on it, so it's easy to tell apart."
    },
