[
    {
        "review": "just got this toothbrush, and I am exceptionally impressed! It completely blew my expectations out of the water. I love that there's an app that tracks your brushing time and the amount of pressure you use. The battery life is amazing, and I also love that it comes with its own travel case and multiple brush heads designed for different dental needs.My teeth feel incredibly clean after every use, and I've already noticed it helps with surface stains. I love coffee, so having a toothbrush that keeps my teeth looking their best is really important to me.I previously had a Philips toothbrush, but it wasn't on this level. This has definitely been a huge upgrade, and I couldn't be happier with it. I also travel a lot, so the travel case is a total game changer.I highly recommend this toothbrush to anyone who cares about their oral health and wants excellent at-home dental care. It's worth every penny!"
