    },
    {
        "review": "Well packaged, arrived when stated. Top notch electric tooth brush, purchased two units 2 months ago. 3 speeds, 3 cleaning methods - whitens, cleans, whitens + clean. Good battery life. Had to buy cord for charger, but not a problem when considering how well this works. Comes with 2 brushes. Highly recommend."
    },
    {
        "review": "This toothbrush is awesome. First of all, you can tell how much battery life is left by the three dots at the base. So much better than the last Sonicare toothbrush that I owned. The clean level is perfect for a thorough brushing.  Not too hard or damaging to your gums. I love the travel case too, because it's the same size as the toothbrush. Takes up less space when traveling than my old one did."
    },
    {
        "review": "Overall, this is a great electric toothbrush. It cleans well, has good battery life, and leaves my teeth feeling fresh after every use. The only reason I gave it 4 stars is because I miss my older Sonicare model, which had more cleaning modes and customization options. If you’re coming from a basic toothbrush, you’ll probably love it, but if you’re upgrading from an older premium Sonicare, you may notice some missing features. Overall, it’s still a solid toothbrush that I’d recommend."
    },
    {
        "review": "This is my first electric toothbrush and I really like it! It comes with a lot of battery already on it so I haven't even charged it yet and I've been using it for a few weeks. It seems heavy duty and I like the options for sensitivity, whitening, etc. The app is neat too so I can see stats on how much I've brushed, how many brushes until I have to charge it again, and can easily buy brushes heads. I feel like the brush is the right size for my mouth and I'm glad I got this upgraded version!"
