        "review": "HOLY SMOKES!  This is by far the best Sonicare toothbrush I have owned.  We have been using Sonicare brushes for the last 23 years and have gone through several (always bought the two in one pack from big box store) over the years.  Well mine puttered out so I needed just one so where do I go?  You got it.  Amazon. :)  After much research and reading all reviews I decided to give this one a try.  WOWZA what a difference in vibration & noise level.  I think all Sonicare brushes are on the expensive side but once you try you just can't go back.  That being said the value for this particular brush was within budget range so I jumped and boy am I glad I did.  I LOVE IT!"
    }
