        "review": "My product came used the toothbrush itself was all covered in dirt the whole body of the toothbrush and then there were 3 pieces of toilet paper bunched up in the box now this is serious here sending people who buy brand new merchandise stuff like this and it has actually been happening to me frequently I used to see reviews about it and thought maybe they weren't true but now I'm learning that this is actually happening so without a doubt I'm telling you to buy this toothbrush somewhere else!!!! We were upgrading from a spinbrush so this was expensive for us for the toothbrush and especially the replacement heads it's a nice upgrade charging it with a plug instead of batteries like before and having options for the speed on the toothbrush and also the timer for brushing your teeth for 2 minutes and it's nice you get 2 different toothbrush heads to see which you prefer for your own personal preferences but getting a used toothbrush just grosses me out and it's wrong I purchased a new one I was so excited about getting a better and more advanced toothbrush but so disappointed once I received it"
    },
    {
        "review": "Was skeptical if I'd like this any more than the cheaper Oral-B 1000, but it has exceeded expectations. It's quieter and gentler on the lowest setting. My only skepticism remaining is around the brush head, which is recessed in the middle. I am not sure on how thorough a job that shape does, as it feels like only the edges touch my teeth. However, I can replace with a different style head when replacement is due. Has good battery life so far. Would recommend, it is worth the money for this upgrade."
