    {
        "review": "This Toothbrush is amazing. I've never been able to own a Toothbrush like this one. Coming from a certain OB type one its certainly refreshing to have a toothbrush that works in a completely different way and cleans even better than my old one ever did.It has a 'sonic' vibrating motor inside that is very powerful and moves the brush head considerably more than my old toothbrush so it can reach more area of the teeth and get into places your old one couldn't. The toothbrush has many settings, Clean, Polish, Milder, White and Massage (Each Setting Shown in the video).A con of the device would possibly be that even though it comes with a USB-C charger that it does in fact take 2 hours to fully charge, which if your in a hurry to get somewhere and it has died, you can bet you will be leaving the house without brushed teeth. However the pro fact here majorly outweighs the con, this is because the actual life of the battery is immense. When I purchased this product about a month ago, before writing this review, I have only charged it once and it still seems to have loads of power left. Once! A single charge in an entire month! In certainly did not expect this. This is absolutely amazing given that my last toothbrush had the life expectancy of a few days to a week. Even less as the old toothbrush was very old and I thought it was time for an upgrade, and you can bet, I got one!The actual brush head has lasted the entire month too. Its not warped in any particular way that makes it look old but in fact makes it still look brand new. (As shown in the video). This, coupled with the 8 extra brush heads leads to the conclusion that this toothbrush might last an entire year, or more, without having to pay any extra money for replacement brush heads, something which I found myself constantly doing with my old Toothbrush which in turn cost a lot of money just for the heads themselves.I also noticed that the toothbrush works and cleans your teeth even without Toothpaste, of course I only tried this as a one off experiment to see what all the fuss was about regarding the sonicare technology and to see if it genuinely cleared the plaque off my teeth and to my surprise, it did a good job. (This may not be the same result for everyone as this was only tried once, and not again, so please do not take my word for it.)All in all, I would say that this product is a very good one, its affordable, uses newer sonicare tech instead of a rotating brush head, saves you money in the long term and can last an entire month on a single charge! Id definitely recommend this product to anyone, especially someone like myself who needed an upgrade from an outdated one to a cheap affordable one that gets the job done and done well.Would definitely recommend. Thank you for reading.P.S. I would like to add, at this time of posting this review, I cannot upload any photos or videos due to a problem with my phone, however, I can assure that upon reading this review, you should be able to use the given information (and other information on reviews on this product) to be able to possibly make a good decision to upgrade to a brand new toothbrush that is definitely worth the upgrade. Thank you for reading."
