    {
        "review": "Makes my teeth feeling incredibly clean, I wish it came with another tooth brush head, thus why I give it a 4/5 stars. Other than that the design is sleek, easy to use, and I like that you can change the cleaning type and the vibration strength. It comes with standing charger as well as I like how you can take it with you anywhere and use the travel case to charge without having to bring the standing charger. Overall it's been great."
