        "review": "A great toothbrush!!  My husband and I both purchased one 4 years ago. They are both still going strong and still hold a good charge. I am going to purchase a new one for myself, as the on /off button is getting harder to use. But after 4 years of twice daily use, I'm not complaining!! I will purchase the same one, as I like having to same brush heads to buy for my husband and myself."
