        "review": "I am extremely satisfied with this toothbrush! The build quality and cleaning performance are excellent, easily matching top brands like Oral-B for a fraction of the cost.What makes this a smart buy is the value: it comes with 8 replacement brush heads, which will easily last up to two years without buying extra refills. Even if it lasts a couple of years, you can replace the entire set twice and still spend less than buying a single high-end unit from major brands.The pressure sensor is a game-changer. It lights up if you brush too hard, which completely stopped my gums from bleeding. My teeth feel thoroughly clean, and my overall oral health has noticeably improved. Highly recommended for anyone looking for premium quality on a budget"
