    {
        "review": "I bought this to replace a Philipps that I had been using for about three years. I didn’t have the money to spend on another Philipps so, I tried this one, after reading all the great reviews. At first, the toothbrush was absolutely amazing, not quite as strong as my old Phillips, but a solid replacement and an excellent price point.. I guess I should have just paid the extra money because now I have to buy a new toothbrush anyway! It started turning off by itself randomly while I was using it, every time after a full charge-up over night! It kept doing this and made the daily task of brushing my teeth, after suffering two strokes this year, even more of a difficult task. I charged it and it turned green, I removed it from the charger and now it won’t even turn on at all! I tried plugging it in again. Nothing. No charge no power nothing. I have only had it for two months! Now I have nothing to use to brush my teeth, as the back and forth manual motion isn’t possible for me right now, due to medical reasons, and I can not afford to purchase another one. It was so affordable, and I was so excited, and it was working so well, and made me teeth so clean, and everything about it was so awesome, until, after 2 months it died… too good to be true. It just makes me very sad."
