        "review": "Great Laptop. I had it in 2 short days after ordering it.Price was great also."
    },
    {
        "review": "For a basic laptop in the budget range, it appears to work fairly well. Set-up was easy (a bit time-consuming with Windows updates but that's how things go). The fit and feel of the laptop is good. This is a replacement for a crashed 3 year old HP Pavilion that had the motherboard die on it. As others have mentioned, having a backlit keyboard would be nice, but I knew what I was getting. Speed is good and getting my settings changed to how I like them went smoothly. I use a wireless mouse, so can't comment on the touchpad very much as I never liked them. My only issue is the warantee ... the seller registered the device about 11 months ago, so I will not get the full manufacturer's warantee as stated in the listing. Hopefully, it won't be necessary but I was a little gun shy after the previous HP fried the motherboard after only 3 years (although with a lot of travel involved). I had to spring for the 2 year warrantee through Amazon just in case."
    },
    {
