        "review": "So at the coupon price of $16 this little speaker is a great value. I use it with hook and loop tape to attach to cart wilst golfing.The bass is a low level output at all volumes, however sound from unit can get quite loud. The light only fades from color to color (not synced to music) and can be turned off for longer battery life. It does come with a quick start up guide, charging cable and a small lanyard to hang/wear with. A thought, if having trouble with paring or  a speaker freeze, long press power button for 8 seconds to reset.With all that said, I totally would recommend it for the value, and no worries if it gets damaged from misuse.Get it at a discount/coupon price."
