    {
        "review": "Incredible, the sound is terrible, much better than Sony srx, very pretty, very easy to use, the GSM recharge function as well. To see in the long term if it is reliable... Perfect packaging... I love it, incredible value for money"
    },
    {
        "review": "It is very difficult to find a product in this price range and with this sound quality. As someone who uses Motion +, this is revolutionary. What can I say about paying more than necessary for well-known brands when this device is available? It is impossible to increase the sound above 50% in a home environment!.."
    },
    {
        "review": "It gives a very satisfactory sound. Reasonable price compared to its equivalents"
    },
    {
        "review": "The materials are robust, very simple and refined design, pleasant to look at. For the size, the sound is really excellent (true stereo): very present bass, but never too excessive, gives depth to the sound and a nice roundness. The mids are very pleasant, the voices are very well reproduced and natural. The power is important: certainly, we are far from true 80w, but there is a lot of volume. Can be used without problem even outdoors, in large spaces, as well as at home to listen to music at low volume, enjoying a pleasant and round sound. The battery lasts a very long time, especially when you turn off the lights, a nice gadget but not very useful. Overall: excellent product, so much so that I only ordered a second one, by pairing the two speakers we reach a maximum power of 160 w for a maximum value of 200€ (2 times 99€) very profitable. Excellent for watching a movie on a tablet. Versatile speaker that lends itself to all uses and all spaces. Well above the JBL brand of the same range, lighter, less expensive and better sound. Two small negative points (but really because I'm annoying) there is no possibility of plugging in a USB key, micro SD card or jack socket, too bad and no notch to put a strap. You can purchase it and you will not be disappointed."
