    },
    {
        "review": "This is one very impressive Bluetooth Speaker. So good in fact that within a hour of the delivery of the first one I bought another one. I can't wait to hear how 2 sound connected with the way the first one sounds. Im not easily impressed when it comes to music and sounds being a bit of a audiophile. But I am completely and totally impressed with this speaker. It's just that good. The bass is even better than I expected. The clarity and volume are equally impressive. It connected to my phone and my tablet without a second wasted. It looks good, sounds amazing and is going to be difficult to beat . It's fairly heavy for it's size which surprised me. It's really that good. You won't be disappointed if you buy one . It's versatility and functionality are as impressive as it's sound quality. I went for a ride in my hot rod Jeep CJ5 and had no problem hearing the speaker loud and clear. And my jeep isn't exactly quiet but I heard every note and verse without any problems. Can't wait until I get the 2nd one I just ordered. Im not exaggerating, it really is that good !Update... I received the 2nd speaker and it is just as I expected as far as sound quality and performance. They sound fantastic and the difference between having a single speaker and having a 2nd speaker is significant but not as significant as I expected it to be. I thought that the bass and mid range sounds would increase and that would improve the only thing I think needs improvement with these speakers. That's the Bass and Midrange sound quality. They have Bass and Midrange sound but I think it could be or should have been much better with 2 speakers. There was a improvement but not as much as I expected There would be. There aren't 2 passive radiators on the rear that I can see. There's a long oval shaped thing that I guess is what they are calling w passive radiator. Even using my Dolby Sound app on my phone and the different sound levels and music type preset equalizer settings still produces little or no noticeable Bass or Midrange improvements in reality. 1 speaker sounds good and 2 sound much better than 1. But 2 don't improve the sound quality and range of performance the way I expected it to. The speakers are really good considering the price. They could even be described as Great. But they certainly could be better than they are . But at the current price point they are a fantastic bargain and are impressive without question. In a bedroom or small house they are undoubtedly going to be loud and sound great. But outside even having 2 of them turned up and separated by about 15 feet. They weren't as impressive or good as the 1st speaker led me to believe 2 of them would be. Definitely not bad , and a improvement over just 1 speaker. But definitely not the improvement as far as sound quality and overall volume one might anticipate. The stereo sound improved as it should have. But improvement in Bass or midrange sounds that I expected with the addition of another speaker just weren't what I expected or have experienced with other speakers in the past . Still a Great buy . But the addition of a second speaker linked to the first didn't provide the sound quality or volume I expected them to. They sound good but I expected there would be a more noticeable improvement in sound quality and volume with the 2nd speaker than I've observed."
