    {
        "review": "Bought JBL6 November 2025 for $141, and am very pleased with purchase....I wanted something with punchy base that was portable/compact and reasonably light.  I use it alot and take it on trips.  It has good base for its size and is clear and pleasant to listen at mids/highs, and plenty of oomph at higher volumes for large rooms.  Bluetooth fine with WIN10/WIN11.  Power I've never tested but have listened for several hours at a time easily  USB plug in good/easy.  Bought silver color with red-trim lettering."
