    {
        "review": "I solid a little sucker.  Sound punches above its size and weight.Connected to bluetooth instantly before I could look at my phone.Update week 2:  It has an upper mid buzz like a kazoo I cannot EQ out. I understand this is a moderately common issue possibly but not confirm to be caused by voice coil rub in a run of these speakers. I will consider trading it for another hoping that that is the problem.  I researched this raspy sound on several AIs.  A couple of them indicated that the raspiness may be due to the units processing the stereo into a mono signal which creates that distortion. They suggest that you only provide a mono signal into the Charge 6 to reduce or eliminate that treble raspiness.  I find that to be a p i t a."
