    },
    {
        "review": "I had the charge 5, I changed it because it has a fast charge, the volume goes up quite a bit, the bass is almost the same, it is more balanced in sound and it has the auracast, on battery I have managed to get about 9 hours out of it at volume 40 - 60 and it is already stronger if it lasts about 4 hours but I am quite happy with the purchase and yes it is original"
