        "review": "Very good sound"
    },
    {
        "review": "The best portable speaker I've ever owned. It looks sleek (I got the white), I love the handle so I can carry it around on my arm while my hands are full. Highly highly recommend adjusting the EQ settings as it's a bit too tinny and lacking in bass by default. If you want a better mix definitely use the custom EQ setting in the JBL app to fit to your preference. But once you tune it in, ooooh baby. This thing gets LOUD, and it has excellent bass for its size. If you see this on sale and haven't upgraded your bluetooth speaker in a few years, the difference will be night and day. Plus you can throw it in a pool or dirt pile and it will be fine. Oh and you can use it to charge your phone so its a backup powerbank! This is the bestseller for JBL for good reason, the price to performance ratio can't be beat. Don't even think about paying the Bose tax for something else that might not even sound as good."
