        "review": "Love this knife set. Specifically ordered it because it goes with my silverware set of black on black. Easy set up, knives are beautiful and very sharp on arrival. Stand is sturdy and I like how it had a built in knife sharpener in the block. Fits great on my counter space since I don't have much space. Happy it came with steak knives. I love the how these knives are made. I just hand wash these to be on the safe side. Weight of the knives are good not overly heavy. Overall great product, good price."
    },
    {
        "review": "Damn, these knives cut like scalpels—they are incredibly sharp! I assume that’s just how they are at first until they gradually lose their edge, but they definitely look high-quality. The black color helps hide scratches and dirt, and the best part is that the block has a built-in sharpener. I’ve had them for a month now and they cut through meat and vegetables so easily. BE VERY CAREFUL!! Definitely keep them out of reach of children!! And if you’re not very skilled with knives, watch out too because you could easily end up with a nasty accident. Other than that, they are excellent."
    },
    {
