    {
        "review": "Pleasantly surprised. I’ve only had them a week so no idea on long term usage and/or sharpness, but they work very well. I bought them because they weren’t particularly expensive and I needed a set, anything would work. They cut fantastic, just cut up a tri tip last night. The steak knives work great too. They’ve been through the dishwasher and came out perfect, not issues, so definitely dishwasher safe. I’m enjoying them, glad I took a chance on em. Plus they happen to look nice."
    },
    {
        "review": "This is the only knife block I could find that wasn't wooden or susceptible to bacterial growth. The blades are dark. The handles feel more substantial in your hands and don't have rivets that can rust. The knives are very sharp. My husband said it cut through his meat easily, better than the ones we had before. It comes with Chef, Bread and Japanese knives which are the ones I use most. It also is shorter so it fits under our cabinets on our countertop. We like it!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Not as in the pics quality is poor"
