        "review": "​I am really happy with this 15-piece knife set so far! I was looking for an upgrade for my kitchen, and this set has exceeded my expectations in both looks and performance.​Here is what stands out the most to me:​Distinctive Aesthetics: These knives look absolutely fantastic. I really enjoy the hammered finish on the blades—it gives them a unique, high-end look that stands out beautifully on the counter in the wooden block.​Perfect Weight and Feel: They don't just look nice; they feel great to hold. Every knife is nicely weighted and balanced, making them very comfortable and easy to control during prep work.​Excellent Sharpness: Out of the box, these are very sharp. The high-carbon stainless steel cuts effortlessly, and knowing the block has a self-sharpening feature gives me peace of mind that they'll stay that way. The included steak knives are also a fantastic addition.​Overall, this is a gorgeous and highly functional set. If you are looking for knives that are both visually striking and incredibly practical for everyday cooking, I highly recommend this collection!"
