        "review": "Beautiful packaging job, each knife protected with foam and plastic.  Knives are nice as there is no seam between the blade and the handle.  Nice weight to each size knife.  Would be the last knife set you would ever have to buy unless you lost them all."
    },
    {
        "review": "Ok, I do reviews, but not always.  I thought I'd review these knives because I'm cautiously optimistic.  I had my other set of knives for well over 20 years.  I thought it was time for a new set as mine are pretty beat up from all these years.  I picked this set because they had good reviews and looked nice too.  I expected them to be a bit heavier or substantial as my other knife set was a little more heavy duty.  I have to say though... as for sharpness, this set is spot on.  I used what I think is a boning knife today, it made me feel like a mini-ninja!  It cut like butter and I never expected that.Pros:Nice lookingVery sharplighter weight than expected but feel very nice in the handCons:Lighter than expectedThis set was a perfect replacement for my other knives.  Are they the creme de la creme, no, will they last for years with care, I believe so! :)"
