    },
    {
        "review": "I love it. So easy to connect and upload pics wirelessly to your phone. Beautiful pictures. Simple to use, especially for beginners. It’ll do everything for you. But it does have so much more to offer for those who know what they’re doing too. Amazing camera, small, light weight, easy to handle and carry around."
    },
    {
        "review": "Lightweight camera, love that the lenses are interchangeable, easy to use , quality is really nice and can see myself using it very casually. Looking forward to playing around with settings more to get the most of this camera. This is also a more affordable option.Update/Edit:After over a month of use and travelling with this camera, I am very pleased with this camera and feel like I made the best decision for my needs! I did but this camera “used like new” to save some money, As I am just getting back into photography as a hobby.The only things I would change is the lens to have a better zoom feature which I will eventually invest into before my next trip.Another thing to note is that this camera does struggle in low light settings so you may need to get a light attachment if you plan on using it for that purpose or get a lens that better serves that purpose.Overall this is an amazing camera for casual photography, the app makes it easy to download images to your device and image quality is pretty crisp! I’ve attached some examples below 👇🏾!"
