        "review": "Received the camera in good condition and after reading the instruction is off to try it out. I am a total newbie to photography. So I took my first wildlife bird photo (apart from using my phone) and its turn out great. So definitely a good camera for beginner especially bird photography and within a good budget."
    },
    {
        "review": "The cardboard product has the bag on it removed and some things taken from the cardboard 🧐"
