    {
        "review": "The camera arrived on time and securely packaged. It is easy to assemble and takes excellent photos."
    },
    {
        "review": "Very basic camera in a bulky frame. The images are with good resolution but autofocusing is not that much fast, one good out of four clicks and lots of blurry pictures. Zooming is good. Battery life is very good. Still testing..."
