        "review": "I love this camera! I've gone through different mediums of camera, seeing which one I like and I have to say this style is my favorite so far. Super easy to use and you can look up tutorials on how to change the camera settings. It has given me really great pictures and the camera battery lasts quite a while after a full charge, it's great!"
    },
