        "review": "This may seem rather small for a coffee maker, but it is perfect for those that only want a few cups odf coffee in the morning. Easy to use and clean, and very affordable!"
    },
    {
        "review": "This coffee pot is wonderful in theory. And worked great for a few months.  Now the switch, which is a push button not a toggle, will trunks off and on randomly and sometimes many times in a row.  I am just unplugging it when I am done with it because I dont want it to burn my house down."
    },
    {
        "review": "Perfect for one person! I made a pot that gave me 2 (two) 8oz cups of hot coffee. Unless you are serving tiny demitasse cups of coffee, this little machine does not make 5 cups. Works out fine for me, just be aware of this. Brew time was about 5 minutes from turn on to pot filled. It was super simple to assemble. Rinse everything before using as machine is packed in styrafoam/plastic wrap. Recommended."
    },
    {
        "review": "Very pretty, except that it is very small for me, as I drink normal cups, only two come out, for one person it is fine, but if there are more, I do not recommend it."
    },
    {
        "review": "Can't go wrong with this coffee maker. Personally we don't need one with the bells and whistles of automatic on, programmed but it does shut off on its own which was important in case we forgot--though that rarely happens. It is fast and has the basket filter though we also use a paper filter with it and shows how much water is in it. Really its a basic coffee maker but has the pause and serve which is highly important to us."
    },
    {
        "review": "Great coffee pot!  Small yet works great!"
    },
