        "review": "OMG, If you do remote location work and are doing the \"motel\" stay gig, this is the coffee machine for you. Light, clean simple and fast on the brew. Bought to replace my older Melita Perfect Pour coffee machine. This unit is smaller and just as good, if not better for those remote field jobs where you need that morning coffee. Great a brew each and every time. 10/10 would buy again."
