        "review": "It has 3 sizes for coffee, if you want a little more you can make the medium or small measurement and nothing is wasted. I also bought the plastic capsules to put the type of coffee I like or freshly ground. The water heats up very well, so the temperature is excellent. Very happy with my purchase."
