        "review": "Works perfectly, brews great coffee. Even the scoop they provided with it is the perfect size for me. It has one problem that is minor for me, because I only make five cups, but may be catastrophic for someone making a full pot. The problem is that the cover of the basket area and water tank appears to lock while brewing, apparently so you don't burn yourself, but if you don't close the lid tightly, the machine will brewing the coffee with an open cover, and also the ball at the bottom of the basket doesn't go down far enough to allow the carafe cover to push the button on the basket, so the water just stays with the grounds in the basket. Intuitively, it seems the tank could overflow. Except for that it's worth the modest pricr."
