        "review": "This 12 cup drip coffee maker is an excellent value, with great performance and a slightly more compact design than many comparable machines. The shorter, wider carafe helps with this, especially if you’re working with limited counter space or low cabinets. It’s very easy to use, just add grounds to the reusable filter, fill the reservoir, press the button, and you’re good to go. Brewing speed is on par with other machines, and it produces a consistently good cup of coffee with a nice balance in flavor. The reusable filter is a big plus, and the included scoop is a convenient bonus. Clear water level markings on both the machine and carafe make measuring easy, and the 2 hour auto shut-off works perfectly and adds peace of mind. The only minor drawback is that the filter basket holder doesn’t always lock perfectly into place and the lid needs a little extra push to lock it in place. Aside from that small nitpick, it’s a fantastic coffee maker for the price and a great choice, especially if you catch it on sale! Versatile, portable enough for an office setting, and all in all an excellent recommendation!"
