    },
    {
        "review": "This is my second one was about to order a black one again mine was still working perfectly just the element was kinda worn it’s under my counter just in case but saw a white one in warehouse deals and it works perfectly too just basic functions but the program timer never fails to brew the coffee and I prefer a digital readout as LEDs seem to burn out faster in fact I’ve never seen a digital readout fail"
