        "review": "The design stood out, so I decided to give it a try when the ol' Hamilton Beach packed it in.  After almost a year of use, I'm quite satisfied with it.  The brew options are great; love being able to do a cup or two.  Adjusting the duration and temp of the heating pad it nice; too many of those things burn way too hot.  Its quiet and fast; with a polite little beep to tell me that its coffee time!"
