        "review": "1/ makes good coffee2/ fresh coffee every cup unlike big reservoirs that water goes stale this one does one big coffee cup like my pic !3/ compact takes up no room so small, so light!4/ I love it worth every cent for $39.99 an took out insurance cover for $7.99 ? An that gives 4yrs so can’t go wrong if stops working !5/way better than the KEURIG I had for $150 lol an there customer service sux they quit working in 11mths.6/ no more power losses cuz it runs on 120 volts great for rv7/gives you ground coffee filter cup an a k-cup basket."
