[
    {
        "review": "Beyond excellent packaging for shipping! Well made. No missing parts. Good instructions. Easy set up. Part of Bonsen brand... I have liked all the Bonsen items I have purchased."
    },
    {
        "review": "Makes great coffee and fast but can’t get the programming to work. I followed the instructions twice and it says it it set but still doesn’t come in in the morning"
    },
    {
        "review": "This coffee maker brews only if you push brew. It does not program. The clock light shuts off after so long so in the morning you need to wake up to push brew yourself.So disappointed"
    },
    {
        "review": "This 12-Cup Programmable Drip Coffee Maker is a highly capable machine for households or offices that need reliable, high-volume coffee. Its adjustable extraction profiles successfully pull rich flavor out of standard grounds, though its physical lid design and reservoir placement require a little spatial planning.The ProsHighly Customizability Extraction: The \"Classic\" and \"Rich\" brewing modes work beautifully. Selecting the \"Rich\" profile noticeably slows down the water flow rate, letting the water sit with the coffee grounds longer. This results in a much bolder, stronger cup without needing extra coffee.Efficient Small-Batch Option: The dedicated \"1-4 Cup\" setting is a fantastic feature. On standard large coffee makers, brewing small amounts yields lukewarm, weak coffee. This setting optimizes temperature and brewing speed so small pots taste just as hot and concentrated as full ones.Extended 4-Hour Warm Plate: Most standard coffee makers shut off after 2 hours, leaving your second morning cup cold. The adjustable keep-warm timer stretches up to 4 hours, which is perfect for an office environment or a slow weekend morning.Dependable 24-Hour Timer: The interface and clock programming are straightforward. Setting the delay brew the night before works flawlessly, and the machine clicks on quietly without any jarring alarms.The ConsTight Water Reservoir Access: The opening to pour water into the back of the machine is narrow. If the coffee maker is pushed back under standard kitchen cabinets, it is difficult to pour water straight from the carafe into the tank without sliding the entire machine forward to avoid spills.Condensation Lid Drip: When you flip open the top lid to empty the used paper filter or grounds basket, condensation built up on the underside of the lid easily runs backward down the hinge, occasionally dripping onto your countertop behind the machine.Carafe Spout Geometry: While the glass carafe is durable and feels balanced in the hand, the lip of the glass spout is angled quite sharply. If you try to pour your coffee too quickly, the liquid can overshoot or dribble down the front of the glass. It requires a slow, controlled pour.Final VerdictIf you want an affordable, highly customizable automatic brewer that can handle both a single quick cup or a massive 12-cup pot for a long morning, this machine is an excellent choice. It punches above its weight in terms of extraction quality and heat management. Just be sure to place it in an area where you have plenty of overhead clearance to fill the water tank easily."
    },
    {
        "review": "Makes great coffee but programming for auto start is confusing. Tried twice to set for a.m. brew, but didn't brew. The clock keeps correct time but it turns off after awhile till you hit a button & time appears again. Confusing why if PROG is set correctly according to the directions, it doesn't turn on at programmed time. Haven't decided if I'm returning it yet or not. It does brew fast but disappointed it won't program."
    },
    {
        "review": "I ordered the black version of this coffee maker, and it has exceeded my expectations. One of the things I appreciate most is its clean, minimalist design. There isn't a large brand name or logo displayed across the front, which gives it a sleek, modern appearance that fits nicely in my kitchen without drawing attention to itself.Setup was quick and straightforward, and the controls are easy to understand. The programmable 24-hour delay brew is one of my favorite features because I can prepare everything the night before and wake up to a fresh pot of coffee. It's a real time-saver on busy mornings.The coffee brews quickly and consistently, and it's nice to have the option to customize the brew strength. Whether I want a regular cup or something a little bolder, the different strength settings make a noticeable difference. I've also brewed smaller batches, and the 1-4 cup setting helps maintain good flavor instead of tasting watered down.The water reservoir has a large, easy-to-read viewing window, making it simple to fill the right amount without guessing. Cleanup is just as easy since the filter basket removes easily and the glass carafe washes up without any hassle.Another feature I really appreciate is the adjustable keep-warm function. It keeps the coffee at a good drinking temperature for hours, and I like being able to choose the warming level instead of having the coffee get too hot. The automatic shut-off is another thoughtful touch that adds convenience and peace of mind if I forget to turn the machine off.Overall, this coffee maker offers an impressive combination of performance, convenience, and appearance. It has many of the same features you'd expect from more expensive name-brand models, yet it comes at a very reasonable price. If you're looking for a reliable programmable coffee maker that brews great coffee, is easy to use, and looks great on the counter, I would definitely recommend this one."
    },
    {
        "review": "It brews coffee well and a great taste but the program for delay start would not work. I returned with no problem and ordered a new one."
    },
    {
        "review": "This is an excellent coffee maker.  It dispenses a quick hot brew every time.  Silly as it sounds, my favorite feature is the bright LCD display, it is bright red and very easy to read.  This is a full featured coffee maker at a budget friendly price.  The operating buttons are on the front of the base, they are large and easy to read and use.  The extra large reservoir and carafe allow brewing up to twelve cups of coffee at one time.  If you have multiple coffee drinkers this extra capacity is wonderful for having a ready supply of fresh coffee.  The coffee maker is programable with up to a 24 hour delay.  It also has a safety shut off after four hours of non-use.  In addition to all the great features, it also looks attractive on my countertop."
    }
]

