    },
    {
        "review": "We initially purchased the coffee maker in March 2024 and rated it 2 stars because it worked well and then it completely failed within about three months. We're updating the rating and giving it 5 stars because Black & Decker was really great about replacing it for us and the new one has been working exactly as it should for at least a year since then. In the past, we've purchased much pricier coffeemakers, but now that we're retired and far more budget conscious, this coffee maker is perfectly fine -- even for total bougie coffee snobs. Our coffee tastes pretty great! It's a standard 12-cup model, reasonably quiet, the brewing time is reasonable, the coffee stays hot in the pot and we've had no leakage problems or any other issues. This coffeemaker really is a pretty great value for the money."
