    {
        "review": "CHEAPER THAN MOST UNITS, BUT YOU GET WHAT YOU PAY FOR. I GOT THE UNIT TODAY AND RIGHT FROM THE START I GOT MY FIRST SIGN THAT I PROBABLY MADE A MISTAKE. I HAD TO USE KITCHEN SCISSORS TO GET THE COVER OFF THE POWER CORD PRONGS (strike 1). I WENT TO PUT WATER IN THE  CARAFE AND NOTICED THE WATER LEVEL MARKERS WERE SO THIN THEY WERE BARELY VISIBLE. I HAD TO KEEP TURNING THE CARAFE UNTIL THEY WERE READABLE (strike 2). THE MANUAL SAYS THE ON/FF BUTTON LIGHTS UP. ALL I SAW WAS A TINY PIN POINT SIZE LIGHT INDICATOR HARDLY NOTICEABLE. THE MANUAL ALSO SAID THE BREW BUTTONS LIGHT UP, IF THEY DID THE LIGHTS MUST BE ON THE INSIDE BOTTOM, I DID NOT SEE ANYTHING. WHEN I WENT TO PLACE THE BASKET INTO THE UNIT I HAD KEEP WIGGLING IT BEFORE IT FIT IN (strike 3- it is out) . WHEN I AM STRUGGLING IN THE MORNING TO GET MY FIRST COFFEE I DO NOT WANT TO FUSS WITH A CLUTSY COFFEE MAKER. I JUST GOT IT AND IT'S GOING TO THE  DUMPSTER."
