    {
        "review": "I'm happy with the functionality of this machine.  It brews my usual 8+ \"cups\" of coffee in 11 minutes and keeps it at a good temperature for the stated 2 hours.  Capacity is 12 5oz. \"cups\", which is consistent with other coffee makers.  It pours without dripping and the interrupt function works well.While the clock is easy to set and very visible the on/off light is difficult to see unless viewed straight-on from a high angle, as may be evident from the three photos I'm attaching.  This makes it easy to leave the heat on after the pot is empty.  Improving the light is the one and only change I'd ask for."
