        "review": "I've spent decades spending absurd amounts of money trying to find the perfect coffee maker.  After spending nearly a month in a rental house that only had an inexpensive coffee maker - and LOVING the coffee I'd get from it - I finally shopped around for something like it.  I landed on this particular model and couldn't be happier.  I feel silly for having invested so much over the years on coffee makers that didn't last nearly as long as they should have (for those prices).  If this one breaks down after a year, who cares?  I'll get another!  At this price, I can afford to buy a new one more often.  (Have been using it for a couple of months now. Perfect coffee every time. Super easy to operate, program, and clean.) ***UPDATE JUNE 2025: Still going strong! Not a single thing has changed. Carafe and basket cleaned in dishwasher daily without issues. All features working perfectly.  Still very happy with my decision to go low-tech and basic."
