[
    {
        "review": "I love this coffee pot. I mainly use it for the one cup feature but wanted to have the option to make a pot on the weekends. It makes it nice and strong and quickly. It’s easy to use and the coffee is nice and hot. It looks really fancy as well. I looked at several makers and I’m glad I went with this coffee pot so far. I’ve been using it for over 3 months with no issues yet."
    },
    {
        "review": "I don’t usually write reviews but I didn’t get my coffee this morning!!I was excited to receive this coffee pot however it stopped working within the week. I got another one with hope it was a fluke as I really liked the capabilities and how this one looked. Once again it was a dud.The first go around the coffee pot would stop brewing and clog. After cleaning it, it continued to happen.The second coffee pot had a dysfunctional display. The only thing I could see was the power. Since I had the old one, I knew where the brew button would approximately be. Mind you the display was black except for the power button. I dealt with this as I didn’t want to get another new coffee pot. But lone behold, this one stopped brewing  as well. Not worth the hassle or money."
    },
    {
        "review": "Just got my AIRMSEN 12-cup Programmable Dual Coffee Maker (model HR-CM307U).  Super excited to use this because of the multiple options and accessories. When the machine arrived, I found it light weight and well packaged. The glass carafe was sturdy and the baskets for the grounds was easy to clean. The controls were easy to use and the overall look of the unit was sleek. The clock was super easy to set. The brewing was quiet and takes about as long as my nespresso machine to heat up the water, yet this makes larger cups.  My coffee came out nice and hot. I made a single serve cup with grounds and I also tried using the k-cup. Both turned out fine and hot. I'm pretty happy with this machine. I will try the programmable feature soon and come back with an update.Update- I tried the programmable feature today and it worked well. It was also quiet. I did use a paper filter to enhance the flavor of my coffee which worked and the warmer kept the coffee hot. The only issue that comes to mind is the staining of the coffee basket which was white and is now a bit brown. I noticed that on the single serve basket too. I tried scrubbing but it's still stained. So far, so good with this coffee maker.Update August 11, 2026 - I've been using this coffee maker since November. Everything is still going well. The coffee tastes great and the carafe vs the single serve is still wonderful.  I love the options because often times I'm just making a cup for me but sometimes others are enjoying the coffee with me. The machine still looks great and is quiet. Still loving this machine!"
