        "review": "I bought this because I was looking for a machine that would automatically make a large amount of coffee by adding coffee beans and water. You can quickly make a large amount of coffee without any problems. My only concern is that the mechanical parts cannot be washed. Also, I wish it were a little cheaper."
    },
    {
        "review": "Excellent coffee maker. Easy to use and easy to serve. Unlike \"glass\" or glass jug coffee makers, this type of coffee maker does heat the coffee as it should in addition to giving a better flavor by handling higher temperatures. This is how all coffee makers should be, since there is also no risk of it breaking or breaking so easily. On the other hand, you can use it without a filter, which also makes it a more ecological and cheaper option in the long term."
    }
