[
    {
        "review": "Love t his machine! Comes with removable easy to fill water reservoir. Has single cup filter add on, so you can make a single cup without having to go out and buy k-cups. Has a regular and bold brew on both the carafe and single cup options. Easy to clean. I can't say enough good things about this pot."
    },
    {
        "review": "I got this back in 2020 and loved it so much I got my parents and in-laws one as well. All 3 are still working and going strong. Best coffee maker ever. I recently had some trouble with mine, it stopped brewing on the pot side. Come to find out it was just a clog from hard water build up. I highly recommend this product and so do my family members. No issues from any of them tht could not ve fixed by cleaning the unit. The needle on my parents unit has gotten clogged, and they have to clean that out regularly. Mine has never had an issue but I rinse mine after a few uses anyway. If you take care of it and do regular cleanings it will last you forever. (We clean with a white vinegar soak on both sides )"
