    },
    {
        "review": "I’ve been using this chair for a little while now, and I have mixed feelings about it.First, the design is definitely one of its strongest points. It looks great, especially if you’re going for a gaming or modern office setup. It has a clean, sporty look, and from a distance it honestly looks more expensive than it is.That said, once you get up close, the overall build quality isn’t quite as impressive. The finishes could definitely be better. There are a few small details that make it feel a bit cheaper than I expected, and the materials don’t really give off a premium feel. It’s not terrible by any means, but you can tell where some corners were cut.As for comfort, I’d give it about a 7/10. It’s perfectly usable for everyday work or gaming sessions, but it’s not one of those chairs you immediately sink into and never want to leave. After a few hours, I definitely notice that it’s more of a budget chair than an ergonomic one.Overall, I think it’s a fair value for the money. If you’re expecting premium quality or all-day comfort, you may be a little disappointed. But if you’re shopping in this price range and mainly want something that looks good and gets the job done, it’s a reasonable choice. Just keep your expectations realistic."
