    {
        "review": "It took a couple of days to arrive, but it is understandable due to the customs procedure. It arrived well packaged. It is easy to assemble, the instructions are easy to follow. The parts came complete and even came with extra parts for spare parts. The only detail is that one of the speakers was a little beat up, but it works well. I bought it because I was looking for a chair suitable for short people like me; I am 156 cm tall, the cushion fit perfectly on my neck to rest my head, but my feet do not completely reach the floor, if the seat could be lowered 2 cm more it would have been perfect. It is comfortable to work for hours and with the seat reclined and the footrest you can rest well. I am satisfied with the purchase, good price-quality ratio"
