        "review": "Such a disappointment. I waited 2 weeks for this chair, Amazon used a 3rd party courier company. When I saw the eta after ordering the chair assuming it was being shipped from the US. Nope 2 week delivery time from Melbourne to Canberra. I was so hyped to put this thing together. Missing instructions was annoying, but not the end of the world as it was easy to figure out. Such a let down sitting on this thing for the first time. It’s very firm and in no way comfortable. There is a lever to that locks the chair from leaning back and the opposite direction lets it free. The lock setting still rocks the chair back a few inches before locking. The free setting is useless, you have to push yourself back for it to work and then just snaps back to resting position. I own many Corsair products, and i find them all high quality, well made. 10 minutes I gave this chair before requesting a refund."
