        "review": "It's a decent chair at a decent price.It decently comfortable. Good lumbar support. Easy to assemble.The wheels are just nothing special wheels. So if you are using it on any type of carpet. Maybe upgrade to skate wheels. It uses a most common wheel peg. So replacing them is as easy if popping them out and popping in a better style."
    },
