        "review": "Overall the quality is ok and delivery is fast. However, the tread was defective till the screw sheared off at right arm after slot during fixing so now got one screw missing. See the photo.. not sure it affects the safety?"
    },
    {
        "review": "Easy to assemble with clear instructions. No additional tools required. Easy to adjust and very comfortable."
    },
    {
        "review": "Reluctant at first to buy without trying and to my great surprise I am extremely satisfied with my purchase I highly recommend it"
    }
