[
    {
        "review": "Just got this today, but my first impression is that it’s exactly what I needed!Is this a gaming chair? Yes. Did I buy it to use in my work office at 41yrs old? Also yes.  My nephew got this over xmas and when he showed it to me, he made me try it. It was love at first sit. I’m pretty small, 4’11 and 95lbs, so all of my work chairs are very uncomfortable for me. My feet never touch the floor, the chairs didn’t recline and my head was too short to have it hit the actual headrest. After I saw my nephews, I knew I had to get this. It’s everything I need. My feet hit the floor, it has a pillow that sits under my neck, back support and even the foot rest. I love that it reclines as well and impressed with how well it came together. I’m very excited to bring to work and finally be comfortable!Price: I got this on sale for 109$. It’s normally 129$ but 20$ shipping. I wish it would stay at 99$ all around since the shipping isn’t free. It was a super heavy package though so I get it.Style: I got all black so it blends in at work and it’s as pictured. I wish the logo wasn’t so big and bright for those who don’t use this as a gaming chair but I may use a black sharpie & color it to make this more discreet.Size: If you are on the shorter side, this is a great chair. Great for kids obviously and tinier adults. Not sure this is a heavy duty chair for the regular sized adult so keep in mind.Delivery: said it would take a week but came next day which was impressive and I was very happy with that. Arrives in great condition.Setup: the directions are so so. My husband put this together and it took wayyyyy longer than it should have because some of the directions were mislabeled. Screws numbers were added that weren’t needed for this chair and some of the images were so tiny you couldn’t see much. For some reason we had the biggest issue with the footrest. We had to do it like 3xs b/c we couldn’t tell from the image how it actually sat. Got it done none the less and worth the struggle.Bottom line: worth the buy and seems good quality for the price but I’ll see how it hold up when I bring it to the office for actual use."
    },
    {
