    },
    {
        "review": "I have had the chair for a little while now, and I am really enjoying it. I am 5'4\" and it is a perfect fit. The foot rest i flip out to cross my legs more comfortably in the chair, which works out great with my size. Or if I flip it all the way out, I sit my feet on it with my knees up, but theres still room to fit under my desk like this. I dont like to sit with my feet on the floor, and this chair meets my requirements while gaming in that aspect. I dont sit longer than 2 hours at a time for anything, so that isnt a concern i can address, anyone looking for an all day kind of review. But I dont get uncomfortable at all for the couple hours i use it at a time. The speakers face more outwards, so the sound goes out instead of in and at you. Which works great for music while doing things around the room but not so much for doing things at the computer. The volume is reasonable but not real loud. As a casual gamer though with an enjoyment for music while working around the home, this chair has been fantastic."
