[
    {
        "review": "The value at the time of purchase was fairly affordable. The comfort of the chair is very well worth the price. The reclining feature is enough to further feel comfortable while gaming or doing late night studies, the quality is well made metallic foot frame for the legs, arm left i wish they were metallic especially since after tightening them they still have a small bit wiggle. I hope in the future the Recline feature could be more accessible towards someone in a taller within the range of 5’11” - 6’0” instance, but if you are 5’8” or 5’9” the recline feature is really well suited, having the ability to crisscross applesauce for best comfort. Assembly is extremely simple, was able to build it while working and it only took me 45min.FYI:I didn't notice that the Grey/Blue chair had a lower lumbar massager very well suited for relaxing 💙Thank you for this great chair 😊"
    },
