        "review": "I was honestly pretty happy with this chair for the price. It's comfortable, looks good, and doesn't feel cheap once it's all put together. If you're on a budget and don't want to spend a fortune on a gaming chair, this is a pretty solid option.The only real downside is the instruction manual. It definitely needs more work. Most of the steps just expect you to figure things out by looking at the pictures, and some of them aren't very clear. A little more written explanation would have made putting it together a lot less frustrating.Overall, though, I think it's worth the money. Once it's assembled, it's a comfortable chair and does exactly what I expected. I'd recommend it if you're looking for a decent budget gaming chair—just be patient during the assembly process."
