        "review": "I love this backpack. It is affordable and well put together. There are plenty of compartments and pockets, surprisingly more than you'd expect for the size. My 16 inch laptop also fits well in the main laptop compartment. Zippers seem very functional. Buckles and straps seem sturdy and durable. It's big enough for my needs without being too big.  Materials used feel a little cheap but everything is sewn and stitched together well and has been durable so far after a couple months of use. I wish the side bottle holder were bigger, to fit my 40oz canister. They are suitable for standard water bottles maybe uo to 24oz. I can speak to the water resistance. I'd recomend the backpack and buy again."
