    {
        "review": "Excellent bag for computers.  I used it on my recent 3 plane trips and it worked great.  What I like the most is not feeling the computer on my back because of the padding.  It is not a heavy bag, but still built with a lot of protective cushion.  There are 4 main compartments with lots of several compartments, even some mesh so you can see thru them for stuff.  The stitching is strong and will not fall apart at the seems.  Excellent quality workmanship.  It is a bag suitable for kids or adults.  I am using it as a computer, travel, all purpose bag.  Its large enough that it fits my gaming system with room for controllers, plugs, etc.  Great bag to have."
