    },
    {
        "review": "I originally purchased this backpack when I started college. A year later my dog chewed it up so I had to buy another one.I really enjoy this backpack since there are so many organized pockets and well thought out features- such as zippers you can add your own locks to, a hidden pocket on the back of the bag, and even a detachable keychain you can put on your keys. I could fit everything I needed to spend a whole day on campus (I commuted daily).Years later, I am still using this backpack, so it is most definitely durable. This bag has been through so much and still works like a charm. I’ve found a way to use every pocket it provides and cannot recommend this backpack enough. It helped me get my degree and now come with me with work everyday, even 6 years later. Best $20(ish) purchase I have ever made!!"
