        "review": "I bought this backpack a few months ago and have been using it ever since. Very well made, simple but practical. It has many pockets and compartments of various sizes, and you can put a lot of stuff NEATLY in it, which is not a given to happen in a backpack. Very useful for getting around the city. I carry a laptop with a 15\" screen in it without any problem. Even A4 documents and various sheets of paper are comfortable. I've never used the internal to external USB cable, so I can't tell you anything about that."
