        "review": "Exactly what I was looking for. I wanted the side pockets to be deep enough to hold my items without them falling out like they have in some of my other backpacks (my reusable water bottle fell out and almost hit another passenger as I was putting my bag in the overhead compartment once and I never want that to happen again! It was empty at the time, but when full, those bottles can get HEAVY.)The bag itself holds much more than I expected, which has been great for my commute. My only complaint is that I often have to adjust the length of the shoulder straps because they tend to loosen when you don't have the bag on, but they do stay put when the bag is worn - at least I haven't noticed them move much yet."
