        "review": "I have been using these monitors for over a year now and have not had any issues. The were easy to put on the monitor arms I brought so I could have dual monitors.  The offer a crisp picture and have a good refresh rate.  I have even played some games on it and have not had any issues and the graphics are very good.  I would buy this monitor again."
