[
    {
        "review": "This is a very good monitor for newcomers to PC gaming or those needing one for home office tasks. I used to rely on my TV as my monitor, but when I saw this model's built-in speaker feature, I decided to try it. The monitor performs well, and the buttons on the back are easy enough to access. The picture quality is excellent, though the speakers could be improved—they're not bad, just not the best. I appreciate that I can connect my PS4 directly and start playing right away. The display brightness and stability are satisfactory; I've bumped my knee against my desk multiple times without any movement or damage. Setup was quick—I assembled the stand in about two minutes, and it's just plug and play afterward. Considering the price, including discounts, this monitor offers great value for money. The shipping was fast, arriving almost the next day. Overall, if you're looking for a budget-friendly monitor to start PC gaming or for an experienced user, this one is definitely worth considering."
    },
    {
        "review": "PRETTY I LOVE ITTT. I was looking for a monitor that was cheap to get real fast bc I had a small tv hooked up with my ps5 and steam deck and switch. This was perfect for it. IT CAME WITHIN 3 hours using the fast delivery option with three hours delivery time. You can connect speakers to it, u can connect 2 hdmi and it has other options on the back ,ummm don’t listen to the comments about the complicated buttons, it’s simple and common sense (sorry to say) but it’s easy. It’s bright and clear it came in fresh new condition with instruction and everything. One thing to note, the handle is removable ofc and if your doing the handle and trying to screw it on and it strips just use a drill and it’ll go in. That’s all. Thank you it was perfect for my set up, if I have any issues I’ll update. So it works well with steam deck, ps5 and switch and that’s coming from me. It’s not adjustable i don’t think but it sits on your desk and sit up nice. Quality is good in all, I can play my games in non pixelated screen(tv screens). OH AND THE SOUND, ehhh it’s okay just connect speakers. I don’t think anyone buys monitor for the speakers bc we all have headsets and speakers anyway. So yeah that’s that but it sound like normal. But it’s not like top tier. THE SIZE IS GOOD TOO.  It’s a good size screen and the bezels on the side I thought would be big and pop out but the monitor is very slime tbh. It’s slim and the perfect size, BUT IN ALL , BUYYYY IT."
