        "review": "I am not someone to skimp around with tech stuff.  I put some research into what I was buying for my screens (purchased 2 of these).  For the price comparison, I got amazing quality without breaking the bank.  They are super bright, offer multiple gaming lighting and settings, and are plug and play.  I use a gaming laptop and docking station and have had no issues with the responsiveness and working together with my system.  I highly recommend."
    },
