        "review": "this monitor was a HUGE upgrade for me. going from a 24”, 1080p res, 70hz refresh to this beauty was absolutely game changing. it comes with a displayport in box, but you can use an hdmi as well! i’ve had great results from using the displayport though. the movement is smooth and the colors show beautifully! it really makes my (in progress) desk setup pop <3the only thing i notice is that the built-in speakers quality isn’t the best, but since i have my own speakers i’ve been using this isn’t a problem for me! i only tested with music, so if you’re looking for great music speakers i’d check other options or get external speakers! otherwise, it’s a great upgrade for me! :)"
    },
    {
        "review": "This monitor works great and getting it on sale made it even better. 1440p is all you will ever need especially for console gaming. It runs up to 180hz on display port but hdmi it can reach 120hz easily allowing you to maximize your response time for your console and give yourself more time to react. You can quickly switch between different modes for different games and even create user specific modes that you can adjust to your hearts desire. All of the display settings are easily adjustable through the analog button on the rear of the monitor. Also the monitor has settings that can actively adjust your picture for different situations in games (I currently cannot recall the term for it). You can adjust the brightness, saturation, and more. One of my favorite features is the different display presets such as low blue light that can help when working late on the monitor. My only demerit of the monitor is the stand itself is kind of flimsy and is not adjustable. I would advise getting a mount for your monitor of some sort if you are to purchase this monitor. Otherwise this is an amazing monitor I got for an amazing price during Prime Day Deals."
