        "review": "Incredible water bottle. Keeps my drink cold! Maintains ice for many hours. I've even finished the bottle, added new water and finished that, with ice still remaining! I love the color, too!  The straw allows you to just about finish the entire contents of your drink. Instinctively, I always open the spout to finish the bottle off, but there is really not even a sip left. You can't go wrong with this bottle and the price was the cherry on top."
    },
    {
        "review": "I needed a water bottle and knew I wanted something that wasn't part of the current fad of other cups and bottles.  This specific one had great reviews and was the exact size I was looking for.  It is great.  Keeps my water cold, does not leak.  I love the color.  It has dual options on the lid to drink from and is super durable.  I will definitely purchase again!."
    },
    {
        "review": "This water bottle does a good job of keeping things cold, although I do wish it was bigger, but that’s not an issue with the bottle (I thought 40 oz would last me longer than I thought it does). The only thing I don’t really like is the straw because it’s kind of hard to clean and it’s chunky and hard to pull out, but these are pretty minor issues. It does the trick as an insulated water bottle, it’s nice that the lid has two options for drinking out of, it’s easy to carry around and does fit into a purse, and it keeps water cold pretty well. I’ve left ice in the bottle overnight and while the cubes were smaller, they were still frozen in the morning. Overall I wouldn’t recommend this product as I don’t know if it’s any better than any other option out there, but it is a good value for the price, and I wouldn’t say you shouldn’t buy it either."
    },
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love how cold this bottle keeps water. Ice last for at least 12 hours in this amazing water bottle. I love the handle on the bottle I've been able to vlip it on my backpack while camping. This water bottle comes with a drink spout and a straw which has been helpful while riding my bike. It's light weight and very sturdy. Its true to color. The size is perfect for my bike I'm going to buy a bigger size just to have on hand."
    },
    {
        "review": "It does what it's supposed to do, and it does it well.  Keeps cold drinks cold, and the twist-open cap and flip-up straw are both excellent.  No leaks, no flaws.  Manufacturer sells replacement parts, so this will stay usable and fresh for years.  This wasn't my first Powcan bottle, and it won't be my last."
    },
    {
        "review": "Love it. For a cyclist, having a durable/reliable water bottle is imperative. This one checks all the boxes in that respect. Holds plenty for a moderate to long ride, is easy to fill/empty and is still pretty compact. Fits in my holder perfectly as well. Not to mention you can just use it as an all day drink container too. I even fill it at night and leave it on my nightstand for easy access during resting hours. Even stays cold all night too! That's another thing, it insulates PERFECTLY. I live in Nevada, we get 115+ degree days in the summer. So water staying cold in that kind of heat is also imperative. Which it does in this one, for long durations as well. I imagine it will do the opposite for those in cold weather needing to keep liquids warm, as well. Overall, very satisifed with the price and product. 5/5"
    },
    {
        "review": "Really good water bottle, resistant and with more possibilities for drinking. Personally, I chose it above all for the straw, I find it very convenient to use especially in the car. Maintains temperatures very well. The \"handle\" for carrying it is resistant and comfortable. It's a bit heavy, the only flaw is that when it's completely full, if it's turned upside down or moved too much it tends to leak a few drops."
    },
    {
