[
    {
        "review": "What are the best purchases I've ever made, love this. Living in Arizona it's always hot just keeps my dreams cold for days I've had ice last for 2 days it has two option fruit heads a flip mouthpiece with a straw in the lid that just unscrews off it has d-rings to clip it to your belt loop and a paracord that's very strong and very well made I'm always sharing mine by the Paracord. Not only is it an insulator container it comes with a zip up padded cover that also installation even more. It comes in multiple sizes from extra large 86 Oz and down"
    },
    {
        "review": "Fabulous water bottle!  Great to handle, holds a ton of water and keeps it cold!  Took it to an outdoor event that was HOT and it really worked.  Easy to clean and came with options for carrying and drinking.  Lots of color options too.  Don’t hesitate to buy this!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I waited to write this review. My 8 year old son needed a daily water bottle for school & I found this on a really great deal in Sept 2025. I loved that It had a strap for him to carry, especially if we had trips! It is now March 2026 & I am BEYOND impressed with this thing! First off, it came with 2 straps- one hand strap & another for his shoulder! He has currently been into sipping through a straw, but used to prefer pouring... This one comes with BOTH types types you can change by screwing that choice lid on! It had 2 straws (I had never had to replace yet- and he brings it everyday)!! It comes with 2 brushes to clean and 1 for the straw. I have washed it so many times- it's easy! it's still exactly the same now as it was! One of the best things I like about it is how cold it keeps his drink (it like dense metal but also not really heavy) but ALSO- HUGE- the fact that somehow it doesn't seem to create any mild easier like others I've had, even if its kept out. (Once he accidentally left It at school during a week vacation and there was no signs of mold in there- I don't know how! That would have never happened with our old ones!) It slides very easily into a pouch that is the \"carry pouch\". I have his name tag attached to the clip on it. We have gotten so many compliments on it & asked where it came from. I bought another water bottle so I could interchange them during washes- but honestly, I've rarely ever done that bc this is my son's favorite water bottle & this will be the only one you'll ever need!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I really love this half gallon bottle. I love the color as it is my favorite so of course I was immediately drawn to it. Very good ratings as well. Compared to my other one I had through someone else it leaked if tipped over or even leaning from day one and this one doesn’t leak at all. It keeps my water cold even without ice. It’s easy to use and doesn’t feel as heavy as my old one used too. I love the lid options as I prefer the spout. I like that I can easily grab it either by the hard handle or the rope strap. All around wonderful product."
    },
    {
        "review": "I kept running out of water at work with my Owala so I was looking for a larger size water bottle without breaking the bank.I found this 87oz water bottle for a great price. My first impression was that it could be cumbersome to carry around, but that quickly changed. It’s so easy to carry with the braided strap (that also has a compass, nice touch!!). I really like all the extras (the slim pockets, carabiner, two style of lids, longer strap to carry, and all the washing tools). It was a bit difficult to slip the fabric off the bottle at first and the fabric has a slight smell to it, but I expect that to dissipate.I think this is a great option to help fulfill your daily water needs!"
    },
    {
        "review": "This is an amazing tumbler! I usually do not have to put ice in after 24 hours unless I add room temperature water to the cup. It is leakproof! I've not experienced a leak, so that is another 5 Star! I gifted it to myself in February 2026 as my New Year's Gift!The capacity is amazing! I love that I can drive over 12 hours with enough water from the start to the finish of my drive!The handle options and the carrying case? GENIUS! I absolutely love them, those are \"FIVE STARS\". I used the shoulder carrying option on my last cruise!  Everyone wanted one for themselves!I gave it a 4 star because there is a \"gassy, galvanized taste\" that I still taste. I initially thought it was because the tumbler was new but I have owned it for over 6 months now and I do use it everyday. I understand it's a \"oral galvanism or a lipid-oxidation sensory reaction\", this might be different for me than someone else.The next reason for not giving a solid 5 star!Of the two Lid options, I prefer using the straw lid! Since I take the tumbler everywhere I go, I would prefer if the \"mouthpiece, sip, or straw tip\" was covered.If they upgrade Lid Options to a \"Callapsable Cover Straw Lid\", I would purchase the lid!In fact I came back to see if they upgraded, not to leave a review.  I hope this was helpful to someone."
    },
    {
        "review": "Love these - I have two.  My grandson wants whatever I’m drinking.  Not that the size isn’t enough to share…It keeps beverages cold with ice overnight and into the next day - ice is still there.  Honestly we’ve never had it run out so it cold be more than 24 hours.The insulation prevents condensation/moisture on the outside.  Love the sturdy handle and places to carry things like cellphone and wallet.  Love that I can clip it onto another item. Or use the smaller hook for car keys.LOVE LOVE LOVE THESE!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Love this water bottle!  It holds about a half gallon, keeps water cold all day.  It is insulated, has both a handle made of para-cord and 2 different tops!  It never leaked on my 35 days of camping.  Yes, I would order again.  You won't be disappointed!"
    },
    {
        "review": "This water bottle is a AMAZING purchase it comes with 2 straws 2 lids one with a sipping part. And the other with somthing to pour with. It was very high quality material. And a very convenient travel case that sits flush around the whole bottle. The bottle it's self is very sleek and nice looking with multiple anchor points to put your keys or lanyards whatever you need this water bottle will hold it. The travel pouch itself has a phone holder great for cards credit cards maps when hiking just very convenient. Has a paracord handle to hold very sturdy. When the carrier pouch is on it also comes with a shoulder strap you can put on the carrier pouch to hold it even more comfortably😆 the plastic is bpa free in case you care about that and also the carrier pouch has a zipper on the bottle for easy removing. I'm very happy with the 52$ I spent on this im sure you would be 2 keeps water cold forever!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Keeps water cool and has a large opening which let me fit ice cubes and other things like cucumber in easily. The large size is perfect to take to heavily active jobs like construction as well as to the gym. Its also super easy to clean and has no issues in the dishwasher."
    },
    {
        "review": "I love my bottle! The colour and quality is amazing! Seems easy to clean as well.The problem? I'm missing the straws, which is kind of a dealbreaker since I only drink from that type of mouth, the other one is useless to me. It also didn't come with the straw or bottle cleaners, that bothers me less since I have some already.I'd really like to not return this and somehow just get the missing items (Mostly the straws.)---Review of actual product:Gosh darn is this thing HEAVY! I wasn't expecting it. But the quantity lasts me 12 hours just fine. I'm considering the extra weight an excuse to get a workout for my arms, haha, but if you have any type of disability, you might want to consider a smaller size. My stronger and taller friend uses their gifted bottle just fine, they also say they really like it.This one (128oz) doesn't fit in my backpack, which is a shame, but oh well. It can also be a struggle to fill it all the way, depending on what you get your water from. I can do it to the top, my friend can only get 8/10ths unless he wants to use a separate cup to scoop the rest of the water in.The colour is beautiful, the clips and bands seem sturdy, I got a stain on the sleeve, and it washed out with just a dab of water. The mouth is wide enough to pour ice in, and it keeps the same temperature forever!---Edit: The seller contacted me quickly and helped me find a solution, they were very concise and answered all of my questions. I will say, there seems to be a problem with quality control, I think sometimes bottles get sent back, and they can miss any damages/missing items because of that.I bought another bottle and this one had a black smudge on the sleeve I couldn't wash out, it's not a dealbreaker for me, but so far 2 of the 3 bottles had some error. The only reason I'm keeping it at five stars despite that is because of their customer service being 10/10 and the quality of the product being the same."
    },
    {
        "review": "Perfect for camping, sporting events and if you have a home office.  It is heavy to carry around as your daily water source.  Keeps your water cold!  I use it in my home office and love it."
    },
    {
        "review": "Husband works a job where he needs a large bottle due to a lack of constant fresh water. He says that it's durable, doesn't feel too bulky, and likes the carrying choices. I like the cleaning tools it comes with, as it makes our lives easier."
    }
]

[
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love this Stanley tumbler! The color is even more beautiful in person, and the quality is exactly what I expected. It's sturdy, easy to carry, and fits perfectly in my car's cup holder.The Flip Straw lid is super convenient and truly leakproof, so I can toss it in my bag without worrying about spills. It keeps my water cold for hours, even on hot days.It's easy to clean, comfortable to hold, and perfect for everyday use. If you're looking for a high-quality tumbler that looks great and performs even better, I highly recommend it!"
