    {
        "review": "This is my second Stanley; I believe the hype. I've been using it every day for work, errands, and the gym, and it's become something I never leave home without.My drinks stay cold all day, even had ice in it the next day. Keeping it close has helped me drink a lot more water throughout the day.So comfortable to carry, and despite the size, it fits perfectly in my car's cup holder. The reusable straw makes sipping convenient while I'm on the go."
    },
    {
        "review": "I really love this Stanley cup! It keeps my drinks cold for hours, the handle makes it easy to carry, and it fits perfectly in my car’s cup holder. It’s sturdy, easy to clean, and has become my favorite tumbler. Definitely worth buying!"
