[
    {
        "review": "This Iron Flask 40oz insulated water bottle was exactly what I was looking for. I work in public safety and am not always near the station to refill my water bottle and wanted something that would allow me a couple refills but keep the water cold until I needed it. This does exactly that.I used a 20oz shaker bottle as a water bottle, so this gives Iron Flask bottle gives me two refills until I need to fill it up again. It is the perfect size to keep on my passenger seat without taking up much room at all. I have not had any issues with the bottle leaking and it is very good quality.the bottle came with three different lids. One is just a standard lid that stays attached to the bottle when unscrewed and is stainless steel. There is a straw lid, with a silicone straw that goes into the bottle and a plastic straw on the plastic lid for drinking. The third is a plastic lid like a standard coffee thermal drinking lid. I have only used the stainless steel lid as I only use this to hold extra water to refill my other water bottle since I add a water flavor to it.All three lids have a handle source for easy carrying of the water bottle.I drop this thing all the time and it still holds up really well. Of course it is going to scratch or dent when you drop it, it isn't a magic water bottle. But it has not affected the lids or seals in any way. I like to put stickers on my metal water bottles anyways, so nothing a fun sticker cant cover up!I do not put hot liquids in this water bottle, so I cannot speak to how well it keeps liquids hot, but it keeps my water nice and cold so I wouldn't have any doubt in its ability to keep liquids warm for as long as it says.I would purchase more of this product in the future if I needed."
    },
    {
        "review": "Great price, keeps it very cold for days!!!, and great size. It might not be your typical brand but it works just as great! Do be careful, although it’s a great cup and keeps everything cold af, it will dent if you don’t take care of it properly or if u drop it really hard. I lost one cup at worked, dented another pretty bad, but 3rd times a charm."
    },
    {
        "review": "This is the 2nd time purchasing this product. After 2 years I lost the 1st one but can tell you this product is extremely well-made, keeps ice overnight and liquids nice and cold. Never chipped, color never faded, and the cap and straws remained intact. Would recommend to all."
    },
    {
        "review": "I rarely write reviews for any product I purchase. However, I felt obliged to write this review based upon the quality of this bottle.Today, while cutting one of my fields for a new cattle pasture, I noticed that this bottle had fallen off my tractor and had been run over. I assumed the bottle had been destroyed, but after picking it up from the field, I saw that it was only slightly dented. Other than the small dent, the bottle is still completely useable. Again, I ran over this bottle with a mid-sized tractor used for farming. Not many things remain functionable after that, so I am very impressed!I should also note that the bottle keeps ice and liquids cold for a long time, even when outside in the summer heat all day. I will absolutely be purchasing again."
    },
    {
        "review": "Large container, very nice. Keeps ice & water for hours! Purchased for my husband, he's happy with it. Only downside (for me) is that it's quite heavy."
