[
    {
        "review": "Amazing for workers ... I keep my water bottle in my car / work van that is parked in the direct sunlight. This bottle keeps my water cold, for the entire day. I fill it half full with ice, rest with water, and I'm set to be hydrated. If you aren't hydrated, you won't succeed in whatever it is you are doing. It's too big for most cup holders, but it's very comfortable in the hand and isn't absurdly large in a tool bag (or under your seat, like I do) like those Stanley mug cups are. Very very good product, you get way more than you should for how much you are paying. Came with three kinds of lids. I use the bucket handle looking one. Works wonders. I couldn't be any happier."
