    {
        "review": "Impressive. Keeps cold drinks cold and hot drinks hot. I love the addidtion of the rubber bottom which keeps it from sliding around and prevents the clanking sound every time you place it down. Purchased 2 comparable Iron Flask bottles, and though I did not open or use them, the CIVAGO felt more durable and came with more lids. Comfortable to hold/carry/drink from. I am pleased with my purchase. Color is flat black. A clean slate for whatever stickers of 'flair' you wish to add. Bought a 32 oz as well. VERY nice!"
