    {
        "review": "Although the water stays fairly cold, the ice needs to be refilled multiple times a day. Though this isn’t a major issue, it is the reason I will not be leaving 5 stars. Outside of that I have no issues, colorway, goated, 3 cap options, legendary, the endurance of the steel is second to none. I would definitely suggest this bottle to anyone who needs a water bottle."
