    },
    {
        "review": "I, actually, bought this bottle 2 years ago. I have used it off and on. Mostly depending my daily or travel plans. It has become my favorite water bottle. My Yeti tumbler became my iced coffee vessel and I dug this bottle out for water.  I like I can use a straw and hide it for a variety of reasons. My water stays cold and icy for 24 hours. Knowing the size helps with my water intake. It has never spilled and the loop on the lid makes it easy to handle"
