    {
        "review": "Over the years, I've had about four of these in different colours. The only reason I've ever replaced them is because I appear to lose a water bottle every 2.5 years!Really nice vibrant colours that don't fade or chip like an anodised bottle would + it's dishwasher safe with no noticeable degradation to quality. The quality on Nalgene has always been exceptional and lasted many many hiking trips + every survives every day life. 1L is the perfect size for me.While some may say ~£20 is steep, I have had no problem ordering another without a second thought on price the instant I realise I've lost one."
