    },
    {
        "review": "Bought this for my husband and he has had many thankful days at work! This thing stays cold all day and then some, it also holds a half gallon of water!! It comes with two different types of lids; one with a straw attachment and one w/out (though my husband did say the mouth piece could be a bit bigger for better guzzling capabilities, he likes the size it is because it keeps the ice back). It comes with two handles for different carrying options and a carabiniere also to attach it to a bag. It also comes with a really cool insulated sleeve that has a zippered pocket on it (my husband likes that a lot) or you can remove it. The quality is awesome and durable! Comes with a cleaning brush for the straw and for the bottle as well, the bottle sponge is pretty cheap tho and fell apart after the first use. Good for Construction workers , Warehouse workers, Machine Operators, ect!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I used this 40 oz insulated water bottle daily and really enjoyed it. It did an excellent job keeping my drinks cold, and I appreciated that it was leak proof and easy to take with me to the gym, on walks, and while traveling. The large capacity and straw spout lid made it convenient for staying hydrated throughout the day.Unfortunately, after only about 5 weeks of daily use, the carrying strap started ripping and detaching from the bottle. The bottle itself was still working well, but the strap durability was disappointing and makes it harder to carry as intended.Overall, I really liked the insulation, size, and leak-proof performance, but the strap quality needs improvement. A stronger attachment point or more durable strap material would make this a much better product."
