[
    {
        "review": "I'm very happy with this large water bottle.  I'm at that \"you have to take better care of your kidneys\" age, and my doctor told me to step it up with the water intake.  This bottle has great labeling showing the amount of water and a time schedule for keeping up with it all day long so you don't have to chug a ridiculous amount when you realize how far behind you are.  Easy to fill, fits in the fridge just fine, comes with a straw cap and a plain round opening cap (that's what I use since I can pour it into a glass at meals if I want, but just need the bottle to drink out of other times), and feel solid.  No leakage to this point, you can do arm curls with this thing if you want.  I'm really happy with this bottle, although the gallon a day target is going to, I believe the saying was, \"make my back teeth float)."
    },
    {
