    },
    {
        "review": "I've read all of the risky reviews, & still I've decided to make my own decision to purchase & find out if paying 35 bucks is worth it! This is beautiful online & even in person! It is a HUGE BEAUTY ♡! There's more of a deep blueish green..., maybe, sea green? IMO it's a beautiful deep sea green blended next to the gradient yellow. I love it! Now holding the bottle & viewing the creation, it does seem to be a bit sturdy when holding it, but also \"plasticky\" as if it'll fall apart in no time from just one fall. So... since 35 bucks is very expensive for just a plastic bottle, I need to be extra careful with this beauty! All in all, I give it a 5 for right now. I have washed it (no seal leaks or cracks, yet), hung to dry, & placed it on my desk. Let's see what happens when I put this bad mama to use ♡...UPDATE 1/9/25: I've purchased this about six months ago (August); & my big, bad mama is still being put to use & still in great condition! I am so happy I went against the grain of bad reviews and chose this item! It fell a couple of times, mistakenly, but is still going! No leaks, punctured or cracked holes, or anything of the sort! Also, the color is still there & no signs of fading or anything! I will definitely purchase another when this falls short!!Update 11/10/25  A year and a couple of months in & my BEAUTY BOTTLE is still holding on as the day I purchased! No cracks, leaks, punctures, mold or anything!! I was hoping to purchase another but she is still keeping my liquids contained! She's refusing to give up! I love everything about it! Thanks to the seller so much 🩷🩷"
    },
    {
        "review": "I’ve used it for about a month and it worked great. Loved the flow, and water retention. I was consistently able to drink it all in a day. The seal was great, that was until the cap lost a small little plastic gasket. Without this small gasket, the lid leaks. See small empty circular hole in top of lid. No way to replace without buying a new bottle."
    },
    {
        "review": "I have bought a few of these because I honestly love them and so do others I know that have them. But, as some reviews say, they are brittle if you drop them. To be honest though, that just comes with the size and how much water you have in it. I've dropped it more than a few times and broke two because 1. Fell out of my truck and hit the pavement on the top when it was full. 2. I dropped it in on top of something metal that broke through it. I still have bought 3 of these now for myself and some for my girlfriend because they have helped us immensely in drinking more water (which helps way more than people realize) without having all the motivational nonsense on it.  They're definitely worth it, just don't drop it on hard surfaces."
