[
    {
        "review": "This is a great giant water bottle! My son loves it. The 64 oz size is perfect for football practice, especially on those hot days when he’s sweating a lot and needs extra hydration. He was constantly running out of water with his other bottles, so we decided to order this one, and it has been a great choice.It holds plenty of water to get him through an entire practice, and he loves the color. I also really like the feature that allows him to hook it onto the fence, which is super convenient during practice.Great value and exactly what we were looking for!"
