        "review": "Very durable, and great capacity.My son uses this for soccer - it has enough capacity to get him through 2 games on tournament days, and he's just finished his second season with it (4 days / week, all year).  One of the hooks broke so he can no longer hang it on a fence, but there's no leakage at the threads and the cap still opens, closes and seals, which is always a worry when there are moving parts."
