        "review": "I love my new Stanley IceFlow Aerolight 50 oz bottle. It’s really beautiful and love the lilac colour. The straw hole is wider and comfortable to drink from. It doesn’t leak and is definitely much lighter than my Yeti 46 oz. However, I gave it 4 stars because it doesn’t keep ice and water as long as my Yeti. The ice lasts up to 8 or 9 hours then melts, but the water remains cool a while longer. My Yeti 46 oz can keep ice up to one and a half days. I guess to make it lighter the insulation is not as thick so it doesn’t maintain coldness as long as the double insulated Yetis. Update: April 1.  I had to come back and write an additional update.  The longer I have this bottle is the more I love it.  It is keeping the ice and water longer now.  Not sure why it wasn't when I just got it.  It is beautiful holds a lot and I absolutely love it even more than my Yeti which I had really loved.  It is so tall and slender and just beautiful.  Thank you Stanley & Amazon!"
