    {
        "review": "Absolutely in love, the color, the style and pattern have exceeded my expectations.  Keeps drinks very cold.  I put ice in it in the morning and the next morning you can still see some ice.  Great tumblerDefinitely worth the price and no condensation at all!"
    },
