[
    {
        "review": "I've been really impressed with this water bottle. The insulation is outstanding—it easily keeps my water ice cold for a full day, and I've even had ice left after 24 hours. The 64 oz size is perfect because I'm not constantly refilling it throughout the day.The build quality feels premium. It's durable, the powder-coated finish provides a good grip, and it doesn't sweat. I also really like that it comes with both a straw lid and a spout lid, so I can switch depending on whether I'm at work, traveling, or at the gym. The paracord handle is a nice touch and makes it much easier to carry than I expected.Most importantly, it doesn't leak. I've tossed it in my truck, carried it around the house, and traveled with it without any issues.If I had one suggestion, it would be to make it fit more vehicle cup holders, but that's a tradeoff with any half-gallon bottle.Overall, this is one of the best insulated water bottles I've owned. If you're looking for something that keeps water cold for a long time and helps you stay hydrated throughout the day, I highly recommend it."
    },
    {
        "review": "This insulated water bottle is great! I specifically purchased it for my son to use during his Youth football practice/games. It has proven to be an excellent purchase. While it is a little higher on the purchase price it is definitely worth it. The water bottle is very easy to use and clean. It requires very little maintenance. The 1 gallon capacity has ensured he doesn't run out of water during practice or games. The insulated water bottle keeps the water cold long after he's finished with practice regardless of the 100°F plus, temperature days. The material it is made out of has proven to be very tough and durable while still remaining light weight. It also comes with some very handy accessories such as a heavy duty custom sewn hand carrying strap, straws and straw/water spout cleaning brushes. Just to mention a few. It also comes in several different custom color options. I was forced to purchase the Raymylo 128oz insulated water bottle to quickly replace the first water bottle I purchased (Underarmour) for my son which suddenly and without warning started to profusely leak between the cap and bottle after only a few uses. The RAYMYLO Water bottle I purchased has resulted in an unexpected upgrade that has turned out to be the best replacement I could have asked for. It has proven time and time again that regardless of what activity it's being used in conjunction with, temperature altitude and environment it's subjected to, or position it's stored in it will continue to provide an extremely durable, reliable, leak proof light weight water bottle that keeps its liquid contents cool for long periods of time. I highly recommend it and I will only be purchasing the RAYMYLO brand water bottles in the future!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I’ve accumulated quite a few water bottles over the years, but this RAYMYLO 20 oz insulated bottle has become one of my daily favorites. I’ve been using it regularly, and it has held up extremely well.The powder-coated exterior is durable and still looks great even after several accidental drops. I also really like that it comes with both a comfortable handheld strap and a shoulder strap, making it easy to carry whether I’m running errands, hiking, or just on the go.It keeps my drinks cold for hours, doesn’t leak, and the overall build quality feels solid. If you’re looking for a well-made insulated bottle that’s built for everyday use, I highly recommend this one."
    },
    {
        "review": "These are great bottles at a great price! I usually use a much more expensive water bottle, but needed a backup so I gave this a shot. I'm so glad I did! They don't leak, they look great, they keep my drinks super cold, they seem durable, and they aren't too overpriced so if something happens to it I won't feel like I lost an expensive EDC item, I can just buy another and keep it moving. I love that they have the outside cover and paracord handle too, what a nice touch! They are fairly easy to clean as well, which is one of the most important features for me."
