    {
        "review": "Great product. Well insulated. Price is good. Strap and carrying case are great and surprisingly comfortable when adjusted. I bought this in the summer of 2024. The carrying case broke in the summer two years later, but the bottle is still in good condition. I would recommend this for adventures outdoors but expect the straps themselves to be fair to the price. Invest a little more if you want the straps to be more comfortable and durable to carry long distances.The option between a straw and chug cap is brilliant, though keep in mind that the bottle’s large size can make it hard to suck from. I think I got the biggest size at the time because I only wanted to have to fill it up once a day. Turns out that it sometimes can go multiple days without refilling but it is awkward to carry because of its size, so I personally would only usey particular size bottle for hikes with multiple people or long trips in heat (safaris, etc). That being said, I am still using this every day partially filled for work until I get another small bottle.My only suggestion to the manufacturer would be to offer a model with a higher quality strap (fake leather or something of the sort) that will do better in harsh environments."
