        "review": "All i can say is WOW WOW WOW! my water stays cold for days, there is still ice 24 hours later! and i love the simple design, leak proof, and color, easy to clean and easy to hold, does not slip on table. I made some research on which tumbler to get for cold water duration and i decided on simple modern."
    }
