    {
        "review": "So happy! I wanted a chug top that was able to be opened with one hand, not black so I could see when gross things started growing on it, and bonus this isn’t plastic (it’s silicone.)I’m surprised by some features I wasn’t looking for. The base isn’t metal so it’s not making a sound when I put it down on a counter, or sliding around. The top has a gentle pop to it so when opened it fully opens getting out of the way.It fits in my car cup holder, which is a must for me. And has a nice capacity. I don’t drink cold liquids, so can’t comment on the insulation. And I rarely open the whole lid since I don’t add ice, but it’s great access for cleaning. I love the blue color, and love that the lid is blue too. No hiding any grime! At first the spout seemed too small to me (smaller than what I’m used to) but it actually works quite well, and is growing on me.All around fantastic water bottle! It’s taken me so long to find the right one. It’s clear CamelBak has taken user feedback to up their game here."
