    {
        "review": "First of all this is a beautiful bottle. It's constructed with superior materials. I've owned a couple of these and nothing can compare to the temperature retention of this one. The water is still cold and there's even ice still after 24 hours! this is really an incredible product."
    },
    {
        "review": "This bottle is great. It keeps drink very cold for a long time. I’ve left this on my nightstand overnight without the lid on. Poured an ice cold drink (no actual ice in it) just before falling asleep and the bottle was mostly full. Woke up 7-8 hours later and the drink was still pretty cold. I’ve worked an entire shift without drinking from it after filling it up and putting a couple ice cubes inside. Opened it up ~9 hours later and the ice looked like it had barely melted.The little metal handle on the lid is very handy. I can use it to carry by hand, or I can attach a clip or strap to it to carry it on a bag or shoulder/neck.The one downside is the lid. The lid itself is fine from a functionality point, but the metal on metal screech that happens when you’re screwing the lid on and off is literally like nails on a chalkboard. It’s enough to make me want to stop using it. If it weren’t as effective as it is, I probably would have stopped using it a long time ago."
