[
    {
        "review": "I’ve been using this Owala bottle for a while now, and I’m really happy with it. It keeps my water cold for hours, even on hot days. The FreeSip lid is super convenient because I can either sip through the built-in straw or drink normally. It’s easy to clean, doesn’t leak, and the Disney Princess design is subtle but really cute. The quality feels excellent, and I would definitely buy another one. Highly recommend!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Normally I'm not the type of person to follow trends or fall for the \"hype\" of popular products like the Stanleys and Hydroflashs because usually they end up being useless. HOWEVER-! These are definitely worth it. Whether I'm working a 9hr shift, driving during a hot day or just sleeping overnight it stays cold the entire time. It doesn't leak. It's not super heavy. The material is nice as well, and doesn't make a lot of noise or fall over and start leaking. I also love all of the color options, I went with the Tangled version and aside from the fact that I think the stickers could've been a bit bigger it's super cute!Highly recommend, especially considering the price. It seems expensive but knowing you won't have to constantly replace it makes it worth it. As well as being relatively affordable for younger peeps like myself who need a nice one for work!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I bought this Owala bottle for my kindergarten daughter, and she absolutely loves it! I originally wanted a smaller size, but the Disney Princess collaboration was only available in this size. Even though it’s a little bigger, it has worked out great. She was so excited to take it to school because she loves the Disney Princess design. The matching sticker that came with the bottle was such a fun bonus, and we added her name label so it wouldn’t get mixed up at school. It keeps her water cold all day, doesn’t leak, and the flip-top straw is easy for her to use on her own. The quality is excellent, and I’d definitely recommend it to other parents looking for a durable school water bottle."
    },
    {
        "review": "My daughter loves it! Spill proof, keeps the water cool for the entire day, easy to use and clean and the colors are lovely"
    },
    {
        "review": "I LOVE this water bottle. I’ve always been a yeti girl but this is THE water bottle. I’ve been having trouble drinking enough water. And this bottle has made a big difference. It’s super versatile. I love the ability to use a straw or tip it back and drink it. It has a texture on the lid that helps grip better and take off and put on easier. Made from a really sturdy material. Fits in every cup holder I’ve tried so far. Including my couch and both vehicles. Really good at holding ice and keeping it cold. Only thing wrong I had with it is I didn’t notice the little Cinderella slipper in the photos. But it’s super small. I really just bought it for the color of the bottle. But it’s not a huge deal. I would buy again."
    },
    {
        "review": "Love these water bottles. Love the option of the flow or the built-in straw, which makes it very versatile. Very durable I have dropped mine several times and it takes the hit though the paint does scrape off, which is to be expected. The design is amazing the Star Wars decor color perfect for the Star Wars lover."
    },
    {
        "review": "I got the new limited edition 32oz Glinda Owala and I absolutely love it! It's really good quality I love the rainbow sparkle, and the pink diamond design with the pink G's on it for Glinda I thought was super creative for a water bottle, and it's the perfect size for my backpack. The only down side for me is that, when I put it in a cup holder a few days after i got it, it got dented and chipped when i took it out, but it's very minor, and when you put ice in it if it's a lot or very little it will melt, but the water will still be cold. Regardless, it's a gorgeous owala, and I would highly recommend it.it will melt in 1-2 hours, but the water will still be cold. Regardless, it's a gorgeous owala and i would highly recommend this owala."
    },
    {
        "review": "I love my Owala water bottle! I love that it is leak proof, the water stays so cold. I tested against a Simple Modern one and not only did it stay colder, the temperature of the water was colder. I loved the versatility of being able to sip or use the straw. I had a problem with the ones with the straw, every time I was down to the bottom, I had to open the cap to drink the rest. The handle makes it easy to grab in the morning on my way out to work. I’m buy Owala from now on! The princess series is my favorite. The cup easily fits in my cup holder. It may be pricier than some, but well worth the cost."
    },
    {
        "review": "The Owala Star Wars FreeSip is easily one of the best reusable bottles I've ever owned. From the first moment it stands out for its design: the Star Wars-inspired details are incredibly well done and make it look much more special than a common bottle. Whether you're a casual fan or a collector, it's definitely an eye-catcher. But the best thing is that it not only looks amazing, it works great too. The FreeSip system is probably the most convenient thing I've ever tried in a water bottle. Being able to choose between drinking with an integrated straw or drinking directly by tilting the bottle seems simple, but in daily use it makes a lot of difference. It is practical for the gym, office, car or simply to carry around all day. The build quality is also excellent. It feels sturdy, well-sealed, and made with premium materials. The lid closes perfectly and so far I have not had any leaks, even carrying it inside a backpack. Another impressive point is the thermal insulation. It keeps the water cold for many hours, even on hot days. It really delivers what it promises and ensures that you always have cold drinks available. In addition, the size and grip are very comfortable. It doesn't feel bulky and the integrated handle makes it very easy to transport it. They are small details that end up making a big difference in everyday life. Something that I really liked is that it manages to perfectly balance the collectible with the functional. Many times thematic products sacrifice quality for design, but here both things are very well taken care of."
    },
    {
        "review": "Very good product and very pretty. In person they look incredible and are original. I recommend it. ❤️"
    },
    {
        "review": "Bigger than expected but a great product, stay cold all day even in hot weather in the car etc.  love the sip or gulp option and the easy flip open lid.  I got a bumper for the bottom to protect the material."
    },
    {
        "review": "Excellent quality. worth what it costs"
    },
    {
        "review": "AS described"
    }
