        "review": "I really like this black undershirt. The material is soft, comfortable, and lightweight, making it great for wearing under shirts or on its own. The fit is nice without feeling too tight, and the black color looks clean and goes with pretty much anything. It also holds up well after washing and doesn’t lose its shape easily. Overall, it’s a comfortable, simple, and good-quality undershirt that I would definitely recommend."
    },
    {
        "review": "I have been buying these Hanes Men's Undershirt packs that are 100% soft cotton for more than 20 years. I am not sure if I am the only one who feels that these have become thinner and thinner compared to the yester years. None the less they have always been 100% cotton. I really like buying these not only for undershirts but also to wear them casually at home while relaxing or chilling. In the past when I use to go to work where I needed to dress up; I would wear these inside my dress shirts to help with sweating as these keep me super cool in summer and warm in winter with additional layers on the top.These are round collared Tee shirts that are plain white and are true to size. The fabric is light weight and breathable with a slight stretch. The quality is pretty good and are tag free."
    },
    {
        "review": "Overall they are fine workout shirts. The fit is fine and the quality is okay. They are a little thin and a little on the looser side. For the price it’s a pretty decent deal and would buy again."
    },
    {
        "review": "Good value for this 6 pack, tagless shirts.  The shirts are long which makes tucking into your pants easier, and the shirt stays there.  They have made it through a few washes and dryer cycles, not a ton of shrinking which is fine.The shirts aren't the softest of shirts, but they are fine, I don't notice that they are particularly itchy or uncomfortable or anything.  Would recommend."
    },
