        "review": "Great undershirts and shirts to wear around the house. I find they fit to my body very well and are extremely comfortable. Also easy to wash. Would strongly recommend that anyone has these shirts"
    },
    {
        "review": "Great cotton t-shirts. They fit true to size and are generally flattering for guys with a heavier/more muscular build (a little akin to true classic type shirts). For the price they can’t be beat. I’m 5’10 215lbs (muscular build with a long torso) and these fit great in an XL. I can borderline fit the large when I’m a little slimmer. I love the colors, they last a long time, and they don’t fade. Also a really good feel on the skin, not too soft like some undershirts, but very comfortable."
    },
    {
        "review": "Shirts are nice. Too bad one out of the 6 in the pack was defective."
