        "review": "Good quality t shirts and good price"
    },
    {
        "review": "Good size"
    },
    {
        "review": "Considering just how cheap these were I was actually quite surprised by how nice they are.Having said that don't expect Calvin quality, but its adequate and perfect for my usage: which is for sports like mountain biking where I dont really want to care about the shirt or what it goes through.Whenever the time comes to replace, ill definitely repurchase."
