        "review": "No tags-nice! Price per shirt-nice! Length-perfect! (I’m tallish), but thin. I do favor a bit thicker material and these are not too thin, but also not heavy, a good compromise. A solid 4 star item. I’ll buy more. I will be keeping an eye on the collar to see if it curls or gets all twisted after washing."
    },
    {
        "review": "Super soft. High quality. Fits perfectly and are the best white t’s I’ve found yet!!!! Lightweight but not too thin nor are they see thru. Just the right thickness. So soft. Definitely summer material. I bought them for my husband, but I’m getting some for my son and me too now haha!!! I love em’!!!!!!"
