[
    {
        "review": "These shirts are definitely oversized! I didn’t realize to what degree they were. I ordered up a size because I ordered them as nightshirts. However, the fabric is so nice, I’m planning to order a few for everyday wear, only this time ordering down a size or two.The cut is oversized just as advertised, and represented accurately in the listing photos.The cotton, polyester, spandex blend is very soft and smooth, and with a balance of stretch and recovery—the fabric holds its shape. It does not easily wrinkle, and even wearing as a nightshirt, it does not appear overly wrinkled. I don’t say this often, but the fabric is perfect. It has some structure to it, but not thick or stiff. The shirts are neatly crafted.It has somewhat of a versatile style in that it is great for everyday wear, running errands, or a casual outing paired with jeans or shorts.The colors are rich and vibrant, and have not faded even after multiple washings.Overall, the quality and craftsmanship appear excellent."
    },
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love these oversized T-shirts! They’re so comfortable, soft, and easy to throw on with biker shorts or leggings. The fit is exactly what I was looking for—relaxed without looking sloppy.The material feels great, they’ve held up well after washing, and they’re perfect for everyday wear. I find myself reaching for this shirt all the time.I love it so much that I already want to order more colors. If you’re looking for the perfect oversized tee, I highly recommend this one!"
    },
