        "review": "I got a size large. I am curvy,  5'5\", 175 with a smaller upper body and bigger legs. This shirt hits right at the top of the thigh on me. So if you're taller, you may wanna see what the length is exactly of you want it to be a true oversized tee. It's extremely comfortable. It appears like it's very good quality. I love the color I picked. It can be worn w bike shorts, sweatpants,.or leggings etc. the material has a nice soft feel and it has decent thickness to it without it being too thick."
    },
    {
        "review": "These are true to size and are comfortable! You can wear this with your favorite shorts or pair of jeans! They wash great and looks nice on! I bought it in 2 different colors and plan on buying more in different colors!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Where to start... I love this shirts so much I order in other colors and zIm very happy I did!!! quality is the best and so soft....plus it covers all my stomach is not small but rather long enough I feel very comfortable to wear it with jeans or shorts.  Looks amazing and feels like a hug on your body.  The material is thick not flimsy or thin which makes it look like a more expensive shirt!!!!!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Really great tee. Fits true to my size, xl. It's baggy but not completely shapeless. The texture is nice and as a person with sensory issues, it's nearly perfect. My really BIG complaint is the very itchy tag sewn in. It causes severe itching and redness. I cut 80% of it out, but I couldn't remove two pieces sewn in too well.  I tried wearing it again but it still rubbed and irritated my skin. If you can figure out a way to make the tag printed on, this top would be a perfect summer top."
    },
    {
        "review": "this shirt has become one of my favorite t shorts, it is true to its oversize claim and has become a staple piece during my pregnancy! it is super comfortable and the neckline does not sit too high up to where it feels like you are choking. It is lightweight but thick at the same time, it is a great quality t shirt, the shade is like a Mauve and it is very pretty! just as pictured! I am now 26 weeks pregnant and the shirt is still not tight to where it shows the bump it just rests on your body."
