        "review": "My husband is 6 feet tall with broad shoulders and a long torso, so finding XL shirts that are long enough to fit him without being overly wide is challenging. These fit him perfectly. They’re soft, good quality, and don’t ride up when he bends down. They’ve also been washed a few times already and still look great."
