        "review": "Firstly, I think it’s important to note just how comfortable these shirts are.  The material is quite soft, and the material feels thick enough to feel as if it’s higher quality than the price would suggest.  The color variety you can buy these in gives you a lot of choices for styling, and the price point makes it plausible to buy multiple different colors.  My only wish for this is that you could buy different colors in pairs, but this doesn’t really detract from the fact that you still receive two extremely comfy shirts that are great for lounging or day-to-day activities.  I haven’t seen these shirts shrink much at all during the wash either, so I do think they’ll stand the test of time for at least a couple years.  One other quick note, these shirts have a great combination of being comfortably loose around the abdomen and lower torso area, but slightly tighter and smaller at the arms, so you won’t have much in the way of flapping sleeves if that’s a pet peeve.  Overall, very respectable quality for the price, I think it’s quite hard to beat and definitely worth getting a couple of pairs for at-home wear at the very least."
