[
    {
        "review": "I've lost over 75 lbs in the last year, so I've been haivng to buy a bunch of new clothes.  I picked up this 4-pack of Hanes ComfortSoft T-shirts looking for something both affordable and comfortable enough to wear daily but still solid enough to hold up after repeated washes—and these have delivered so far.  I like them so much that I've ordered three other colors of these.The first thing I noticed was the fabric thickness. These are a little thicker than most basic tees, which gives them a more substantial feel without being heavy or stiff. They’re soft right out of the package and stay comfortable throughout the day, whether worn alone or as a base layer.Fit is spot on for me. They’re not boxy and not tight—just a clean, relaxed fit that looks good without feeling restrictive. The colors are another pleasant surprise; they pop nicely and haven’t faded or dulled after washing.Wrinkling has been minimal, especially compared to thinner tees I’ve owned. A quick shake out of the dryer and they’re usually good to go without looking sloppy. After several wears and washes, they’ve held their shape well with no noticeable stretching at the collar or seams.If I had to nitpick, they’re not ultra-lightweight, so if someone prefers very thin, airy tees, these might feel a bit more substantial—but for me, that’s actually a plus.Overall, these have quickly become my go-to everyday T-shirts. Comfortable, durable, and a great value for a multi-pack. I’ll definitely be buying more of these."
