[
    {
        "review": "I really liked this T-shirt despite it being cropped. I did size up to XL but if the large is the same length then I could have gone with a large for a less baggy look. It’s not as cropped at my GAP tshirts but when arms were raised above head (reaching for something very high) it did show sliver of skin. I did wear this top with high waisted pants and with the exception of far reaching above head- it was fine. I’m short (5’0) with 38DD. The material is also very nice- soft and not too thick or thin. It’s not see through and great for hot weather (Texas, UAE). It fits and lays nicely. Since I went with a larger size than usual, it gave a nice baggy effect without looking sloppy. I’m most certainly going to buy more of the black and will try white one. Shirt washed well and I just let it air dry so it didn’t shrink. It was also laundered at hotel and didn’t have any shrinkage. For the price- the black is def worth it."
    },
    {
        "review": "I really like this shirt; it is nice quality, soft, with some thickness to it but not in a stuffy, hot way. White is not see through which is great as well and it is true to size, leaning slightly smaller (after washing).There are a few caveats however, if you are looking for a longer length shirt, this probably won’t work and it does shrink the first wash (but is fine the following washes). It is a boxy fit but not overly so, once it shrinks it fits nicely against the body and for me, who has quite a long torso, it comes to my belly button and generally the tops of my higher waisted leggings/shorts, which I prefer. However, if you do not like shorter shirts or shirts that go just to the tops of your pants, look elsewhere. I would not say it is a cropped tee but it can appear shorter if you are used to longer tees.If you want a longer length shirt or to have it fit boxier you should go up a size or two. Just be aware it does shrink but for me, it shrank perfectly. I wear them all the time. No pilling so far and it does not cling to my body."
