        "review": "Ordered 7 packs of two for a workshop as a gift for class participants. Notebook cover is synthetic leather, soft-padded, nice stitching detail - cover great for the price. Did not test whether ink bleeds through the paper as I did not buy one for myself (yet).  Notebooks came very well packaged, each inidividually shrink-wrapped plus each two-pack had plastic outer packaging as well. Basic quality check of 14 notebooks was great - clean, no tears or marks, features were as described. The red is a bright, candy-apple red colour. Black is, well, black. The paper has a nice feel and is off-white. Says it has double-line binding which is supposed to be durable but not very nice looking  as shown in my photo of the book opened and layed flat against a tabe. If pages stay secure with use, this is a minor concern. Recommend."
    },
    {
        "review": "These have got to be about some of the best journals I have ever used!I can’t say enough good things. They’re so thoughtful and well made. They get the basics right and then some thoughtful additions that even big brands like Moleskin don’t even do.1. Super good looking and feeling. I don’t like cheap stuff, these feel good. Not going to be some luxury product though, genuinely feel really good in the hand.2. The paper is way better than almost any other notebook I’ve used in the past. I’m writing with a fountain pen and it’s a dream. It feels buttery to write on, the pages are great quality, the ink doesn’t bleed through (like on Moleskin) and no feathering or anything happens, it’s just crisp lines from my fountain pen (doesn’t apply if you use regular ballpoint pens).3. Pen holder on the side is a huge bonus.4. Bookmark to easily find your page.5. This price is ridiculous. Essentially 2 for the price of one and I don’t feel like I’m making any compromises.I’m really excited to write in these for years to come. I might just buy like 20 and either give them out as gifts and/ or keep them for after these run out.Terrific work, super happy with these! Even the next best competitor on Amazon at the time of writing these is double the price and no pen holder, same quality of paper so. This is a big winner for me!"
