        "review": "Exactly as described, cheaper than our local stores for back to school."
    },
    {
        "review": "The moment after you first buy it, the paper is very smooth, decently thick, and bleed-through resistant. However after a few months it starts to lose that, becoming more coarse, grainy, and seems to lose it's quality via aging. So far I've bought two of them, the first one I bought is very easy to tear on accident and is not bleed-through resistant at all. With the newer one, it used to be very good and I could even write on it with permanent marker without any bleed-through. Now the marker bleeds through 2-3 pages after a few months of it sitting on a shelf. If you're gonna use it up quick, I highly recommend it. If not, you might want to find something a little better. Overall, a decent notebook. 4 stars."
