    },
    {
        "review": "Bought these for my kids to take notes on, because they fit on a school desk next to a computer. I ended up loving them too. Good quality. The cover is sturdy and easy to label with a sharpie. The pages are printed from top to bottom with no wasted header space. Will fit a whole subjects highlights for the year to make studying for finals easier. The stitching is uniform and blends well with the dark green color.I love the feature of its size. You can use this notebook as a bookmark in textbooks. Leave the notebook open to the page you need and tuck it sideways into the textbook.Could also use it to take notes alongside literature books. So many possibilities."
    },
    {
        "review": "The pack of journals is a great find. They come in a nice range of colors, all vibrant without being loud. The paper quality is solid—smooth, thick enough to handle most pens, and no bleed-through. Each notebook feels well made and perfect for notes, lists, or journaling. Good value for a colorful, well-crafted set."
