[
    {
        "review": "These are my favorite notebooks. I have repurchased and bought for others probably over a dozen times.They are relatively fountain pen friendly. Depends on the ink and nib size but I use a medium nib with Diamine Writers Blood and only have a tiny bit of bleed through if I write over another spot before it is dry (like correcting a letter or something). It does take a second to absorb so don’t flip your page immediately or your ink with smear. Light colored Tom Bows are ok and dark are fine if you don’t build up more than one layer. (Light is pic 3, minimal multi-colored pattern show through in pic 4)The two ribbon book marks are a game changer for me.Price is amazing for what you are getting. I consider these far superior to moleskin for half the price. Page count is great. I have been using the same one as a commonplace (so writing a blurb or two almost every day, give or take) since January ‘26 and am only a little more than halfway through. Lays flat and is still in like new condition even as I throw it in my bag, bring to the beach, etc. (last two photos)Great color selection that is true to the image provided.I can’t say enough good things. I will probably have at least one of these in rotation at all times."
    },
    {
        "review": "I use two of these journals at a time: one to plan my novel, and the other as a diary/braindump combo. I don't decorate the pages or do any impressive bujo designs, so I can't speak to how it would serve as a bullet journal. However, these babies see a lot of heavy writing use from me. I've purchased four of them so far and not a single one has disappointed.Page thickness is great. I accidentally spilled water on a couple pages and it didn't bleed through, which was shocking to me, given how affordable this journal is compared to most others listed. The pages are smooth and easy to write on, so be careful with any pens that might smudge or smear. The paper will certainly make it easier to pick up and spread wet ink on your hands. I'm a ballpoint user and I've noticed that finer tips work best, but even with the standard cheap-o pens, I just give them a minute or two to dry and then I'm highlighting all over them with no problem.It's solidly built. I've never had any issue with pages falling out, or the bookmark ribbons unfurling - and I'm writing in my journal at least 3 or 4 hours a day, constantly flipping back and forth through multiple brain dumps. (If you've got ADHD, you understand what I mean.) The color of the cover and ribbons are absolutely stunning, somehow prettier than the pictures show imo. I personalize the covers of my journals with stickers and writing, and whatever I put on has lasted.Overall, this journal has consistently impressed me by serving me well and I couldn't recommend a better one."
    },
    {
        "review": "Arrived on time in perfect condition. Just as described: smooth, lovely cover; smooth paper, just the right weight, light grid that helps with positioning but doesn’t interfere with drawing or writing; helpful ribbon page markers; handy pocket inside back cover. Thanks for providing a quality product at a very reasonable price."
    },
    {
        "review": "Love this book. It is a good size for me. The only critique I have is that the lines are a little bit skinny. I find myself writing every two lines, kidn of liek grade school BUT the lines themselves are skinny enough that it doesn't make  abig difference.This is now my go to daily journal. The texture of the cover is hard and 'leather' (I don't know if it is real), which makes me think it could be a good art project in the future ot decorate it. The back envelope is very pretty and sturdy. The two ribbons seem sturdy as well. (Althought I do not know why someone needs two? I'm assuming theres a specific use for them) its big enough to fit in my purse as well, so its easy to bring it along when I want.I got the green one and it is a rich forest green. Would totally buy again."
    },
    {
        "review": "The paper in these RETTACY Notebooks is absolutely fantastic.  Smooth to the touch, easy on the eyes, and takes fountain pens as well as ballpoint, rollerball, and pencil all like a dream. The ghosting/show-through through is really minimal, and bleed through almost nonexistent (a tiny bit with a really wet fountain pen). Also works nice with Ranger ink stamp - still no bleed through although there is ghosting/show-through. The lining/grid/dot grids is clear but very subtle and non-distracting.  (Do note that the lined notebooks (as opposed to grid, dot grid, or blank) to come with \"Date\" printed in the upper corner of each page). I think these are easily the equal in quality of Midori MD, Clairefontaine clothbound and Premium C.D.  - now, all those (and these) have their own minor aesthetic differences (the Midori paper is creamier and a bit toothier, the Clairefontaine and C.D. is much \"slicker\"; cover differences, etc.)  so everyone will have their favorites - but you won't be disappointed on quality - and how can you beat the price!!!!  A million times better than Moleskin"
    },
    {
        "review": "Especially for the price, this is a really high quality notebook.- The cover is well made- The pages are stitched, so they're not going to fall out over time- The paper is lovely; smooth, and easy to write on, no bleed through or indentations on the reverse side from writing (at least from the type of pen I use)- There's a stretchy band in the back for holding loose papersTook one star away because the little strip of stretchy fabric for holding a pen is ridiculously tiny. I just cut it off as I can't use it.Would absolutely recommend this for anyone who's looking for a sturdy, well-made notebook. Will definitely buy again."
    },
    {
        "review": "I love this journal. It's my first dot journal. I use it every morning for my Bible journaling. I would recommend a 0.5mm or slightly smaller. Be cautious with highlighting, as every highlighter I have tried has smeared my pen makes. No bleeding. Easy to flip open and it lays flat. Good amount of pages. My church gives out little pamflit sort of things and they fit almost perfectly on the pages, so I can slip those right in there. Looks and feels nice. Would definitely buy again!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I ordered this blank notebook and a blank Paperage brand notebook from Amazon, this notebook was WAY nicer! It came with journaling stencils in the back pocket (the Paperage one just came with 4 lined note stickers) it also has two ribbons for you to mark pages with, it has more pages than the Paperage book, the cover is heavier and more durable than the Paperage one, and the pages themselves I would say are slightly thicker than the Paperage one. If you're debating getting this one or that one, GET THIS NOTEBOOK."
    },
    {
        "review": "Excellent product, very good quality; Besides, it is very pretty and elegant. The sheets have the ideal thickness for perfect writing. I loved it!🤗"
    },
    {
        "review": "Best Bullet notebook I've ever bought! It has a construction made of quality material; enough pages to cover an entire year (following Ryder's method); place to attach pen/pencils and markers."
    }
]

[
    {
        "review": "I have beat this thing up! And it works for my constant random notes and nonsense I jot down. I love the date and day section at top that helps with referencing. I can write on either side as it can fold in on itself nicely and utilizes all pages. I do not get wrist fatigue. It’s also really nicely sized. Big enough to fit quite a bit but not to big that it’s a joke and I can carry it on my person easily. The organized colored folders are moveable and have helped keep some level of separation between different types of notes. I have taken this with to many jobs across the states and I’ve been asked multiple times where I got it, it checks all my boxes for a perfect notebook and is worth the price!!!"
    },
    {
        "review": "This is one of my favorite items to keep in my work bag. What impressed me the most was the quality of the cover. Both the front and back covers are thick and sturdy, which helps protect the pages and makes the notebook feel very durable.I also like the colored divider tabs because they make it easy to organize different projects, notes, or categories. It even comes with stickers that you can use to label each section, which is a nice touch.The notebook is a great size for everyday use, and the metal spiral binding feels strong and well made. The pages turn smoothly, and everything stays together nicely.Overall, this is a high-quality notebook that looks professional, stays organized, and has held up very well for me. I would definitely recommend it."
    },
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love this notebook! From the moment I opened it, I could tell it was well-made and thoughtfully designed. The floral hardcover is gorgeous, but it's the functionality that really makes this notebook stand out.The sturdy hardcover protects the pages from getting bent or damaged, making it perfect for work, home, or carrying in a bag. One of my favorite features is the gold spiral binding—it lays completely flat while writing, which is a huge plus for me.The colorful tabbed dividers are what truly make this notebook special. I can easily label each section and keep different projects, notes, lists, and ideas organized all in one place. No more flipping through endless pages trying to find what I need!Pros:✔ Beautiful floral design that looks professional and stylish✔ Durable hardcover protects pages✔ Gold spiral binding allows notebook to lay flat✔ Multiple tabbed sections for easy organization✔ Plenty of writing space on lined pages✔ Perfect for work, school, budgeting, meal planning, or journaling✔ High-quality construction that feels built to lastFinal Thoughts:If you're someone who loves being organized, this notebook is a dream. It combines beauty, durability, and functionality in one package. The tabbed sections make it incredibly easy to stay organized, and the hardcover and spiral binding are exactly what I look for in a notebook. This may honestly be the perfect notebook I've found so far!"
    },
    {
        "review": "This hardcover spiral notebook is an excellent value and has quickly become one of my favorite notebooks for work. The 300 pages give you plenty of space, and the 5‑subject layout with removable divider tabs makes it easy to organize meeting notes, projects, and to‑dos without carrying multiple notebooks. The leather‑style cover feels sturdy and professional, and the spiral binding lets the notebook lay flat, which is great for writing during meetings.The paper quality is smooth and holds up well to pens and highlighters without bleeding. The removable tabs are especially helpful—you can shift sections around as your projects change, which keeps everything neat and flexible. For the amount of space and the durable build, it’s a great value and perfect for anyone who likes their notes organized and easy to reference.A reliable, roomy, and well‑designed notebook that works beautifully for meetings, planning, and everyday writing."
    },
    {
        "review": "I am very pleased with this hardcover spiral notebook. The cover is sturdy and protects the pages well, making it perfect for carrying in a backpack, purse, or work bag. The spiral binding is strong and allows the notebook to lay flat, which makes writing much more comfortable.The pages are thick enough that ink doesn't bleed through easily, and the paper feels smooth and high quality. I use mine for notes, journaling, and planning, and it has held up great with daily use.Overall, this notebook offers a nice combination of durability, functionality, and professional appearance. I would definitely purchase it again and recommend it to students, professionals, or anyone who enjoys writing things down"
    },
    {
        "review": "The item is just as stated. It is working out very well for me as an educator who documents items daily. I loved than it had dividers i can use as well to break up different responsibilities. This item is durable with a metal binding to keep the paper safe."
    },
    {
        "review": "I am in love with this notebook! The organization of the pages from beginning to end is exactly what I need. It is perfect from the outside to the inside and the size is perfect to take with me. It’s very useful and my go to notebook. The outside of the notebook has a thick covering and very very pretty. Delivered in excellent condition and nicely wrapped. Made me not want to open it  lol. If I can give it 10/5 stars I would and the price just made it all the better. I highly recommend it."
    },
    {
