    {
        "review": "Five star makes the BEST school notebooks on planet Earth!!!!As a freshman who takes an unhealthy amount of notes, the large pages are perfect, plus it’s cute and so sturdy! Pages are sooo easy to rip out. It’s thin so it easily fits in my backpack and I love the amount of color options for subject organization."
