    },
    {
        "review": "I wear these to work often, as well as when I go about anywhere. They are accommodated for my feet that are a bit wide, and I can wear them all day with no issue. They are cushiony and not suffocating at all. The colors are also pretty, and my one coworker loves to compliment me on them. I am satisfied!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Good quality and the number requested arrived"
