        "review": "Always loved this movie,  great 80s before everyone has some understand of tech or tech was more mystery.  All star cast Redford, Sydney Poitier, Lady that later was President in BattleStar gallatica, and SNL actor that was one of the Blues Brothers... Great Remaster by Kino."
