        "review": "Sneakers is one of my favorite movies.  If you're able to get past dates tech and suspend yourself in disbelief in the film's logic, you're in for a fun movie.Sneakers is a computer hacker thriller with some comedy thrown in for good measure.  What makes it work is the tight pacing and talented cast, led by Robert Redford and Ben Kingsley.  Not to be outdone is Redfords rag tag group that helps infiltrate security for a living.  Fun performances from Sidney Poitier, Dan Aykroyd,  River Phoenix and David Stranahan.Underrated gem, and worth a look all these years later if you can forgive the dates tech."
