[
    {
        "review": "Yankee is very dependable.  I’ve been in to aromatherapy near all of my life.  This scent is a nice surprise.  Not overly lemon like house cleaning - you know.  This is beautiful and normally I do not go citrus or coconut - Fragrance is Lovely.  Gotta love when Yankee’s go on clearance.  Great price.  Relaxing.  Burns clean if wicks kept trimmed."
    },
    {
        "review": "I bought several of these, since they were on sale. What a deal! Great product. I like the way that they are packaged. Each candle is wrapped in a mold formed cardboard. It's like each candle has its own little cradle surrounding it, then that gets put into a rectangular box. Then those boxes are packed in the usual Amazon shipping Style with brown paper, another packaging materials. Everything seems like it's recyclable, which is great!That alone was the justification and enough of a reason for me to have confidence that nothing broke during shipping, and then I was actually receiving a quality item.So when it comes to the actual candle itself, great! The smell is incredible, very true to the description. I also like the fact that they give you enough of a long Wick as a starter, so that you can get the Kendall going properly. I would say the top quarter of an inch or so is what actually liquefies once the candle is burning. So it's great that you know you're only burning what is needed.So going back to the scent, the intensity, the actual smell, it's great! I would say the smell is definitely true to what the description is. I would also go as far as to say that even if you just take the cap off come and leave it open without lighting the candle, the aroma definitely fills the room with just the essential oils or whatever it is inside of the candle. So the room smells great whether you burn the candle or you don't.In terms of candle power and illumination, I lit this candle, and put it in the corner of the room, and notice that the entire room just lit up so beautifully. It's definitely enough light to not have to Fumble around in the middle of the night. Definitely sets the mood as well, if you looking for some ambience.To put the candle out or to extinguish it, I just put the lid back on, and it seems to do the trick within about 3 or 4 seconds.The glass jar itself feels great, feels sturdy, the lid and the silicone gasket that seals the actual candle when you put the lid on.For the overall experience of purchasing this, the way it was packaged and shipped, and the incredible smell and scent and the intensity of the aroma, I would definitely buy this product again, and also recommend it to a friend. I would say I would buy more when they do go on sale, and potentially give them out as gifts for the holidays, or a special occasion, or housewarming, etc.By the way, please pardon the repeat similar reviews. I did buy a lot of these, and the real difference between each review is just the actual individual scent of the candle that I purchased. But all the different scents that I purchased I definitely the same in terms of Wonderful aroma, intensity, authenticity to the smells that are described in the description, etc."
    },
    {
        "review": "I absolutely love this Sicilian Lemon scented candle from Yankee Candle. The fragrance is incredibly fresh and vibrant—it smells like you’ve just sliced into a perfectly ripe lemon. It’s not overly sweet or artificial, which I really appreciate. Instead, it has a clean, crisp citrus scent that instantly makes any room feel more energized and inviting.The throw is excellent without being overpowering. Within minutes of lighting it, my home feels brighter and more refreshing, almost like a burst of sunshine indoors. I’ve used it in both my kitchen and living room, and it works beautifully in both areas.The burn is even and long-lasting, which is exactly what I expect from Yankee Candle. It’s perfect for when I want a clean-smelling home without heavy floral or sugary notes.If you enjoy citrus scents that are natural and uplifting, this candle is definitely worth trying. It’s become one of my go-to favorites for everyday use."
