    },
    {
        "review": "So let's start with the smell, it was beautiful and filled a rather large room.I love the woodwick candles! This was the first time I've purchased, a larger wicked candle if that makes sense? The candle is oblong so the wicked is close to 2\" wide. I love the sound and light ambience the woodwicks put off, they are one of a kind and I think they are the most amazing candles all around. The reason I'm not giving 5 ☆'s is due to 2 reasons.1st the candles do not last long at all, unfortunately they burn in less then 1/2 the time a candle 1/2 is size does.2nd it is a huge, HUGE fire hazard!These larger wicks burn like you've lit a stick on fire in your living room! I burn my new candles on top of my wood stove to see how they burn before placing them out of direct eye site. There is nothing else on, near or above my wood stove and thank God for that because it blew my mind how this candle burned! The flame is gigantic in comparison to any other candle, it almost seems like a candle you would light for the fire not the smell?I highly recommend WOODWICK candles, but if you go with a larger wick one keep in mind it burns like a fire not a candle and keep it in sight at all times while it's burning!Other then these reasons its a wonderful product and the sound! I have to mention the sound of these candles, it sounds like a camp fire on low volume 😃I HIGHLY RECOMMEND WOODWICK CANDLES!!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Absolutely love these candles. You can never go wrong. The fragrance is amazing. The burn quality is amazing. I love how it makes the clicking sound. The brightness is wonderful."
    },
    {
        "review": "Love this scent! I ordered another one!"
    },
    {
        "review": "Okay, listen. This isn’t just a candle—it’s basically a personality. It’s huge enough to make me feel like I got my money’s worth, and when I lit it, the wick started crackling like I’d just built a five-star campfire in my living room (minus the mosquitoes and questionable s’mores hygiene).The scent situation? Wild. This candle has three layers, three different colors, and three totally different vibes. It’s like aromatherapy speed-dating: one minute I’m sniffing warm vanilla woods, then boom—suddenly I’m transported to a citrus grove, and before I can process that, I’m chilling in a pine forest wondering if I should be chopping firewood. My nose has never been so entertained.The wide wick is basically the MVP—no tunneling, no sad little wax puddles. Just big, bold, “I’m a candle and I know it” energy. Honestly, if this candle had legs, it would probably roast marshmallows for me.10/10 would buy again. In fact, I’m low-key worried this thing is going to give me main-character energy every time I light it."
    },
