[
    {
        "review": "I’m really happy with this candle overall. The Jasmine, Oud & Sandalwood scent is warm, cozy, and a little luxurious without being too heavy. The jasmine adds a soft floral touch, while the oud and sandalwood give it that deeper, clean, slightly earthy scent. It makes my room smell calm and relaxing, especially in the evenings.The throw is pretty good for a 9 oz candle, and I could still smell it even after blowing it out, which I loved. It also burned evenly for me and seems like it’s going to last a while. The jar itself is simple but cute and looks nice sitting on a nightstand or coffee table.My only small complaint is that I wish the scent was just a little stronger when first lit, because it took a bit for it to really fill the room. Once it got going though, it smelled amazing. Overall, I’d still definitely buy it again and would recommend it if you like warm, elegant scents that aren’t overly sweet."
    },
    {
        "review": "If you’re looking for a candle that makes your home feel warm, luxurious, and incredibly inviting, the Lulu Candles Jasmine, Oud, & Sandalwood Luxury Scented Soy Jar Candle is an easy favorite. The fragrance is beautifully balanced—the delicate floral notes of jasmine blend effortlessly with the rich, slightly smoky oud and the creamy warmth of sandalwood, creating a sophisticated scent that feels both calming and elegant. It’s the perfect combination of floral and woody without being overpowering. The candle is hand-poured with a soy wax blend for a clean, even burn, and its fragrance lingers long after it’s been extinguished, filling the room with a cozy, spa-like ambiance.Whether you’re unwinding after a long day, reading a book, or simply creating a relaxing atmosphere, this candle instantly elevates the space. It also burns evenly and lasts much longer than many candles I’ve tried, making it well worth it. If you enjoy luxurious, warm fragrances with a touch of floral elegance, I highly recommend giving this one a try—it feels like bringing a high-end boutique hotel right into your home. ✨"
    },
    {
        "review": "I have a serious candle addiction—I usually have at least 30 candles at any given time! 😂 I can’t even remember what made me try this scent, but it did NOT disappoint. I bought two within the first month, and it has officially become the signature scent of my home.The scent is clean, woody, luxurious, and gives upscale hotel vibes. It’s strong enough that you can smell it straight from the box or even when it’s just sitting out. I love it so much that I even mix diffusing oils to keep a similar scent throughout my house.My only con is the price—it’s a little pricey for the size. But I’m hooked now, so there’s no turning back! If you’re a candle lover, definitely give this one a try."
    },
    {
        "review": "This scent!  It is the most luxurious, indulgent, beautiful scent Ive ever experienced in a candle.It smells amazing and will delight your senses.  It smells like water, forrest, orchids, sensuality, and wealth!It smells like luxury... I cant explain any other way, just buy it and see for yourself!It is unique and everyone will be asking where in the world you found it"
    },
    {
        "review": "I was completely blown away by the scent. It is very difficult to find a more sophisticated and smooth fragrance. Definitely enough to make my apartment warm and inviting. The burn time has been very surprising so far, despite the candle being rather small. Every bit of wax is melting down evenly.I have had quite a bit of trouble blowing this one out and leaving the wick smoking for what I feel is a rather excessive amount of time. As these do not have any kind of cover, your mileage may vary. A lid would be ideal as the lingering smoldering pretty much ends the purpose of the fragrance."
    },
    {
        "review": "I wasn’t sure what to expect when I ordered this, but the moment I lit it for the first time, I was completely blown away. The Jasmine, Oud & Sandalwood combination is pure sophistication in a candle. It’s warm, exotic, and incredibly inviting — like walking into a high-end spa.The scent throw is phenomenal. One candle fills my entire living room without being overpowering. It hits that perfect balance of strong enough to notice but not so heavy that it gives you a headache. The jasmine adds a fresh floral top note while the oud and sandalwood give it that deep, rich, luxurious warmth underneath. The layers of scent are just chef’s kiss.The burn is incredibly clean and even. No tunneling, no excessive soot, and the wick stays perfectly centered. It burns down slowly too, so you really get your money’s worth out of it. I’ve had cheaper candles burn out in days — this one lasts.The packaging alone feels like a gift. It looks beautiful on my coffee table and gets compliments from every single guest who comes over. People always ask where I got it!If you’re on the fence, just buy it. This is hands down the most luxurious candle I’ve ever owned, and I will be repurchasing without hesitation. Lulu Candles has a customer for life! 🕯️​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​"
    },
    {
