        "review": "This candle felt a little pricey but honestly it smells so good! I bought it hoping to be a Diptyque dupe and it comes pretty close. It burns really evenly and the smell carries through the house! Definitely recommend if your someone who already spends money on the Jo Malone or Diptyque candles!"
