[
    {
        "review": "I am absolutely thrilled with the Tyler Candle Company Diva Glamorous Gift Suite! This set is the epitome of luxury and elegance. The scent, Diva, is absolutely intoxicating — it’s a perfect blend of fruity, floral, and musky notes that fill the room with a sophisticated and inviting aroma. It’s the kind of fragrance that makes your space feel instantly more elegant and welcoming.The gift suite includes several items, and each one is of exceptional quality. The candles burn evenly and last a long time, making them great value for the price. The soap is wonderfully fragrant, leaving my skin feeling soft and pampered. I love the attention to detail in the packaging too — it feels like a high-end spa experience wrapped up in a gorgeous box.This gift suite makes an incredible present for anyone who loves indulging in a little self-care or simply enjoys luxury home fragrances. It’s the perfect treat for yourself or someone special. I can’t recommend it enough!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I asked a co-worked about how great she smelled, and it was her detergent! She said she gets so many compliments. Super pricy but it lasts a long time, so not that pricy per use. She was right. It’s a liquid consistency, like water, and I use a little per load. So anyway, my daughter (who’s in college and never once in her life commented on laundry smell) said, mooooooom my clothes smell soooooo good. I was like, really? And later she got compliments on how she smelled. And so did I. And I am sensitive to strong perfumes, it’s just a super clean yet the perfect amount to scent. Don’t know how to explain. “Diva” sounds like it would be strong and too much, but this is amazing. So, I bought her this little kit to take back to college with her, and she loved it. Silly things that bring a little joy. The spray is really nice. The candle is really nice. The car hanger is super strong, so I’d recommend putting it in the back seat. It did fade quickly. So that’s the only thing in the kit that I would not repurchase, but it was cool to try. Otherwise I’ll repurchase the other items. Not included in the kit are the dryer/saches. I bought them separately and love them."
    },
    {
        "review": "THis Little sample pack was great!! I know these products are quite expensive so I thought it was nice to try them in a little set like this! I was nervous at first because people were saying that if you buy it on Amazon its really watered down and you cant smell it. Well...I tried the room spray last night and OMG it is sooooo strong! a little goes a looong way! I have not tried the other products yet But I was definitely impressed and it was the original smell no changes"
    },
    {
        "review": "Great candle"
    },
    {
        "review": "Diva is a must have in my house!  It smells absolutely amazing and keeps your clothes and house smelling amazing as well!"
    },
    {
        "review": "People will stop & ask you the name of your perfume/fragrance.  When it is in fact — a Laundry 🧺 product that has an amazingly fragrant smell that lingers beyond the wash."
    },
    {
        "review": "Great price for the different diva items you get. I wasn’t aware of the sizes to expect but for the price I am pleased! The room spray is full product size. (1) Car freshener , a small candle, and the cutest DETERGENT not scent boost or softener but detergent, so that was nice and unexpected. I guess I didn’t read the details so I was even more pleased than expected. Packaged perfect, safely wrapped for durability via mail truck routes to my lake place. Def a great gift idea or for yourself"
