[
    {
        "review": "I love this candle so much I am going to write a review for people choosing between this one and similar candles. First what you could maybe consider the one and only negative: its slightly more expensive then some. Let me assure you it is worth every penny. It’s highly gift able if you are looking for a gift anyone would love to receive one of these candles I guarantee it. It comes gift wrapped with a beautiful bow. Now my scent was the most wonderful rose with the mysterious oud floating in the background oh it’s mesmerizing! This candle is not a candle you light to cover up a stink okay it’s a candle you light for a warm and fuzzy feeling think date night or cozy ambiance, that being said after about 30 minutes my large room was smelling of rose not in an overwhelming way in a delicate way. The jar is also jaw dropping and a whole other review would be necessary for me to adequately describe its elegance. I will definitely be purchasing more candles. You will not regret this purchase!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I am obsessed with this rose (pink jar) candle. Not only do I love the fragrance,  you can actually smell it!! The best part is when the candles are gone, I melt all the leftover wax and store it for later to make another candle!! The jars are so gorgeous and my bedroom is a blush pink with gold accents.. the empty jars are perfect for storing my daughters hair clips and bows and they look just darling in my daughters room on her shelves.  When i 1st bought this, I literally only bought it because I thought it would look cute on my dresser. It's all over perfect! The smell, the jar, the packaging.  It's just amazing and it's so beautifully wrapped that you can take it just how it is and put a name tag on it to gift it.  Absolutely beautiful.  I have subscribed to save on these and every month I think,  maybe I'll skip a delivery,  but I never do because 1st of all,  I burn it all the time so it's always gone by the end of the month and 2nd,  I am just in love with the jars, I figured if I do have one leftover. It'll be a perfect gift for anyone I may have forgotten to get a gift for.  It seems very feminine but my husband even likes it.  He thinks it smells good too so.  It's a win win win in our house.  I have never received a broken one,  ever. In fact,  they come so well packaged, I'm always extra careful when unpacking it to make sure I don't drop it and break it myself.  I can't wait to try out the lavender one for my bathroom because it's purple and will look very chic in the bathroom just like it does in our bedroom. They burn ALL the way down.  I'm impressed with how little wax is actually left.I have 2 more empty jars that I still need to melt the wax from but I do love them.Did I mention that it smells SO GOOD!"
    },
    {
        "review": "I purchased the 19.4 Oz LA JOLIE MUSE Rose Noir & Oud Scented Candle.  It is a soy based candle with a wood wick, and it comes in a beautiful glass jar with a glass lid. It is a slow burning candle with a long burning time.Initially, I was drawn in by the gorgeous ornate-pink glass jar/lid, but was happy to see they had a Rose/Oud scent. The candle smells amazing!  It has a lovely rose scent but I wish it had just slightly more of the Oud scent, but I would buy this exact candle again!I would like to eventually try the other scents that are available and it is a win- win situation because of the pretty reusable jars.This would be the PERFECT gift for a candle or glass lover. Great product."
