        "review": "Nice product. Surprised the price was so reasonable. I'll definitely buy another pair. Wore it today on a bright sunny day driving and it was nice. Comfortable on my face. Not too tight, not too loose.  Curious how it would do wearing it walking around on a super-hot day about 90 degrees when I'm sweating all day. Probably would be fine. I'd say compared to that popular Maine store I bought a similar pair at, this one was $30 bucks cheaper. Love this pair from Feidusun. I like it better than other pairs I've bought since my peripheral vision isn't blocked since the sides aren't too thick. Better to wear these when driving, but if the sun is at a low angle at sunset to your left or light a little extra light is coming in, but that doesn't bother me. Good product."
