    {
        "review": "I own two different pair of Oakleys and these sun glasses especially the one that will be pictured in the photos(same pair just two different shades inside and out which is awesome)are better in quality and keeping my eyes shaded. I have blue eyes so idk if it’s the same with everyone else but the appearance also looks great. The fit was tight at first but over time it fit to my head. I work pest control so I’m outside a lot. I 10/10 recommend these. The price and the amount you get is insane and I will be buying more of this brand."
