        "review": "I normally don't write reviews but I must give credit where credit is due. These are the perfect dupe for the Gentle Monster HER sunglasses that you've seen everywhere in Kdramas and below deck sailing. I have a big, round, and semi-flat face so not many sunglasses fit/look great on me but these ones do! It's a bit oversized but that's exactly what I'm looking for. It fits nice on my low bridge nose and also does not touch my cheeks. The quality and feel is a bit cheap but it LOOKS high quality so that's why I don't mind at all. And the price point makes it an absolute STEAL! And it doesn't make me feel as guilty if it were to scratch it or lose it rather than spending $200 for the GM one. Overall SUPER happy with my purchase."
