        "review": "This review is for the Sungait Lightweight Rectangular Polarized Sunglasses. The over 54k reviews with an almost perfect 5 out of 5 star rating is in my opinion very much justified. The sunglasses are ultra light weight, provide clear visibility, fit well and stay on your face even when active. The UV protection helps protect your eyes and skin from damaging sun exposure. The sun glasses come with a nice silk type bag for storage and a soft cloth for keeping the lenses clean. A nice keychain screwdriver is also provided. The sunglasses are made well and I would expect them to last for years when properly cared for. I happened to catch these sunglasses on sale for less than 13 dollars US. For the great quality and price, I’m giving this bargain 5 out of 5 stars. I’ve owned some expensive sunglasses that were heavy and uncomfortable to wear for extended periods of time. From the scratch resistant lenses to the light weight frame, I’m not going back. These sunglasses even come with a little test image to verify the glare clarity, what’s not to love?"
