        "review": "I absolutely love these sunglasses! The retro round frame is very stylish and goes well with so many outfits. They give a trendy, fashionable look while still being practical for everyday wear.The polarized lenses make a big difference by reducing glare, especially on sunny days, and the UV protection gives me peace of mind when I’m outside for long periods.My eyes feel much more comfortable compared to regular sunglasses.They are also lightweight and fit nicely without slipping, which makes them perfect for all-day use. The quality feels great for the price, and they look even better in person.Overall, these sunglasses are a perfect mix of style, comfort, and protection. Highly recommend!"
    },
    {
        "review": "These came as a set of three and the colors are all different, so you are not stuck with three pairs that look identical. I will be honest, I do not particularly love this round retro style on myself, it is just not my usual look. But here is the good part, I was actually able to give one pair to my husband and it did not look feminine at all. The frame shape works on pretty much anyone, which was a nice surprise. The gold metal arms and the overall build feel sturdy enough for the price point, and they are not flimsy or cheap feeling.The lenses are polarized with UV protection so they actually do the job of cutting glare and blocking the sun. They have ergonomic nose pads and curved temple tips so they stay put without sliding down your face, which is a problem I have had with cheaper sunglasses before. They are lightweight too, so you can wear them for a while without your ears hurting. If you like the round retro look, you will probably love these. And if you do not, you might still find someone in your house who will wear them, which is basically what happened to me."
