        "review": "These sunglasses are lightweight and have durable well set frames. The metal arms are thin and do not press against my head while wearing the glasses. The plastic pieces that fit around my ear lobes are comfortable for all day wear. They are trendy glasses, and the black and leopard-brown pairs are both excellent looks. They fit a bit narrow at my wider nose, but still quite nice. Excellent set, overall!"
    },
    {
        "review": "The product matches the description perfectly. I’ve worn prescription glasses for nearsightedness since my teens, but after cataract surgery, my vision is corrected and I can now wear non-prescription sunglasses. I wasn’t expecting sunglasses of this quality. The frames are solid and the materials feel premium—actually better than some frames sold by opticians!The dimensions fit me perfectly, and I didn’t need to make any adjustments. I really like the shape—it’s exactly the style that was very popular in the 1980s. The lenses are polarized and work very well, reducing glare effectively.Overall, I’m extremely satisfied with these sunglasses and would highly recommend them for anyone looking for stylish, high-quality eyewear."
    },
