[
    {
        "review": "I have been really happy with this tripod. The 1.8 m height is very convenient because it gives me more options for taking photos and recording videos from different angles. It feels lightweight, easy to carry, and simple to set up.The Bluetooth remote control is a great feature because it allows me to take pictures or start recording without having to touch my phone. It connected easily and worked well during my use.I like that it is adjustable and practical for everyday use, whether for family photos, videos, or content creation. For the price, it is a useful and convenient accessory to have. I would recommend it to anyone looking for an affordable tripod with a good height and remote control."
