[
    {
        "review": "The phone stand is being used for simple stop-action short films and will work well.  The quality is decent,  a metal post with plastic base and rubbery, gummy phone mount that fits almost every phone/tablet I would imagine.  The item is adjustable from maybe 6 in. to 12in.,  but nothing less than 6 or more than 12.  The cost here is the selling point at $10.  I'm happy.Cheers.  The base is not a moveable point,  the upper half is moveable.  You can however easily disassemble it with one included allen tool and one screw. It is rubbery and grippy.  The color is black and grey."
