        "review": "This is a compact, multi-angle desk phone stand set designed to hold smartphones and small tablets hands-free in both portrait and landscape modes. Built with a foldable hinge mechanism and non-slip rubber pads, it provides stable desktop support for video calls, media streaming, and notification monitoring without tipping over. Coming in a budget-friendly 2-pack, it offers exceptional value for equipping multiple workstations, nightstands, or travel bags.Technical and Utility HighlightsConvenient 2-Pack Value: Includes two matching black stands, making it easy to keep one on your work desk and another on a bedside table, kitchen counter, or in your travel bag.Stable Upright Support: Engineered with a low center of gravity and non-slip base pads that keep your smartphone securely upright in both vertical and horizontal orientations.Fully Foldable & Pocket-Sized: Folds down completely flat into a sleek, compact profile for easy storage in pockets, backpacks, or laptop bags when on the go.Multi-Angle Viewing & Charging Pass-Through: Features an adjustable hinge so you can set your preferred viewing angle, alongside an open bottom cradle design that allows charging cables to pass through cleanly.Setup and Usage TipsOptimizing Angles for Video Calls: Adjust the hinge angle slightly backward to keep front-facing cameras at eye level during FaceTime or Zoom calls to avoid awkward overhead angles.Landscape vs. Portrait Orientation: Use portrait mode for quick notification checks and typing, and switch to landscape mode when watching movies or videos to maximize viewing area and overall stability.Easy Maintenance: Clean the non-slip rubber padding occasionally with a damp cloth to remove micro-dust and restore its original anti-skid grip on smooth desk surfaces.Final VerdictMade from durable, high-quality materials and remarkably simple to use right out of the box. It holds phones firmly upright without slipping, folds down flat for travel, and delivers outstanding value with its 2-pack configuration at a very fair price point. Highly recommended for remote workers, students, travelers, and anyone wanting convenient hands-free phone support around the house or office.Disclaimer: I received this product through the Amazon Vine program in exchange for an honest review."
