        "review": "This 2-pack of foldable desktop phone stands is hands down one of the sturdiest, most versatile holders I’ve ever used! The hinge tension and build quality are outstanding. Once you set your desired viewing angle and height extension, it locks firmly in place without drifting or wobbling. The weighted base and silicone non-slip grip pads provide exceptional balance, keeping your device upright even when placed on softer, uneven surfaces like a bed mattress. The base features a convenient open cutout so you can easily route a charging cable while docking your device. I am especially blown away by the hinge strength and load-bearing capacity: it effortlessly supports heavy, thick foldable phones like my Samsung Galaxy Z Fold 7, and it is even sturdy enough to hold a 16-inch portable monitor without collapsing or tipping! When not in use, it collapses completely flat into a compact, pocket-friendly footprint roughly the size of a standard smartphone. Getting two heavy-duty, highly portable stands at this price point is an incredible value, highly recommended!"
