        "review": "I bought this guitar a little over a month ago. At first, I noticed a few blemishes along with the tuning peg being rusty and paid no mind. The very first time I tuned, I noticed it making pop sound for a few tuning keys and was anxious the guitar was gonna break but didn’t think much about it.  I only played it a few times and picked it back up a week ago… As I tuned it again, the crack and pop sound continue to be made by the guitar, it seems to always make these sound when I tuned and the pin bridge got stuck. I could not get it back out and it broke. I’m afraid the guitar is not well built and although I considered getting parts of it refurbished at a store, I believe it would cost over than the guitar’s worth to get it all fixed. Everytime I tuned this guitar, I always get that anxiety that the crack sound is going to snap the guitar. I’m hoping to get even the slightest help over this. Please reach out, I am truly bummed about this."
