    {
        "review": "The construction quality and finish were fine, but the sound quality was below expectations.  I watched some youtube videos where I was sold on the amplified sound, but as acoustic only it's super tinny.  I tried to give it a chance, but I wa so disappointed aftet 5 minutes I put it back in the box and returned it."
    },
    {
        "review": "Very good electroacoustic guitar with excellent sound. In addition, it is very beautiful in its finishes. The measurements of the guitar to buy a case or case are: - Total length: 103cm (40 inches) - Widest part of the body: 38cm (15 inches) I bought a 42-inch case for the guitar, because I couldn't find the exact measurements. I recommend buying the 41-inch case, since the 42-inch case was too big for the guitar. I am adding some photos, since unfortunately there are few photos on AMAZON."
    },
    {
        "review": "Beautiful appearanceBeautiful soundLightweightComfortable"
