    {
        "review": "Looks beautiful.  Lovely tone to all but the top string which oddly - if I am being uber picky - sounds ever so slightly brassy so I will probably restring at some point.  Absolute joy to play though: although normally more of a strummer I feel the urge to finger pick with this guitar as the tone and the resonance are just lovely.  Tuner and preamp are fine - haven't played that much through an amp as it sounds so nice acoustically but they seem ok.  Overall absolutely delighted with it for the price."
    },
    {
        "review": "The guitar is a visual highlight. Workmanship without any noticeable defects. Plugged & unplugged a very nice balanced sound."
