        "review": "These guitar hanging wall mounts not only get these guitars off the ground for more floor space but look high end while doing it! The guitars fit so well and they have a rubber strap that go across once the guitar is hanging to make sure they don’t fall if for some reason someone hits it.. The durability is great, the color of the wood part with the black hanging part looks nice! Will be buying more for gifts… Highly recommend!"
