        "review": "The guitar seems ok as a beginner guitar however the zipper on the bag broke the 1st time it was touched causing disappointment for our grandson on Christmas morning.😥"
    },
    {
        "review": "Good value for money"
    },
    {
        "review": "Mon gars l'adore"
    }
