        "review": "I bought this for my son almost a year ago. We both think it's an excellent guitar. He loves it. It sounds great when he plays. Quality is very good. No issues or complaints at all. I am going to buy an acoustic soon and plan on getting another one."
    },
    {
        "review": "I have played hundreds of guitars never have I ever played one so terrible from the factory ever. 14 out of 22 frets buzz on every string  it wasn't setup whatsoever I've played busted old beauty's with 1000 times the sound quality. They expect me to pay for shipping back to the factory to remedy the situation. That's not acceptable when you purchase a precision instrument and its broken they should make it right. Thanks for cementing the idea of never buying ibanez ever again."
