        "review": "Great gig-bag!!!  Outstanding quality, just as nice as branded bags/cases (far better than many, actually) but extremely affordable.  Fits my daughter's brand new Yamaha FS800 perfectly (concert sized, 41\" I believe, but will also easily fit a traditional dreadnaught).  Large front pocket for books or sheet music, and plenty of accessory space.  The tan leather handles and accents are very nice.  I thought I would have preferred black until I saw it in person - quite handsome, and the gray is a nice change-up from all the traditional black bags/cases.  She loves it!  Lightweight but very sturdy.  Includes backpack-style straps as well as a leather reinforced side handle.  Quality construction, very functional and good protection with 1/2\" padding.  Cheap in price, but definitely NOT cheaply made!  Highly recommended!!!"
